('values:lms_course:26','O:31:\"Drupal\\lms_course\\Entity\\Course\":30:{s:15:\"\0*\0entityTypeId\";s:10:\"lms_course\";s:15:\"\0*\0enforceIsNew\";N;s:12:\"\0*\0typedData\";N;s:17:\"\0*\0originalEntity\";N;s:16:\"\0*\0cacheContexts\";a:0:{}s:12:\"\0*\0cacheTags\";a:0:{}s:14:\"\0*\0cacheMaxAge\";i:-1;s:14:\"\0*\0_serviceIds\";a:0:{}s:18:\"\0*\0_entityStorages\";a:0:{}s:9:\"\0*\0values\";a:26:{s:2:\"id\";a:1:{s:9:\"x-default\";s:2:\"26\";}s:4:\"uuid\";a:1:{s:9:\"x-default\";s:36:\"af08b092-26ff-4831-af57-ad35cb7b1fe3\";}s:8:\"langcode\";a:1:{s:9:\"x-default\";s:2:\"en\";}s:3:\"uid\";a:1:{s:9:\"x-default\";s:1:\"1\";}s:4:\"name\";a:1:{s:9:\"x-default\";s:39:\"Introduction to AI for Business Leaders\";}s:17:\"field_description\";a:1:{s:9:\"x-default\";a:2:{s:5:\"value\";s:1997:\"<p>In today\'s rapidly evolving business landscape, Artificial Intelligence (AI) is no longer a futuristic concept but a present-day imperative. For business leaders, understanding AI isn\'t just about technology; it\'s about strategy, competitive advantage, and future-proofing their organizations.</p><p>This comprehensive course, <strong>Introduction to AI for Business Leaders</strong>, is meticulously designed to demystify AI, translating complex technical jargon into actionable business insights. You\'ll embark on a journey that explores the core principles of AI, its various forms, and its profound impact across different industries.</p><h3>What You\'ll Explore:</h3><ul>    <li><strong>The AI Landscape:</strong> Grasp the current state of AI and its historical evolution, understanding where we are and where we\'re headed.</li>    <li><strong>Key AI Technologies:</strong> Learn about machine learning, deep learning, natural language processing, and computer vision – not from a developer\'s perspective, but from a strategic decision-maker\'s viewpoint.</li>    <li><strong>Real-World Business Applications:</strong> Discover how AI is being successfully applied in areas like customer service, operations, marketing, finance, and human resources, driving efficiency and innovation.</li>    <li><strong>Identifying Opportunities:</strong> Develop the ability to spot potential AI applications within your own organization, aligning AI initiatives with core business objectives.</li>    <li><strong>Strategic Implications:</strong> Understand the opportunities and challenges AI presents, including data requirements, talent needs, and organizational readiness.</li></ul><p>By the end of this course, you won\'t just know <em>what</em> AI is; you\'ll understand <em>how</em> to leverage its power to drive growth, foster innovation, and maintain a competitive edge in the digital age. Equip yourself with the essential knowledge to lead your team confidently into an AI-powered future.</p>\";s:6:\"format\";s:9:\"full_html\";}}s:23:\"field_short_description\";a:1:{s:9:\"x-default\";a:2:{s:5:\"value\";s:257:\"Discover the fundamental concepts of Artificial Intelligence and its transformative potential for modern businesses. This course equips leaders with the knowledge to understand, evaluate, and strategically integrate AI applications into their organizations.\";s:6:\"format\";s:9:\"full_html\";}}s:15:\"field_thumbnail\";a:1:{s:9:\"x-default\";a:5:{s:9:\"target_id\";s:2:\"64\";s:3:\"alt\";s:51:\"Introduction to AI for Business Leaders Cover Image\";s:5:\"title\";N;s:5:\"width\";s:3:\"640\";s:6:\"height\";s:3:\"640\";}}s:12:\"field_banner\";a:1:{s:9:\"x-default\";a:5:{s:9:\"target_id\";N;s:3:\"alt\";N;s:5:\"title\";N;s:5:\"width\";N;s:6:\"height\";N;}}s:14:\"field_category\";a:1:{s:9:\"x-default\";s:2:\"53\";}s:11:\"field_level\";a:1:{s:9:\"x-default\";s:1:\"1\";}s:14:\"field_language\";a:1:{s:9:\"x-default\";N;}s:11:\"field_price\";a:1:{s:9:\"x-default\";s:4:\"0.00\";}s:16:\"field_price_type\";a:1:{s:9:\"x-default\";s:4:\"free\";}s:14:\"field_duration\";a:1:{s:9:\"x-default\";s:3:\"210\";}s:16:\"field_bestseller\";a:1:{s:9:\"x-default\";s:1:\"1\";}s:14:\"field_featured\";a:1:{s:9:\"x-default\";s:1:\"1\";}s:6:\"status\";a:1:{s:9:\"x-default\";s:1:\"1\";}s:7:\"created\";a:1:{s:9:\"x-default\";s:10:\"1774442931\";}s:7:\"changed\";a:1:{s:9:\"x-default\";s:10:\"1774451280\";}s:16:\"default_langcode\";a:1:{s:9:\"x-default\";s:1:\"1\";}s:16:\"field_what_learn\";a:1:{s:9:\"x-default\";a:2:{s:5:\"value\";s:715:\"- Define Artificial Intelligence and its core concepts from a business perspective.\n- Identify the key types of AI technologies, including Machine Learning, Deep Learning, Natural Language Processing, and Computer Vision.\n- Understand the current landscape of AI applications across various business functions and industries.\n- Evaluate the potential impact of AI on business operations, strategy, and competitive advantage.\n- Recognize opportunities for integrating AI solutions to solve business challenges and drive innovation.\n- Develop a foundational understanding of the strategic considerations for adopting AI within an organization.\n- Communicate effectively about AI with technical teams and stakeholders.\";s:6:\"format\";s:9:\"full_html\";}}s:19:\"field_prerequisites\";a:1:{s:9:\"x-default\";a:2:{s:5:\"value\";s:211:\"No prior technical knowledge of AI or programming is required. A basic understanding of business operations and strategic thinking is beneficial. This course is designed for non-technical business professionals.\";s:6:\"format\";s:9:\"full_html\";}}s:13:\"field_who_for\";a:1:{s:9:\"x-default\";a:2:{s:5:\"value\";s:292:\"- Business leaders, executives, and senior managers\n- Department heads and team leads\n- Entrepreneurs and startup founders\n- Consultants and strategists\n- Professionals seeking to understand AI\'s impact on their industry\n- Anyone interested in leveraging AI for business growth and innovation\";s:6:\"format\";s:9:\"full_html\";}}s:12:\"field_rating\";a:1:{s:9:\"x-default\";s:3:\"5.0\";}s:14:\"field_chapters\";a:1:{s:9:\"x-default\";a:2:{i:0;a:1:{s:9:\"target_id\";s:2:\"83\";}i:1;a:1:{s:9:\"target_id\";s:2:\"84\";}}}}s:9:\"\0*\0fields\";a:0:{}s:19:\"\0*\0fieldDefinitions\";N;s:12:\"\0*\0languages\";N;s:14:\"\0*\0langcodeKey\";s:8:\"langcode\";s:21:\"\0*\0defaultLangcodeKey\";s:16:\"default_langcode\";s:17:\"\0*\0activeLangcode\";s:9:\"x-default\";s:28:\"\0*\0enforceDefaultTranslation\";N;s:18:\"\0*\0defaultLangcode\";s:2:\"en\";s:15:\"\0*\0translations\";a:1:{s:9:\"x-default\";a:1:{s:6:\"status\";i:1;}}s:24:\"\0*\0translationInitialize\";b:0;s:14:\"\0*\0newRevision\";b:0;s:20:\"\0*\0isDefaultRevision\";b:1;s:13:\"\0*\0entityKeys\";a:4:{s:6:\"bundle\";s:10:\"lms_course\";s:2:\"id\";s:2:\"26\";s:4:\"uuid\";s:36:\"af08b092-26ff-4831-af57-ad35cb7b1fe3\";s:9:\"published\";s:1:\"1\";}s:25:\"\0*\0translatableEntityKeys\";a:4:{s:5:\"label\";a:1:{s:9:\"x-default\";s:39:\"Introduction to AI for Business Leaders\";}s:8:\"langcode\";a:1:{s:9:\"x-default\";s:2:\"en\";}s:5:\"owner\";a:1:{s:9:\"x-default\";s:1:\"1\";}s:16:\"default_langcode\";a:1:{s:9:\"x-default\";s:1:\"1\";}}s:12:\"\0*\0validated\";b:0;s:21:\"\0*\0validationRequired\";b:0;s:19:\"\0*\0loadedRevisionId\";N;s:33:\"\0*\0revisionTranslationAffectedKey\";s:29:\"revision_translation_affected\";s:37:\"\0*\0enforceRevisionTranslationAffected\";a:0:{}s:12:\"\0*\0isSyncing\";b:0;}',-1,1774587022.768,1,'entity_field_info','0'),
('values:lms_course:27','O:31:\"Drupal\\lms_course\\Entity\\Course\":30:{s:15:\"\0*\0entityTypeId\";s:10:\"lms_course\";s:15:\"\0*\0enforceIsNew\";N;s:12:\"\0*\0typedData\";N;s:17:\"\0*\0originalEntity\";N;s:16:\"\0*\0cacheContexts\";a:0:{}s:12:\"\0*\0cacheTags\";a:0:{}s:14:\"\0*\0cacheMaxAge\";i:-1;s:14:\"\0*\0_serviceIds\";a:0:{}s:18:\"\0*\0_entityStorages\";a:0:{}s:9:\"\0*\0values\";a:26:{s:2:\"id\";a:1:{s:9:\"x-default\";s:2:\"27\";}s:4:\"uuid\";a:1:{s:9:\"x-default\";s:36:\"e2daff04-7089-4c37-a1dc-a6324f2ddd7a\";}s:8:\"langcode\";a:1:{s:9:\"x-default\";s:2:\"en\";}s:3:\"uid\";a:1:{s:9:\"x-default\";s:1:\"1\";}s:4:\"name\";a:1:{s:9:\"x-default\";s:55:\"Understanding AI Technologies and Their Business Impact\";}s:17:\"field_description\";a:1:{s:9:\"x-default\";a:2:{s:5:\"value\";s:2173:\"<p>In today\'s rapidly evolving business landscape, Artificial Intelligence (AI) is no longer a futuristic concept but a present-day imperative for growth and innovation. This course, <strong>Understanding AI Technologies and Their Business Impact</strong>, is designed to demystify the core components of AI and illuminate how these powerful technologies are reshaping industries, optimizing operations, and creating unprecedented opportunities across the enterprise.</p><p>You\'ll embark on a comprehensive journey, starting with an exploration of fundamental AI concepts such as Machine Learning, Deep Learning, Natural Language Processing (NLP), and Computer Vision. We\'ll break down complex algorithms into understandable applications, demonstrating how these technologies power everything from personalized customer experiences and predictive analytics to automated processes and intelligent decision-making.</p><p>Beyond the technical aspects, this course places a strong emphasis on the strategic business implications. You will learn to identify areas within your organization where AI can deliver the most significant value, mitigate risks, and foster a culture of data-driven innovation. Through real-world case studies and practical examples, you\'ll gain the insights needed to confidently evaluate, implement, and manage AI initiatives, ensuring your business stays ahead of the curve.</p><h3>What You Will Gain:</h3><ul>    <li>A clear understanding of various AI technologies and their unique capabilities.</li>    <li>The ability to connect AI concepts to tangible business problems and solutions.</li>    <li>Insights into successful AI adoption strategies across different industries.</li>    <li>A framework for assessing the potential impact and ROI of AI projects.</li>    <li>The knowledge to engage effectively with technical teams and stakeholders on AI initiatives.</li></ul><p>Whether you\'re a business leader looking to harness AI\'s potential, a manager seeking to optimize operations, or a professional aiming to stay relevant in the AI era, this course provides the essential knowledge to navigate and leverage the transformative power of AI.</p>\";s:6:\"format\";s:9:\"full_html\";}}s:23:\"field_short_description\";a:1:{s:9:\"x-default\";a:2:{s:5:\"value\";s:197:\"Explore core AI technologies such as Machine Learning, NLP, and Computer Vision, and understand their strategic business applications to drive innovation and competitive advantage in the workplace.\";s:6:\"format\";s:9:\"full_html\";}}s:15:\"field_thumbnail\";a:1:{s:9:\"x-default\";a:5:{s:9:\"target_id\";s:2:\"65\";s:3:\"alt\";s:67:\"Understanding AI Technologies and Their Business Impact Cover Image\";s:5:\"title\";N;s:5:\"width\";s:3:\"640\";s:6:\"height\";s:3:\"640\";}}s:12:\"field_banner\";a:1:{s:9:\"x-default\";a:5:{s:9:\"target_id\";N;s:3:\"alt\";N;s:5:\"title\";N;s:5:\"width\";N;s:6:\"height\";N;}}s:14:\"field_category\";a:1:{s:9:\"x-default\";s:2:\"53\";}s:11:\"field_level\";a:1:{s:9:\"x-default\";s:1:\"1\";}s:14:\"field_language\";a:1:{s:9:\"x-default\";N;}s:11:\"field_price\";a:1:{s:9:\"x-default\";s:6:\"199.99\";}s:16:\"field_price_type\";a:1:{s:9:\"x-default\";s:4:\"paid\";}s:14:\"field_duration\";a:1:{s:9:\"x-default\";s:3:\"240\";}s:16:\"field_bestseller\";a:1:{s:9:\"x-default\";s:1:\"1\";}s:14:\"field_featured\";a:1:{s:9:\"x-default\";s:1:\"1\";}s:6:\"status\";a:1:{s:9:\"x-default\";s:1:\"1\";}s:7:\"created\";a:1:{s:9:\"x-default\";s:10:\"1774442931\";}s:7:\"changed\";a:1:{s:9:\"x-default\";s:10:\"1774451280\";}s:16:\"default_langcode\";a:1:{s:9:\"x-default\";s:1:\"1\";}s:16:\"field_what_learn\";a:1:{s:9:\"x-default\";a:2:{s:5:\"value\";s:755:\"<ul>    <li>Identify and define core AI technologies, including Machine Learning, Deep Learning, Natural Language Processing, and Computer Vision.</li>    <li>Understand the practical applications of each AI technology across various business functions and industries.</li>    <li>Analyze how AI can drive business value, improve efficiency, enhance customer experience, and foster innovation.</li>    <li>Evaluate the potential impact of AI on different organizational structures and operational processes.</li>    <li>Recognize the challenges and opportunities associated with integrating AI into existing business models.</li>    <li>Develop a foundational understanding of how to assess and prioritize AI initiatives for strategic advantage.</li></ul>\";s:6:\"format\";s:9:\"full_html\";}}s:19:\"field_prerequisites\";a:1:{s:9:\"x-default\";a:2:{s:5:\"value\";s:323:\"<p>While no prior technical expertise in AI or programming is required, a basic understanding of business operations and a keen interest in technological innovation will be beneficial. This course is designed for professionals eager to grasp the strategic implications of AI rather than its intricate technical details.</p>\";s:6:\"format\";s:9:\"full_html\";}}s:13:\"field_who_for\";a:1:{s:9:\"x-default\";a:2:{s:5:\"value\";s:742:\"<ul>    <li><strong>Business Leaders and Executives:</strong> Seeking to understand AI\'s strategic potential and integrate it into their long-term vision.</li>    <li><strong>Department Managers and Team Leads:</strong> Interested in leveraging AI to optimize operations, improve decision-making, and enhance productivity within their teams.</li>    <li><strong>Consultants and Strategists:</strong> Advising clients on digital transformation and AI adoption.</li>    <li><strong>Entrepreneurs and Innovators:</strong> Exploring new business models and opportunities enabled by AI.</li>    <li><strong>Professionals in Any Industry:</strong> Who want to understand how AI is reshaping their field and prepare for the future of work.</li></ul>\";s:6:\"format\";s:9:\"full_html\";}}s:12:\"field_rating\";a:1:{s:9:\"x-default\";s:3:\"5.0\";}s:14:\"field_chapters\";a:1:{s:9:\"x-default\";a:2:{i:0;a:1:{s:9:\"target_id\";s:2:\"85\";}i:1;a:1:{s:9:\"target_id\";s:2:\"86\";}}}}s:9:\"\0*\0fields\";a:0:{}s:19:\"\0*\0fieldDefinitions\";N;s:12:\"\0*\0languages\";N;s:14:\"\0*\0langcodeKey\";s:8:\"langcode\";s:21:\"\0*\0defaultLangcodeKey\";s:16:\"default_langcode\";s:17:\"\0*\0activeLangcode\";s:9:\"x-default\";s:28:\"\0*\0enforceDefaultTranslation\";N;s:18:\"\0*\0defaultLangcode\";s:2:\"en\";s:15:\"\0*\0translations\";a:1:{s:9:\"x-default\";a:1:{s:6:\"status\";i:1;}}s:24:\"\0*\0translationInitialize\";b:0;s:14:\"\0*\0newRevision\";b:0;s:20:\"\0*\0isDefaultRevision\";b:1;s:13:\"\0*\0entityKeys\";a:4:{s:6:\"bundle\";s:10:\"lms_course\";s:2:\"id\";s:2:\"27\";s:4:\"uuid\";s:36:\"e2daff04-7089-4c37-a1dc-a6324f2ddd7a\";s:9:\"published\";s:1:\"1\";}s:25:\"\0*\0translatableEntityKeys\";a:4:{s:5:\"label\";a:1:{s:9:\"x-default\";s:55:\"Understanding AI Technologies and Their Business Impact\";}s:8:\"langcode\";a:1:{s:9:\"x-default\";s:2:\"en\";}s:5:\"owner\";a:1:{s:9:\"x-default\";s:1:\"1\";}s:16:\"default_langcode\";a:1:{s:9:\"x-default\";s:1:\"1\";}}s:12:\"\0*\0validated\";b:0;s:21:\"\0*\0validationRequired\";b:0;s:19:\"\0*\0loadedRevisionId\";N;s:33:\"\0*\0revisionTranslationAffectedKey\";s:29:\"revision_translation_affected\";s:37:\"\0*\0enforceRevisionTranslationAffected\";a:0:{}s:12:\"\0*\0isSyncing\";b:0;}',-1,1774587022.768,1,'entity_field_info','0'),
('values:lms_course:28','O:31:\"Drupal\\lms_course\\Entity\\Course\":30:{s:15:\"\0*\0entityTypeId\";s:10:\"lms_course\";s:15:\"\0*\0enforceIsNew\";N;s:12:\"\0*\0typedData\";N;s:17:\"\0*\0originalEntity\";N;s:16:\"\0*\0cacheContexts\";a:0:{}s:12:\"\0*\0cacheTags\";a:0:{}s:14:\"\0*\0cacheMaxAge\";i:-1;s:14:\"\0*\0_serviceIds\";a:0:{}s:18:\"\0*\0_entityStorages\";a:0:{}s:9:\"\0*\0values\";a:26:{s:2:\"id\";a:1:{s:9:\"x-default\";s:2:\"28\";}s:4:\"uuid\";a:1:{s:9:\"x-default\";s:36:\"aa97f3f9-dd00-4731-b598-a61f4097ffbf\";}s:8:\"langcode\";a:1:{s:9:\"x-default\";s:2:\"en\";}s:3:\"uid\";a:1:{s:9:\"x-default\";s:1:\"1\";}s:4:\"name\";a:1:{s:9:\"x-default\";s:41:\"Ethical AI and Responsible Implementation\";}s:17:\"field_description\";a:1:{s:9:\"x-default\";a:2:{s:5:\"value\";s:1272:\"<p>As Artificial Intelligence rapidly integrates into business operations, understanding and managing its ethical implications becomes paramount. This course, <b>\"Ethical AI and Responsible Implementation,\"</b> dives deep into the complex world of AI ethics, equipping business leaders and professionals with the knowledge and tools to navigate this crucial landscape.</p><p>You will explore key ethical principles, learn to identify potential biases and discriminatory outcomes in AI systems, and understand the importance of transparency, accountability, and fairness. We\'ll cover practical frameworks and best practices for developing and deploying AI responsibly, ensuring compliance with evolving regulations, and fostering trust among users and stakeholders.</p><p>By the end of this course, you will be able to:</p><ul><li>Identify and assess ethical risks associated with AI applications.</li><li>Apply principles of fairness, transparency, and accountability to AI projects.</li><li>Develop strategies for responsible AI governance and compliance.</li><li>Build a culture of ethical AI within your organization.</li></ul><p>Join us to ensure your organization harnesses the power of AI not just for profit, but for progress, responsibility, and societal good.</p>\";s:6:\"format\";s:9:\"full_html\";}}s:23:\"field_short_description\";a:1:{s:9:\"x-default\";a:2:{s:5:\"value\";s:207:\"Explore the critical ethical considerations and responsible implementation strategies for AI in the workplace. Learn to identify, mitigate, and govern AI risks to build trustworthy and beneficial AI systems.\";s:6:\"format\";s:9:\"full_html\";}}s:15:\"field_thumbnail\";a:1:{s:9:\"x-default\";a:5:{s:9:\"target_id\";s:2:\"66\";s:3:\"alt\";s:53:\"Ethical AI and Responsible Implementation Cover Image\";s:5:\"title\";N;s:5:\"width\";s:3:\"640\";s:6:\"height\";s:3:\"640\";}}s:12:\"field_banner\";a:1:{s:9:\"x-default\";a:5:{s:9:\"target_id\";N;s:3:\"alt\";N;s:5:\"title\";N;s:5:\"width\";N;s:6:\"height\";N;}}s:14:\"field_category\";a:1:{s:9:\"x-default\";s:2:\"53\";}s:11:\"field_level\";a:1:{s:9:\"x-default\";s:1:\"2\";}s:14:\"field_language\";a:1:{s:9:\"x-default\";N;}s:11:\"field_price\";a:1:{s:9:\"x-default\";s:6:\"199.99\";}s:16:\"field_price_type\";a:1:{s:9:\"x-default\";s:4:\"paid\";}s:14:\"field_duration\";a:1:{s:9:\"x-default\";s:3:\"180\";}s:16:\"field_bestseller\";a:1:{s:9:\"x-default\";s:1:\"1\";}s:14:\"field_featured\";a:1:{s:9:\"x-default\";s:1:\"1\";}s:6:\"status\";a:1:{s:9:\"x-default\";s:1:\"1\";}s:7:\"created\";a:1:{s:9:\"x-default\";s:10:\"1774442931\";}s:7:\"changed\";a:1:{s:9:\"x-default\";s:10:\"1774451280\";}s:16:\"default_langcode\";a:1:{s:9:\"x-default\";s:1:\"1\";}s:16:\"field_what_learn\";a:1:{s:9:\"x-default\";a:2:{s:5:\"value\";s:670:\"<ul><li>Understand the fundamental ethical challenges and considerations posed by AI in business.</li><li>Identify and mitigate biases, discrimination, and privacy risks in AI systems.</li><li>Apply principles of transparency, fairness, and accountability in AI development and deployment.</li><li>Develop robust governance frameworks and policies for responsible AI implementation.</li><li>Navigate emerging regulations and standards related to AI ethics and data protection.</li><li>Foster a culture of ethical awareness and responsible innovation within your organization.</li><li>Evaluate the societal impact of AI and advocate for human-centric AI design.</li></ul>\";s:6:\"format\";s:9:\"full_html\";}}s:19:\"field_prerequisites\";a:1:{s:9:\"x-default\";a:2:{s:5:\"value\";s:269:\"A basic understanding of Artificial Intelligence concepts and its general applications in business is recommended. No prior deep technical knowledge of AI development is required, but familiarity with business processes and strategic decision-making will be beneficial.\";s:6:\"format\";s:9:\"full_html\";}}s:13:\"field_who_for\";a:1:{s:9:\"x-default\";a:2:{s:5:\"value\";s:404:\"<ul><li>Business Leaders and Executives</li><li>Project Managers overseeing AI initiatives</li><li>Data Scientists and AI Developers interested in ethical considerations</li><li>Compliance Officers and Legal Professionals</li><li>HR Professionals involved in AI-driven hiring or workforce management</li><li>Anyone responsible for developing, deploying, or managing AI systems in the workplace.</li></ul>\";s:6:\"format\";s:9:\"full_html\";}}s:12:\"field_rating\";a:1:{s:9:\"x-default\";s:3:\"5.0\";}s:14:\"field_chapters\";a:1:{s:9:\"x-default\";a:2:{i:0;a:1:{s:9:\"target_id\";s:2:\"87\";}i:1;a:1:{s:9:\"target_id\";s:2:\"88\";}}}}s:9:\"\0*\0fields\";a:0:{}s:19:\"\0*\0fieldDefinitions\";N;s:12:\"\0*\0languages\";N;s:14:\"\0*\0langcodeKey\";s:8:\"langcode\";s:21:\"\0*\0defaultLangcodeKey\";s:16:\"default_langcode\";s:17:\"\0*\0activeLangcode\";s:9:\"x-default\";s:28:\"\0*\0enforceDefaultTranslation\";N;s:18:\"\0*\0defaultLangcode\";s:2:\"en\";s:15:\"\0*\0translations\";a:1:{s:9:\"x-default\";a:1:{s:6:\"status\";i:1;}}s:24:\"\0*\0translationInitialize\";b:0;s:14:\"\0*\0newRevision\";b:0;s:20:\"\0*\0isDefaultRevision\";b:1;s:13:\"\0*\0entityKeys\";a:4:{s:6:\"bundle\";s:10:\"lms_course\";s:2:\"id\";s:2:\"28\";s:4:\"uuid\";s:36:\"aa97f3f9-dd00-4731-b598-a61f4097ffbf\";s:9:\"published\";s:1:\"1\";}s:25:\"\0*\0translatableEntityKeys\";a:4:{s:5:\"label\";a:1:{s:9:\"x-default\";s:41:\"Ethical AI and Responsible Implementation\";}s:8:\"langcode\";a:1:{s:9:\"x-default\";s:2:\"en\";}s:5:\"owner\";a:1:{s:9:\"x-default\";s:1:\"1\";}s:16:\"default_langcode\";a:1:{s:9:\"x-default\";s:1:\"1\";}}s:12:\"\0*\0validated\";b:0;s:21:\"\0*\0validationRequired\";b:0;s:19:\"\0*\0loadedRevisionId\";N;s:33:\"\0*\0revisionTranslationAffectedKey\";s:29:\"revision_translation_affected\";s:37:\"\0*\0enforceRevisionTranslationAffected\";a:0:{}s:12:\"\0*\0isSyncing\";b:0;}',-1,1774587022.768,1,'entity_field_info','0'),
('values:lms_course:29','O:31:\"Drupal\\lms_course\\Entity\\Course\":30:{s:15:\"\0*\0entityTypeId\";s:10:\"lms_course\";s:15:\"\0*\0enforceIsNew\";N;s:12:\"\0*\0typedData\";N;s:17:\"\0*\0originalEntity\";N;s:16:\"\0*\0cacheContexts\";a:0:{}s:12:\"\0*\0cacheTags\";a:0:{}s:14:\"\0*\0cacheMaxAge\";i:-1;s:14:\"\0*\0_serviceIds\";a:0:{}s:18:\"\0*\0_entityStorages\";a:0:{}s:9:\"\0*\0values\";a:26:{s:2:\"id\";a:1:{s:9:\"x-default\";s:2:\"29\";}s:4:\"uuid\";a:1:{s:9:\"x-default\";s:36:\"0d00c476-8f61-460f-a3d4-dd5fd7e7567a\";}s:8:\"langcode\";a:1:{s:9:\"x-default\";s:2:\"en\";}s:3:\"uid\";a:1:{s:9:\"x-default\";s:1:\"1\";}s:4:\"name\";a:1:{s:9:\"x-default\";s:47:\"Developing an AI Strategy for Your Organization\";}s:17:\"field_description\";a:1:{s:9:\"x-default\";a:2:{s:5:\"value\";s:1174:\"<p>In today\'s rapidly evolving business landscape, Artificial Intelligence (AI) is no longer a futuristic concept but a strategic imperative. Organizations that fail to develop a clear and actionable AI strategy risk falling behind their competitors.</p><p>This course, <strong>\"Developing an AI Strategy for Your Organization,\"</strong> provides a practical framework for business leaders, managers, and aspiring strategists to navigate the complexities of AI adoption. You will learn how to identify high-impact AI opportunities, assess your organization\'s readiness, and build a roadmap for successful AI integration.</p><p>We delve into key areas such as defining AI vision and objectives, evaluating technological capabilities, managing data governance, understanding ethical considerations, and fostering a culture of innovation. Through real-world case studies and actionable insights, you will gain the confidence to lead your organization\'s AI transformation journey.</p><p>Equip yourself with the knowledge and tools to create a robust AI strategy that not only leverages cutting-edge technology but also aligns with your company\'s values and long-term vision.</p>\";s:6:\"format\";s:9:\"full_html\";}}s:23:\"field_short_description\";a:1:{s:9:\"x-default\";a:2:{s:5:\"value\";s:168:\"Learn to formulate a comprehensive AI strategy that aligns with your business goals, drives innovation, and ensures responsible implementation within your organization.\";s:6:\"format\";s:9:\"full_html\";}}s:15:\"field_thumbnail\";a:1:{s:9:\"x-default\";a:5:{s:9:\"target_id\";s:2:\"67\";s:3:\"alt\";s:59:\"Developing an AI Strategy for Your Organization Cover Image\";s:5:\"title\";N;s:5:\"width\";s:3:\"640\";s:6:\"height\";s:3:\"640\";}}s:12:\"field_banner\";a:1:{s:9:\"x-default\";a:5:{s:9:\"target_id\";N;s:3:\"alt\";N;s:5:\"title\";N;s:5:\"width\";N;s:6:\"height\";N;}}s:14:\"field_category\";a:1:{s:9:\"x-default\";s:2:\"53\";}s:11:\"field_level\";a:1:{s:9:\"x-default\";s:1:\"3\";}s:14:\"field_language\";a:1:{s:9:\"x-default\";N;}s:11:\"field_price\";a:1:{s:9:\"x-default\";s:4:\"0.00\";}s:16:\"field_price_type\";a:1:{s:9:\"x-default\";s:4:\"free\";}s:14:\"field_duration\";a:1:{s:9:\"x-default\";s:3:\"210\";}s:16:\"field_bestseller\";a:1:{s:9:\"x-default\";s:1:\"0\";}s:14:\"field_featured\";a:1:{s:9:\"x-default\";s:1:\"1\";}s:6:\"status\";a:1:{s:9:\"x-default\";s:1:\"1\";}s:7:\"created\";a:1:{s:9:\"x-default\";s:10:\"1774442931\";}s:7:\"changed\";a:1:{s:9:\"x-default\";s:10:\"1774451280\";}s:16:\"default_langcode\";a:1:{s:9:\"x-default\";s:1:\"1\";}s:16:\"field_what_learn\";a:1:{s:9:\"x-default\";a:2:{s:5:\"value\";s:608:\"<ul><li>Understand the critical components of a successful AI strategy.</li><li>Identify and prioritize high-value AI use cases relevant to your business.</li><li>Assess your organization\'s current AI maturity and readiness.</li><li>Develop a clear AI vision, goals, and key performance indicators (KPIs).</li><li>Formulate a data strategy that supports AI initiatives.</li><li>Address ethical considerations and ensure responsible AI implementation.</li><li>Build a roadmap for AI adoption, including resource allocation and change management.</li><li>Measure the impact and ROI of AI investments.</li></ul>\";s:6:\"format\";s:9:\"full_html\";}}s:19:\"field_prerequisites\";a:1:{s:9:\"x-default\";a:2:{s:5:\"value\";s:141:\"No prior technical AI knowledge is required. A basic understanding of business operations and strategic planning concepts will be beneficial.\";s:6:\"format\";s:9:\"full_html\";}}s:13:\"field_who_for\";a:1:{s:9:\"x-default\";a:2:{s:5:\"value\";s:429:\"<ul><li>Business leaders and executives looking to integrate AI into their strategic planning.</li><li>Department heads and managers responsible for driving innovation.</li><li>Strategy consultants and business analysts advising on AI adoption.</li><li>Entrepreneurs and startup founders exploring AI-driven growth.</li><li>Anyone interested in understanding how to build a practical AI strategy for their organization.</li></ul>\";s:6:\"format\";s:9:\"full_html\";}}s:12:\"field_rating\";a:1:{s:9:\"x-default\";s:3:\"5.0\";}s:14:\"field_chapters\";a:1:{s:9:\"x-default\";a:2:{i:0;a:1:{s:9:\"target_id\";s:2:\"89\";}i:1;a:1:{s:9:\"target_id\";s:2:\"90\";}}}}s:9:\"\0*\0fields\";a:0:{}s:19:\"\0*\0fieldDefinitions\";N;s:12:\"\0*\0languages\";N;s:14:\"\0*\0langcodeKey\";s:8:\"langcode\";s:21:\"\0*\0defaultLangcodeKey\";s:16:\"default_langcode\";s:17:\"\0*\0activeLangcode\";s:9:\"x-default\";s:28:\"\0*\0enforceDefaultTranslation\";N;s:18:\"\0*\0defaultLangcode\";s:2:\"en\";s:15:\"\0*\0translations\";a:1:{s:9:\"x-default\";a:1:{s:6:\"status\";i:1;}}s:24:\"\0*\0translationInitialize\";b:0;s:14:\"\0*\0newRevision\";b:0;s:20:\"\0*\0isDefaultRevision\";b:1;s:13:\"\0*\0entityKeys\";a:4:{s:6:\"bundle\";s:10:\"lms_course\";s:2:\"id\";s:2:\"29\";s:4:\"uuid\";s:36:\"0d00c476-8f61-460f-a3d4-dd5fd7e7567a\";s:9:\"published\";s:1:\"1\";}s:25:\"\0*\0translatableEntityKeys\";a:4:{s:5:\"label\";a:1:{s:9:\"x-default\";s:47:\"Developing an AI Strategy for Your Organization\";}s:8:\"langcode\";a:1:{s:9:\"x-default\";s:2:\"en\";}s:5:\"owner\";a:1:{s:9:\"x-default\";s:1:\"1\";}s:16:\"default_langcode\";a:1:{s:9:\"x-default\";s:1:\"1\";}}s:12:\"\0*\0validated\";b:0;s:21:\"\0*\0validationRequired\";b:0;s:19:\"\0*\0loadedRevisionId\";N;s:33:\"\0*\0revisionTranslationAffectedKey\";s:29:\"revision_translation_affected\";s:37:\"\0*\0enforceRevisionTranslationAffected\";a:0:{}s:12:\"\0*\0isSyncing\";b:0;}',-1,1774587022.768,1,'entity_field_info','0'),
('values:lms_course:30','O:31:\"Drupal\\lms_course\\Entity\\Course\":30:{s:15:\"\0*\0entityTypeId\";s:10:\"lms_course\";s:15:\"\0*\0enforceIsNew\";N;s:12:\"\0*\0typedData\";N;s:17:\"\0*\0originalEntity\";N;s:16:\"\0*\0cacheContexts\";a:0:{}s:12:\"\0*\0cacheTags\";a:0:{}s:14:\"\0*\0cacheMaxAge\";i:-1;s:14:\"\0*\0_serviceIds\";a:0:{}s:18:\"\0*\0_entityStorages\";a:0:{}s:9:\"\0*\0values\";a:26:{s:2:\"id\";a:1:{s:9:\"x-default\";s:2:\"30\";}s:4:\"uuid\";a:1:{s:9:\"x-default\";s:36:\"a36128f0-ac67-4f39-96e4-da7182411134\";}s:8:\"langcode\";a:1:{s:9:\"x-default\";s:2:\"en\";}s:3:\"uid\";a:1:{s:9:\"x-default\";s:1:\"1\";}s:4:\"name\";a:1:{s:9:\"x-default\";s:49:\"AI for Enhanced Customer Experience and Marketing\";}s:17:\"field_description\";a:1:{s:9:\"x-default\";a:2:{s:5:\"value\";s:1197:\"<p>In today\'s competitive landscape, delivering an exceptional customer experience is no longer a luxury but a necessity. This course, <strong>\"AI for Enhanced Customer Experience and Marketing,\"</strong> delves into the transformative power of Artificial Intelligence to elevate every touchpoint in the customer journey and optimize your marketing efforts.</p><p>You\'ll explore practical AI applications, from intelligent chatbots and virtual assistants that provide instant support to predictive analytics that anticipate customer needs and hyper-personalize product recommendations. We\'ll uncover how AI can automate routine tasks, free up human agents for complex issues, and provide invaluable insights into customer behavior and market trends.</p><p>Learn to leverage AI for dynamic content creation, targeted advertising campaigns, and real-time customer feedback analysis. By the end of this course, you\'ll be equipped with the knowledge to implement AI-driven strategies that not only boost customer satisfaction and loyalty but also significantly improve your marketing ROI and overall business growth.</p><p>Join us to unlock the future of customer engagement and marketing with AI!</p>\";s:6:\"format\";s:9:\"full_html\";}}s:23:\"field_short_description\";a:1:{s:9:\"x-default\";a:2:{s:5:\"value\";s:175:\"Discover how Artificial Intelligence can revolutionize customer interactions and marketing strategies, driving personalization, efficiency, and superior customer satisfaction.\";s:6:\"format\";s:9:\"full_html\";}}s:15:\"field_thumbnail\";a:1:{s:9:\"x-default\";a:5:{s:9:\"target_id\";s:2:\"68\";s:3:\"alt\";s:61:\"AI for Enhanced Customer Experience and Marketing Cover Image\";s:5:\"title\";N;s:5:\"width\";s:3:\"640\";s:6:\"height\";s:3:\"640\";}}s:12:\"field_banner\";a:1:{s:9:\"x-default\";a:5:{s:9:\"target_id\";N;s:3:\"alt\";N;s:5:\"title\";N;s:5:\"width\";N;s:6:\"height\";N;}}s:14:\"field_category\";a:1:{s:9:\"x-default\";s:2:\"54\";}s:11:\"field_level\";a:1:{s:9:\"x-default\";s:1:\"2\";}s:14:\"field_language\";a:1:{s:9:\"x-default\";N;}s:11:\"field_price\";a:1:{s:9:\"x-default\";s:4:\"0.00\";}s:16:\"field_price_type\";a:1:{s:9:\"x-default\";s:4:\"free\";}s:14:\"field_duration\";a:1:{s:9:\"x-default\";s:3:\"210\";}s:16:\"field_bestseller\";a:1:{s:9:\"x-default\";s:1:\"1\";}s:14:\"field_featured\";a:1:{s:9:\"x-default\";s:1:\"1\";}s:6:\"status\";a:1:{s:9:\"x-default\";s:1:\"1\";}s:7:\"created\";a:1:{s:9:\"x-default\";s:10:\"1774442931\";}s:7:\"changed\";a:1:{s:9:\"x-default\";s:10:\"1774451280\";}s:16:\"default_langcode\";a:1:{s:9:\"x-default\";s:1:\"1\";}s:16:\"field_what_learn\";a:1:{s:9:\"x-default\";a:2:{s:5:\"value\";s:676:\"- Understand the fundamental concepts of AI in customer experience (CX) and marketing.\n- Identify key AI tools and technologies used to enhance customer interactions.\n- Learn to implement AI-powered chatbots and virtual assistants for improved support.\n- Explore AI\'s role in personalizing customer journeys and product recommendations.\n- Discover how AI drives predictive analytics for anticipating customer needs and behaviors.\n- Master AI applications for targeted marketing campaigns and dynamic content generation.\n- Analyze customer feedback and sentiment using AI for actionable insights.\n- Measure the impact of AI on customer satisfaction, loyalty, and marketing ROI.\";s:6:\"format\";s:9:\"full_html\";}}s:19:\"field_prerequisites\";a:1:{s:9:\"x-default\";a:2:{s:5:\"value\";s:275:\"- Basic understanding of customer service principles and marketing concepts.\n- Familiarity with digital marketing tools and platforms is beneficial but not strictly required.\n- No prior AI programming knowledge is necessary, as the course focuses on application and strategy.\";s:6:\"format\";s:9:\"full_html\";}}s:13:\"field_who_for\";a:1:{s:9:\"x-default\";a:2:{s:5:\"value\";s:348:\"- Marketing Professionals and Managers\n- Customer Service Representatives and Team Leaders\n- Sales Professionals looking to leverage AI for better client engagement\n- Business Owners and Entrepreneurs\n- Digital Strategists and CX Designers\n- Anyone interested in understanding how AI can transform customer interactions and marketing effectiveness.\";s:6:\"format\";s:9:\"full_html\";}}s:12:\"field_rating\";a:1:{s:9:\"x-default\";s:3:\"5.0\";}s:14:\"field_chapters\";a:1:{s:9:\"x-default\";a:2:{i:0;a:1:{s:9:\"target_id\";s:2:\"91\";}i:1;a:1:{s:9:\"target_id\";s:2:\"92\";}}}}s:9:\"\0*\0fields\";a:0:{}s:19:\"\0*\0fieldDefinitions\";N;s:12:\"\0*\0languages\";N;s:14:\"\0*\0langcodeKey\";s:8:\"langcode\";s:21:\"\0*\0defaultLangcodeKey\";s:16:\"default_langcode\";s:17:\"\0*\0activeLangcode\";s:9:\"x-default\";s:28:\"\0*\0enforceDefaultTranslation\";N;s:18:\"\0*\0defaultLangcode\";s:2:\"en\";s:15:\"\0*\0translations\";a:1:{s:9:\"x-default\";a:1:{s:6:\"status\";i:1;}}s:24:\"\0*\0translationInitialize\";b:0;s:14:\"\0*\0newRevision\";b:0;s:20:\"\0*\0isDefaultRevision\";b:1;s:13:\"\0*\0entityKeys\";a:4:{s:6:\"bundle\";s:10:\"lms_course\";s:2:\"id\";s:2:\"30\";s:4:\"uuid\";s:36:\"a36128f0-ac67-4f39-96e4-da7182411134\";s:9:\"published\";s:1:\"1\";}s:25:\"\0*\0translatableEntityKeys\";a:4:{s:5:\"label\";a:1:{s:9:\"x-default\";s:49:\"AI for Enhanced Customer Experience and Marketing\";}s:8:\"langcode\";a:1:{s:9:\"x-default\";s:2:\"en\";}s:5:\"owner\";a:1:{s:9:\"x-default\";s:1:\"1\";}s:16:\"default_langcode\";a:1:{s:9:\"x-default\";s:1:\"1\";}}s:12:\"\0*\0validated\";b:0;s:21:\"\0*\0validationRequired\";b:0;s:19:\"\0*\0loadedRevisionId\";N;s:33:\"\0*\0revisionTranslationAffectedKey\";s:29:\"revision_translation_affected\";s:37:\"\0*\0enforceRevisionTranslationAffected\";a:0:{}s:12:\"\0*\0isSyncing\";b:0;}',-1,1774587022.768,1,'entity_field_info','0'),
('values:lms_course:31','O:31:\"Drupal\\lms_course\\Entity\\Course\":30:{s:15:\"\0*\0entityTypeId\";s:10:\"lms_course\";s:15:\"\0*\0enforceIsNew\";N;s:12:\"\0*\0typedData\";N;s:17:\"\0*\0originalEntity\";N;s:16:\"\0*\0cacheContexts\";a:0:{}s:12:\"\0*\0cacheTags\";a:0:{}s:14:\"\0*\0cacheMaxAge\";i:-1;s:14:\"\0*\0_serviceIds\";a:0:{}s:18:\"\0*\0_entityStorages\";a:0:{}s:9:\"\0*\0values\";a:26:{s:2:\"id\";a:1:{s:9:\"x-default\";s:2:\"31\";}s:4:\"uuid\";a:1:{s:9:\"x-default\";s:36:\"b7a3d2b8-d4f7-47a2-ab5a-7abdd0344dc5\";}s:8:\"langcode\";a:1:{s:9:\"x-default\";s:2:\"en\";}s:3:\"uid\";a:1:{s:9:\"x-default\";s:1:\"1\";}s:4:\"name\";a:1:{s:9:\"x-default\";s:46:\"Streamlining Operations with AI and Automation\";}s:17:\"field_description\";a:1:{s:9:\"x-default\";a:2:{s:5:\"value\";s:1387:\"<p>In today\'s fast-paced business environment, optimizing operations is crucial for competitive advantage. This comprehensive course, <strong>Streamlining Operations with AI and Automation</strong>, delves into the transformative power of AI and intelligent automation to redefine how businesses function.</p><p>You will explore a wide array of AI applications, from Robotic Process Automation (RPA) that automates repetitive tasks to advanced machine learning models that enable predictive maintenance and optimized supply chains. We\'ll cover how AI can enhance decision-making, improve resource allocation, and significantly reduce human error, leading to tangible improvements in productivity and bottom-line results.</p><p>The course is designed to provide practical insights and actionable strategies. Through real-world case studies and best practices, you\'ll learn how to identify opportunities for AI implementation within your organization, evaluate various AI tools and platforms, and develop a roadmap for successful integration. Whether you\'re looking to automate back-office functions, optimize manufacturing processes, or enhance service delivery, this course provides the knowledge and frameworks to leverage AI effectively.</p><p>Join us to unlock the full potential of AI and automation, empowering your organization to operate smarter, faster, and more efficiently.</p>\";s:6:\"format\";s:9:\"full_html\";}}s:23:\"field_short_description\";a:1:{s:9:\"x-default\";a:2:{s:5:\"value\";s:184:\"Discover how Artificial Intelligence and automation can revolutionize your business operations, enhancing efficiency, reducing costs, and fostering innovation across various functions.\";s:6:\"format\";s:9:\"full_html\";}}s:15:\"field_thumbnail\";a:1:{s:9:\"x-default\";a:5:{s:9:\"target_id\";s:2:\"69\";s:3:\"alt\";s:58:\"Streamlining Operations with AI and Automation Cover Image\";s:5:\"title\";N;s:5:\"width\";s:3:\"640\";s:6:\"height\";s:3:\"640\";}}s:12:\"field_banner\";a:1:{s:9:\"x-default\";a:5:{s:9:\"target_id\";N;s:3:\"alt\";N;s:5:\"title\";N;s:5:\"width\";N;s:6:\"height\";N;}}s:14:\"field_category\";a:1:{s:9:\"x-default\";s:2:\"54\";}s:11:\"field_level\";a:1:{s:9:\"x-default\";s:1:\"2\";}s:14:\"field_language\";a:1:{s:9:\"x-default\";N;}s:11:\"field_price\";a:1:{s:9:\"x-default\";s:6:\"199.99\";}s:16:\"field_price_type\";a:1:{s:9:\"x-default\";s:4:\"paid\";}s:14:\"field_duration\";a:1:{s:9:\"x-default\";s:3:\"240\";}s:16:\"field_bestseller\";a:1:{s:9:\"x-default\";s:1:\"1\";}s:14:\"field_featured\";a:1:{s:9:\"x-default\";s:1:\"1\";}s:6:\"status\";a:1:{s:9:\"x-default\";s:1:\"1\";}s:7:\"created\";a:1:{s:9:\"x-default\";s:10:\"1774442931\";}s:7:\"changed\";a:1:{s:9:\"x-default\";s:10:\"1774451280\";}s:16:\"default_langcode\";a:1:{s:9:\"x-default\";s:1:\"1\";}s:16:\"field_what_learn\";a:1:{s:9:\"x-default\";a:2:{s:5:\"value\";s:920:\"<ul><li>Understand the fundamental concepts of AI, automation, and intelligent process automation (IPA) in an operational context.</li><li>Identify key business processes ripe for AI-driven optimization and automation across various departments.</li><li>Learn about different AI technologies, including RPA, machine learning for predictive analytics, and natural language processing (NLP) for operational insights.</li><li>Develop strategies for integrating AI and automation tools into existing operational workflows and IT infrastructure.</li><li>Measure the impact and return on investment (ROI) of AI initiatives in terms of cost savings, efficiency gains, and improved quality.</li><li>Address potential challenges and ethical considerations associated with AI adoption in the workplace.</li><li>Gain insights into creating a culture of continuous improvement and innovation through AI-powered operations.</li></ul>\";s:6:\"format\";s:9:\"full_html\";}}s:19:\"field_prerequisites\";a:1:{s:9:\"x-default\";a:2:{s:5:\"value\";s:282:\"<ul><li>A basic understanding of general business operations and processes.</li><li>Familiarity with common workplace software applications.</li><li>No prior technical AI or programming knowledge is required, but an eagerness to learn about new technologies is beneficial.</li></ul>\";s:6:\"format\";s:9:\"full_html\";}}s:13:\"field_who_for\";a:1:{s:9:\"x-default\";a:2:{s:5:\"value\";s:539:\"<ul><li>Operations Managers and Directors seeking to enhance efficiency and reduce costs.</li><li>Business Process Analysts and Consultants looking to leverage AI for process re-engineering.</li><li>Project Managers overseeing automation or digital transformation initiatives.</li><li>IT Professionals involved in deploying and managing AI solutions.</li><li>Team Leads and Supervisors interested in optimizing departmental workflows.</li><li>Anyone in a leadership role aiming to drive operational excellence through technology.</li></ul>\";s:6:\"format\";s:9:\"full_html\";}}s:12:\"field_rating\";a:1:{s:9:\"x-default\";s:3:\"5.0\";}s:14:\"field_chapters\";a:1:{s:9:\"x-default\";a:2:{i:0;a:1:{s:9:\"target_id\";s:2:\"93\";}i:1;a:1:{s:9:\"target_id\";s:2:\"94\";}}}}s:9:\"\0*\0fields\";a:0:{}s:19:\"\0*\0fieldDefinitions\";N;s:12:\"\0*\0languages\";N;s:14:\"\0*\0langcodeKey\";s:8:\"langcode\";s:21:\"\0*\0defaultLangcodeKey\";s:16:\"default_langcode\";s:17:\"\0*\0activeLangcode\";s:9:\"x-default\";s:28:\"\0*\0enforceDefaultTranslation\";N;s:18:\"\0*\0defaultLangcode\";s:2:\"en\";s:15:\"\0*\0translations\";a:1:{s:9:\"x-default\";a:1:{s:6:\"status\";i:1;}}s:24:\"\0*\0translationInitialize\";b:0;s:14:\"\0*\0newRevision\";b:0;s:20:\"\0*\0isDefaultRevision\";b:1;s:13:\"\0*\0entityKeys\";a:4:{s:6:\"bundle\";s:10:\"lms_course\";s:2:\"id\";s:2:\"31\";s:4:\"uuid\";s:36:\"b7a3d2b8-d4f7-47a2-ab5a-7abdd0344dc5\";s:9:\"published\";s:1:\"1\";}s:25:\"\0*\0translatableEntityKeys\";a:4:{s:5:\"label\";a:1:{s:9:\"x-default\";s:46:\"Streamlining Operations with AI and Automation\";}s:8:\"langcode\";a:1:{s:9:\"x-default\";s:2:\"en\";}s:5:\"owner\";a:1:{s:9:\"x-default\";s:1:\"1\";}s:16:\"default_langcode\";a:1:{s:9:\"x-default\";s:1:\"1\";}}s:12:\"\0*\0validated\";b:0;s:21:\"\0*\0validationRequired\";b:0;s:19:\"\0*\0loadedRevisionId\";N;s:33:\"\0*\0revisionTranslationAffectedKey\";s:29:\"revision_translation_affected\";s:37:\"\0*\0enforceRevisionTranslationAffected\";a:0:{}s:12:\"\0*\0isSyncing\";b:0;}',-1,1774587022.768,1,'entity_field_info','0'),
('values:lms_course:32','O:31:\"Drupal\\lms_course\\Entity\\Course\":30:{s:15:\"\0*\0entityTypeId\";s:10:\"lms_course\";s:15:\"\0*\0enforceIsNew\";N;s:12:\"\0*\0typedData\";N;s:17:\"\0*\0originalEntity\";N;s:16:\"\0*\0cacheContexts\";a:0:{}s:12:\"\0*\0cacheTags\";a:0:{}s:14:\"\0*\0cacheMaxAge\";i:-1;s:14:\"\0*\0_serviceIds\";a:0:{}s:18:\"\0*\0_entityStorages\";a:0:{}s:9:\"\0*\0values\";a:26:{s:2:\"id\";a:1:{s:9:\"x-default\";s:2:\"32\";}s:4:\"uuid\";a:1:{s:9:\"x-default\";s:36:\"de618440-95e1-4631-b70c-278d192f5991\";}s:8:\"langcode\";a:1:{s:9:\"x-default\";s:2:\"en\";}s:3:\"uid\";a:1:{s:9:\"x-default\";s:1:\"1\";}s:4:\"name\";a:1:{s:9:\"x-default\";s:44:\"AI in Knowledge Management and Collaboration\";}s:17:\"field_description\";a:1:{s:9:\"x-default\";a:2:{s:5:\"value\";s:1234:\"<p>In today\'s fast-paced business environment, effective knowledge management and collaboration are critical for innovation and competitive advantage. This comprehensive course, <strong>AI in Knowledge Management and Collaboration</strong>, delves deep into how Artificial Intelligence is transforming these foundational aspects of the modern workplace.</p><p>You will explore cutting-edge AI applications that streamline information retrieval, automate content creation, enhance communication, and build intelligent knowledge systems. From AI-powered search engines that deliver precise answers instantly to intelligent assistants that support decision-making, and from automated content summarization to dynamic knowledge graphs that map organizational expertise, this course covers it all.</p><p>Learn how to implement AI tools to break down information silos, improve cross-functional teamwork, and ensure that valuable organizational knowledge is not only preserved but actively utilized to drive business outcomes. Whether you\'re looking to optimize internal processes, empower your employees with smarter tools, or simply stay ahead in the AI-driven era, this course provides the practical insights and strategies you need.</p>\";s:6:\"format\";s:9:\"full_html\";}}s:23:\"field_short_description\";a:1:{s:9:\"x-default\";a:2:{s:5:\"value\";s:174:\"Unlock the power of Artificial Intelligence to revolutionize how your organization manages, shares, and leverages its collective knowledge and fosters seamless collaboration.\";s:6:\"format\";s:9:\"full_html\";}}s:15:\"field_thumbnail\";a:1:{s:9:\"x-default\";a:5:{s:9:\"target_id\";s:2:\"70\";s:3:\"alt\";s:56:\"AI in Knowledge Management and Collaboration Cover Image\";s:5:\"title\";N;s:5:\"width\";s:3:\"640\";s:6:\"height\";s:3:\"640\";}}s:12:\"field_banner\";a:1:{s:9:\"x-default\";a:5:{s:9:\"target_id\";N;s:3:\"alt\";N;s:5:\"title\";N;s:5:\"width\";N;s:6:\"height\";N;}}s:14:\"field_category\";a:1:{s:9:\"x-default\";s:2:\"54\";}s:11:\"field_level\";a:1:{s:9:\"x-default\";s:1:\"2\";}s:14:\"field_language\";a:1:{s:9:\"x-default\";N;}s:11:\"field_price\";a:1:{s:9:\"x-default\";s:6:\"199.99\";}s:16:\"field_price_type\";a:1:{s:9:\"x-default\";s:4:\"paid\";}s:14:\"field_duration\";a:1:{s:9:\"x-default\";s:3:\"300\";}s:16:\"field_bestseller\";a:1:{s:9:\"x-default\";s:1:\"1\";}s:14:\"field_featured\";a:1:{s:9:\"x-default\";s:1:\"1\";}s:6:\"status\";a:1:{s:9:\"x-default\";s:1:\"1\";}s:7:\"created\";a:1:{s:9:\"x-default\";s:10:\"1774442931\";}s:7:\"changed\";a:1:{s:9:\"x-default\";s:10:\"1774451280\";}s:16:\"default_langcode\";a:1:{s:9:\"x-default\";s:1:\"1\";}s:16:\"field_what_learn\";a:1:{s:9:\"x-default\";a:2:{s:5:\"value\";s:775:\"<ul><li>Understand the fundamental role of AI in modern knowledge management strategies.</li><li>Explore and apply AI-powered tools for intelligent search, information retrieval, and content discovery.</li><li>Learn techniques for leveraging AI in automated content generation, summarization, and curation.</li><li>Discover how AI enhances team collaboration through intelligent assistants, smart routing, and predictive insights.</li><li>Grasp the concepts of building and utilizing AI-driven knowledge graphs for organizational insights.</li><li>Identify ethical considerations and best practices for deploying AI in knowledge management and collaboration.</li><li>Develop strategies to integrate AI solutions into existing knowledge workflows for maximum impact.</li></ul>\";s:6:\"format\";s:9:\"full_html\";}}s:19:\"field_prerequisites\";a:1:{s:9:\"x-default\";a:2:{s:5:\"value\";s:211:\"A basic understanding of business operations and familiarity with digital collaboration tools (e.g., SharePoint, Confluence, Microsoft Teams, Slack) is recommended. No prior AI programming knowledge is required.\";s:6:\"format\";s:9:\"full_html\";}}s:13:\"field_who_for\";a:1:{s:9:\"x-default\";a:2:{s:5:\"value\";s:266:\"This course is ideal for knowledge managers, team leads, project managers, content creators, information architects, IT professionals, business analysts, and anyone interested in leveraging AI to improve organizational knowledge sharing and collaborative efficiency.\";s:6:\"format\";s:9:\"full_html\";}}s:12:\"field_rating\";a:1:{s:9:\"x-default\";s:3:\"5.0\";}s:14:\"field_chapters\";a:1:{s:9:\"x-default\";a:2:{i:0;a:1:{s:9:\"target_id\";s:2:\"95\";}i:1;a:1:{s:9:\"target_id\";s:2:\"96\";}}}}s:9:\"\0*\0fields\";a:0:{}s:19:\"\0*\0fieldDefinitions\";N;s:12:\"\0*\0languages\";N;s:14:\"\0*\0langcodeKey\";s:8:\"langcode\";s:21:\"\0*\0defaultLangcodeKey\";s:16:\"default_langcode\";s:17:\"\0*\0activeLangcode\";s:9:\"x-default\";s:28:\"\0*\0enforceDefaultTranslation\";N;s:18:\"\0*\0defaultLangcode\";s:2:\"en\";s:15:\"\0*\0translations\";a:1:{s:9:\"x-default\";a:1:{s:6:\"status\";i:1;}}s:24:\"\0*\0translationInitialize\";b:0;s:14:\"\0*\0newRevision\";b:0;s:20:\"\0*\0isDefaultRevision\";b:1;s:13:\"\0*\0entityKeys\";a:4:{s:6:\"bundle\";s:10:\"lms_course\";s:2:\"id\";s:2:\"32\";s:4:\"uuid\";s:36:\"de618440-95e1-4631-b70c-278d192f5991\";s:9:\"published\";s:1:\"1\";}s:25:\"\0*\0translatableEntityKeys\";a:4:{s:5:\"label\";a:1:{s:9:\"x-default\";s:44:\"AI in Knowledge Management and Collaboration\";}s:8:\"langcode\";a:1:{s:9:\"x-default\";s:2:\"en\";}s:5:\"owner\";a:1:{s:9:\"x-default\";s:1:\"1\";}s:16:\"default_langcode\";a:1:{s:9:\"x-default\";s:1:\"1\";}}s:12:\"\0*\0validated\";b:0;s:21:\"\0*\0validationRequired\";b:0;s:19:\"\0*\0loadedRevisionId\";N;s:33:\"\0*\0revisionTranslationAffectedKey\";s:29:\"revision_translation_affected\";s:37:\"\0*\0enforceRevisionTranslationAffected\";a:0:{}s:12:\"\0*\0isSyncing\";b:0;}',-1,1774587022.768,1,'entity_field_info','0'),
('values:lms_course:33','O:31:\"Drupal\\lms_course\\Entity\\Course\":30:{s:15:\"\0*\0entityTypeId\";s:10:\"lms_course\";s:15:\"\0*\0enforceIsNew\";N;s:12:\"\0*\0typedData\";N;s:17:\"\0*\0originalEntity\";N;s:16:\"\0*\0cacheContexts\";a:0:{}s:12:\"\0*\0cacheTags\";a:0:{}s:14:\"\0*\0cacheMaxAge\";i:-1;s:14:\"\0*\0_serviceIds\";a:0:{}s:18:\"\0*\0_entityStorages\";a:0:{}s:9:\"\0*\0values\";a:26:{s:2:\"id\";a:1:{s:9:\"x-default\";s:2:\"33\";}s:4:\"uuid\";a:1:{s:9:\"x-default\";s:36:\"3d5cc6d9-e31b-433e-a1e5-75fac19f81cf\";}s:8:\"langcode\";a:1:{s:9:\"x-default\";s:2:\"en\";}s:3:\"uid\";a:1:{s:9:\"x-default\";s:1:\"1\";}s:4:\"name\";a:1:{s:9:\"x-default\";s:46:\"AI for Data Analysis and Business Intelligence\";}s:17:\"field_description\";a:1:{s:9:\"x-default\";a:2:{s:5:\"value\";s:1195:\"<p>In today\'s data-driven world, the ability to effectively analyze and interpret vast amounts of information is paramount for business success. This course, <b>\"AI for Data Analysis and Business Intelligence,\"</b> empowers professionals to harness cutting-edge Artificial Intelligence techniques to revolutionize their data strategies.</p>\n\n<p>You\'ll delve into the core principles of how AI algorithms, machine learning models, and predictive analytics can be applied to real-world business scenarios. From automating data collection and cleaning to uncovering hidden patterns and forecasting future trends, this program provides a comprehensive toolkit for leveraging AI to gain a significant competitive advantage.</p>\n\n<p>Explore practical applications such as customer segmentation, market trend prediction, operational efficiency improvements, and risk assessment. Through hands-on examples and case studies, you\'ll learn how to implement AI-powered solutions that not only enhance data accuracy and speed but also provide deeper, more nuanced insights than traditional methods. Prepare to transform your approach to data, making it a strategic asset that fuels growth and innovation.</p>\";s:6:\"format\";s:9:\"full_html\";}}s:23:\"field_short_description\";a:1:{s:9:\"x-default\";a:2:{s:5:\"value\";s:156:\"Unlock the power of AI to transform raw data into actionable insights, driving smarter business decisions and fostering innovation across your organization.\";s:6:\"format\";s:9:\"full_html\";}}s:15:\"field_thumbnail\";a:1:{s:9:\"x-default\";a:5:{s:9:\"target_id\";s:2:\"71\";s:3:\"alt\";s:58:\"AI for Data Analysis and Business Intelligence Cover Image\";s:5:\"title\";N;s:5:\"width\";s:3:\"640\";s:6:\"height\";s:3:\"640\";}}s:12:\"field_banner\";a:1:{s:9:\"x-default\";a:5:{s:9:\"target_id\";N;s:3:\"alt\";N;s:5:\"title\";N;s:5:\"width\";N;s:6:\"height\";N;}}s:14:\"field_category\";a:1:{s:9:\"x-default\";s:2:\"54\";}s:11:\"field_level\";a:1:{s:9:\"x-default\";s:1:\"2\";}s:14:\"field_language\";a:1:{s:9:\"x-default\";N;}s:11:\"field_price\";a:1:{s:9:\"x-default\";s:6:\"299.00\";}s:16:\"field_price_type\";a:1:{s:9:\"x-default\";s:4:\"paid\";}s:14:\"field_duration\";a:1:{s:9:\"x-default\";s:3:\"480\";}s:16:\"field_bestseller\";a:1:{s:9:\"x-default\";s:1:\"1\";}s:14:\"field_featured\";a:1:{s:9:\"x-default\";s:1:\"1\";}s:6:\"status\";a:1:{s:9:\"x-default\";s:1:\"1\";}s:7:\"created\";a:1:{s:9:\"x-default\";s:10:\"1774442931\";}s:7:\"changed\";a:1:{s:9:\"x-default\";s:10:\"1774451280\";}s:16:\"default_langcode\";a:1:{s:9:\"x-default\";s:1:\"1\";}s:16:\"field_what_learn\";a:1:{s:9:\"x-default\";a:2:{s:5:\"value\";s:759:\"<ul>\n    <li>Understand the fundamental concepts of AI, Machine Learning, and Deep Learning in the context of data analysis.</li>\n    <li>Learn how to identify and apply appropriate AI techniques for various business intelligence challenges.</li>\n    <li>Master tools and platforms for AI-driven data collection, cleaning, and preparation.</li>\n    <li>Develop skills in predictive modeling, forecasting, and anomaly detection using AI.</li>\n    <li>Explore practical applications of AI in customer analytics, market research, and operational optimization.</li>\n    <li>Formulate strategies for integrating AI insights into business decision-making processes.</li>\n    <li>Evaluate the ethical considerations and limitations of AI in data analysis.</li>\n</ul>\";s:6:\"format\";s:9:\"full_html\";}}s:19:\"field_prerequisites\";a:1:{s:9:\"x-default\";a:2:{s:5:\"value\";s:317:\"<ul>\n    <li>Basic understanding of data concepts and business processes.</li>\n    <li>Familiarity with spreadsheet software (e.g., Excel) or basic database concepts is helpful but not strictly required.</li>\n    <li>No prior programming experience is necessary, though an analytical mindset is beneficial.</li>\n</ul>\";s:6:\"format\";s:9:\"full_html\";}}s:13:\"field_who_for\";a:1:{s:9:\"x-default\";a:2:{s:5:\"value\";s:597:\"<ul>\n    <li>Business Analysts and Data Analysts looking to integrate AI into their workflows.</li>\n    <li>Managers and Decision-makers seeking to understand how AI can enhance their strategic planning and operational efficiency.</li>\n    <li>Marketing and Sales Professionals interested in AI-driven customer insights and market prediction.</li>\n    <li>IT Professionals and aspiring Data Scientists keen to explore AI applications in business intelligence.</li>\n    <li>Anyone interested in leveraging AI to make more informed, data-driven decisions within an organizational context.</li>\n</ul>\";s:6:\"format\";s:9:\"full_html\";}}s:12:\"field_rating\";a:1:{s:9:\"x-default\";s:3:\"5.0\";}s:14:\"field_chapters\";a:1:{s:9:\"x-default\";a:2:{i:0;a:1:{s:9:\"target_id\";s:2:\"97\";}i:1;a:1:{s:9:\"target_id\";s:2:\"98\";}}}}s:9:\"\0*\0fields\";a:0:{}s:19:\"\0*\0fieldDefinitions\";N;s:12:\"\0*\0languages\";N;s:14:\"\0*\0langcodeKey\";s:8:\"langcode\";s:21:\"\0*\0defaultLangcodeKey\";s:16:\"default_langcode\";s:17:\"\0*\0activeLangcode\";s:9:\"x-default\";s:28:\"\0*\0enforceDefaultTranslation\";N;s:18:\"\0*\0defaultLangcode\";s:2:\"en\";s:15:\"\0*\0translations\";a:1:{s:9:\"x-default\";a:1:{s:6:\"status\";i:1;}}s:24:\"\0*\0translationInitialize\";b:0;s:14:\"\0*\0newRevision\";b:0;s:20:\"\0*\0isDefaultRevision\";b:1;s:13:\"\0*\0entityKeys\";a:4:{s:6:\"bundle\";s:10:\"lms_course\";s:2:\"id\";s:2:\"33\";s:4:\"uuid\";s:36:\"3d5cc6d9-e31b-433e-a1e5-75fac19f81cf\";s:9:\"published\";s:1:\"1\";}s:25:\"\0*\0translatableEntityKeys\";a:4:{s:5:\"label\";a:1:{s:9:\"x-default\";s:46:\"AI for Data Analysis and Business Intelligence\";}s:8:\"langcode\";a:1:{s:9:\"x-default\";s:2:\"en\";}s:5:\"owner\";a:1:{s:9:\"x-default\";s:1:\"1\";}s:16:\"default_langcode\";a:1:{s:9:\"x-default\";s:1:\"1\";}}s:12:\"\0*\0validated\";b:0;s:21:\"\0*\0validationRequired\";b:0;s:19:\"\0*\0loadedRevisionId\";N;s:33:\"\0*\0revisionTranslationAffectedKey\";s:29:\"revision_translation_affected\";s:37:\"\0*\0enforceRevisionTranslationAffected\";a:0:{}s:12:\"\0*\0isSyncing\";b:0;}',-1,1774587022.768,1,'entity_field_info','0'),
('values:lms_course:35','O:31:\"Drupal\\lms_course\\Entity\\Course\":30:{s:15:\"\0*\0entityTypeId\";s:10:\"lms_course\";s:15:\"\0*\0enforceIsNew\";N;s:12:\"\0*\0typedData\";N;s:17:\"\0*\0originalEntity\";N;s:16:\"\0*\0cacheContexts\";a:0:{}s:12:\"\0*\0cacheTags\";a:0:{}s:14:\"\0*\0cacheMaxAge\";i:-1;s:14:\"\0*\0_serviceIds\";a:0:{}s:18:\"\0*\0_entityStorages\";a:0:{}s:9:\"\0*\0values\";a:26:{s:2:\"id\";a:1:{s:9:\"x-default\";s:2:\"35\";}s:4:\"uuid\";a:1:{s:9:\"x-default\";s:36:\"b66fdf91-d65d-410c-866e-87431332841f\";}s:8:\"langcode\";a:1:{s:9:\"x-default\";s:2:\"en\";}s:3:\"uid\";a:1:{s:9:\"x-default\";s:1:\"1\";}s:4:\"name\";a:1:{s:9:\"x-default\";s:33:\"Data Fundamentals for AI Projects\";}s:17:\"field_description\";a:1:{s:9:\"x-default\";a:2:{s:5:\"value\";s:1248:\"<p>In today\'s AI-driven world, understanding the bedrock of any successful artificial intelligence initiative—data—is paramount. This comprehensive course, \"Data Fundamentals for AI Projects,\" is designed to equip professionals from various backgrounds with the essential knowledge needed to navigate the data landscape for AI applications.</p>\n<p>You\'ll embark on a journey that begins with demystifying data itself: what it is, where it comes from, and its diverse forms. We\'ll explore the critical role of data quality, integrity, and governance, understanding why clean, reliable data is the lifeblood of accurate and unbiased AI models. Furthermore, the course will cover fundamental concepts such as data collection, storage, and basic processing techniques that lay the groundwork for more advanced AI endeavors.</p>\n<p>By the end of this course, you won\'t just understand data; you\'ll understand data <i>for AI</i>. You\'ll gain the confidence to engage in data-related discussions, identify potential data challenges in AI projects, and contribute meaningfully to building a data-ready culture within your organization. This is your first crucial step towards harnessing the power of AI in the workplace effectively and responsibly.</p>\";s:6:\"format\";s:9:\"full_html\";}}s:23:\"field_short_description\";a:1:{s:9:\"x-default\";a:2:{s:5:\"value\";s:197:\"Unlock the foundational knowledge of data essential for successful AI projects. This course demystifies data types, sources, and quality, preparing you to leverage AI effectively in your workplace.\";s:6:\"format\";s:9:\"full_html\";}}s:15:\"field_thumbnail\";a:1:{s:9:\"x-default\";a:5:{s:9:\"target_id\";s:2:\"73\";s:3:\"alt\";s:45:\"Data Fundamentals for AI Projects Cover Image\";s:5:\"title\";N;s:5:\"width\";s:3:\"640\";s:6:\"height\";s:3:\"640\";}}s:12:\"field_banner\";a:1:{s:9:\"x-default\";a:5:{s:9:\"target_id\";N;s:3:\"alt\";N;s:5:\"title\";N;s:5:\"width\";N;s:6:\"height\";N;}}s:14:\"field_category\";a:1:{s:9:\"x-default\";s:2:\"55\";}s:11:\"field_level\";a:1:{s:9:\"x-default\";s:1:\"1\";}s:14:\"field_language\";a:1:{s:9:\"x-default\";N;}s:11:\"field_price\";a:1:{s:9:\"x-default\";s:4:\"0.00\";}s:16:\"field_price_type\";a:1:{s:9:\"x-default\";s:4:\"free\";}s:14:\"field_duration\";a:1:{s:9:\"x-default\";s:3:\"240\";}s:16:\"field_bestseller\";a:1:{s:9:\"x-default\";s:1:\"1\";}s:14:\"field_featured\";a:1:{s:9:\"x-default\";s:1:\"1\";}s:6:\"status\";a:1:{s:9:\"x-default\";s:1:\"1\";}s:7:\"created\";a:1:{s:9:\"x-default\";s:10:\"1774442931\";}s:7:\"changed\";a:1:{s:9:\"x-default\";s:10:\"1774451280\";}s:16:\"default_langcode\";a:1:{s:9:\"x-default\";s:1:\"1\";}s:16:\"field_what_learn\";a:1:{s:9:\"x-default\";a:2:{s:5:\"value\";s:716:\"<ul>\n    <li>Understand the fundamental concepts of data and its critical role in AI applications.</li>\n    <li>Identify different types of data (structured, unstructured, semi-structured) and their relevance to AI projects.</li>\n    <li>Recognize common data sources and collection methods for AI initiatives.</li>\n    <li>Grasp the importance of data quality, integrity, and governance in ensuring reliable AI outcomes.</li>\n    <li>Learn basic principles of data storage, management, and security for AI data.</li>\n    <li>Develop an awareness of ethical considerations related to data use in AI.</li>\n    <li>Prepare to effectively communicate data requirements and challenges within AI project teams.</li>\n</ul>\";s:6:\"format\";s:9:\"full_html\";}}s:19:\"field_prerequisites\";a:1:{s:9:\"x-default\";a:2:{s:5:\"value\";s:185:\"No prior technical knowledge in AI or data science is required. A basic understanding of business operations and a general curiosity about how data drives technology will be beneficial.\";s:6:\"format\";s:9:\"full_html\";}}s:13:\"field_who_for\";a:1:{s:9:\"x-default\";a:2:{s:5:\"value\";s:338:\"This course is ideal for business analysts, project managers, team leads, non-technical professionals looking to understand AI, aspiring data enthusiasts, and anyone involved in or impacted by AI initiatives in their organization. It\'s especially suited for those who need to collaborate effectively with data scientists and AI engineers.\";s:6:\"format\";s:9:\"full_html\";}}s:12:\"field_rating\";a:1:{s:9:\"x-default\";s:3:\"5.0\";}s:14:\"field_chapters\";a:1:{s:9:\"x-default\";a:2:{i:0;a:1:{s:9:\"target_id\";s:3:\"101\";}i:1;a:1:{s:9:\"target_id\";s:3:\"102\";}}}}s:9:\"\0*\0fields\";a:0:{}s:19:\"\0*\0fieldDefinitions\";N;s:12:\"\0*\0languages\";N;s:14:\"\0*\0langcodeKey\";s:8:\"langcode\";s:21:\"\0*\0defaultLangcodeKey\";s:16:\"default_langcode\";s:17:\"\0*\0activeLangcode\";s:9:\"x-default\";s:28:\"\0*\0enforceDefaultTranslation\";N;s:18:\"\0*\0defaultLangcode\";s:2:\"en\";s:15:\"\0*\0translations\";a:1:{s:9:\"x-default\";a:1:{s:6:\"status\";i:1;}}s:24:\"\0*\0translationInitialize\";b:0;s:14:\"\0*\0newRevision\";b:0;s:20:\"\0*\0isDefaultRevision\";b:1;s:13:\"\0*\0entityKeys\";a:4:{s:6:\"bundle\";s:10:\"lms_course\";s:2:\"id\";s:2:\"35\";s:4:\"uuid\";s:36:\"b66fdf91-d65d-410c-866e-87431332841f\";s:9:\"published\";s:1:\"1\";}s:25:\"\0*\0translatableEntityKeys\";a:4:{s:5:\"label\";a:1:{s:9:\"x-default\";s:33:\"Data Fundamentals for AI Projects\";}s:8:\"langcode\";a:1:{s:9:\"x-default\";s:2:\"en\";}s:5:\"owner\";a:1:{s:9:\"x-default\";s:1:\"1\";}s:16:\"default_langcode\";a:1:{s:9:\"x-default\";s:1:\"1\";}}s:12:\"\0*\0validated\";b:0;s:21:\"\0*\0validationRequired\";b:0;s:19:\"\0*\0loadedRevisionId\";N;s:33:\"\0*\0revisionTranslationAffectedKey\";s:29:\"revision_translation_affected\";s:37:\"\0*\0enforceRevisionTranslationAffected\";a:0:{}s:12:\"\0*\0isSyncing\";b:0;}',-1,1774587141.787,1,'entity_field_info','0'),
('values:lms_course:36','O:31:\"Drupal\\lms_course\\Entity\\Course\":30:{s:15:\"\0*\0entityTypeId\";s:10:\"lms_course\";s:15:\"\0*\0enforceIsNew\";N;s:12:\"\0*\0typedData\";N;s:17:\"\0*\0originalEntity\";N;s:16:\"\0*\0cacheContexts\";a:0:{}s:12:\"\0*\0cacheTags\";a:0:{}s:14:\"\0*\0cacheMaxAge\";i:-1;s:14:\"\0*\0_serviceIds\";a:0:{}s:18:\"\0*\0_entityStorages\";a:0:{}s:9:\"\0*\0values\";a:26:{s:2:\"id\";a:1:{s:9:\"x-default\";s:2:\"36\";}s:4:\"uuid\";a:1:{s:9:\"x-default\";s:36:\"e4a452d5-1403-42dc-9e30-cef6a696153d\";}s:8:\"langcode\";a:1:{s:9:\"x-default\";s:2:\"en\";}s:3:\"uid\";a:1:{s:9:\"x-default\";s:1:\"1\";}s:4:\"name\";a:1:{s:9:\"x-default\";s:39:\"Preparing Your Data for AI Applications\";}s:17:\"field_description\";a:1:{s:9:\"x-default\";a:2:{s:5:\"value\";s:1339:\"<p>In the world of AI, data is king, but not all data is created equal. The success of any AI application hinges critically on the quality and preparation of the data it consumes. This comprehensive course, \"Preparing Your Data for AI Applications,\" dives deep into the crucial steps required to transform raw, often messy, enterprise data into a pristine, AI-ready format.</p><p>You will learn the methodologies to identify and handle missing values, correct inconsistencies, and effectively normalize and scale your datasets. We explore various data transformation techniques, including feature engineering, which empowers you to extract more predictive power from your existing data. Furthermore, the course covers best practices for data validation, ensuring the integrity and reliability of your datasets before they ever touch an AI model.</p><p>Through practical examples and case studies relevant to workplace AI applications, you\'ll gain hands-on experience in preparing data for tasks such as predictive analytics, natural language processing, and computer vision. By the end of this course, you\'ll possess the confidence and skills to ensure your AI projects are built on a solid foundation of high-quality, meticulously prepared data, leading to more accurate, reliable, and impactful AI solutions within your organization.</p>\";s:6:\"format\";s:9:\"full_html\";}}s:23:\"field_short_description\";a:1:{s:9:\"x-default\";a:2:{s:5:\"value\";s:170:\"Master the essential techniques for cleaning, transforming, and structuring your data to ensure robust and accurate AI model performance in real-world business scenarios.\";s:6:\"format\";s:9:\"full_html\";}}s:15:\"field_thumbnail\";a:1:{s:9:\"x-default\";a:5:{s:9:\"target_id\";s:2:\"75\";s:3:\"alt\";s:51:\"Preparing Your Data for AI Applications Cover Image\";s:5:\"title\";N;s:5:\"width\";s:3:\"640\";s:6:\"height\";s:3:\"640\";}}s:12:\"field_banner\";a:1:{s:9:\"x-default\";a:5:{s:9:\"target_id\";N;s:3:\"alt\";N;s:5:\"title\";N;s:5:\"width\";N;s:6:\"height\";N;}}s:14:\"field_category\";a:1:{s:9:\"x-default\";s:2:\"55\";}s:11:\"field_level\";a:1:{s:9:\"x-default\";s:1:\"1\";}s:14:\"field_language\";a:1:{s:9:\"x-default\";N;}s:11:\"field_price\";a:1:{s:9:\"x-default\";s:6:\"199.00\";}s:16:\"field_price_type\";a:1:{s:9:\"x-default\";s:4:\"paid\";}s:14:\"field_duration\";a:1:{s:9:\"x-default\";s:3:\"240\";}s:16:\"field_bestseller\";a:1:{s:9:\"x-default\";s:1:\"0\";}s:14:\"field_featured\";a:1:{s:9:\"x-default\";s:1:\"1\";}s:6:\"status\";a:1:{s:9:\"x-default\";s:1:\"1\";}s:7:\"created\";a:1:{s:9:\"x-default\";s:10:\"1774442931\";}s:7:\"changed\";a:1:{s:9:\"x-default\";s:10:\"1774451280\";}s:16:\"default_langcode\";a:1:{s:9:\"x-default\";s:1:\"1\";}s:16:\"field_what_learn\";a:1:{s:9:\"x-default\";a:2:{s:5:\"value\";s:798:\"<ul><li>Understand the critical role of data quality in successful AI applications.</li><li>Identify and effectively handle common data issues like missing values, outliers, and inconsistencies.</li><li>Master various data cleaning and preprocessing techniques for different data types.</li><li>Apply data transformation methods, including normalization, scaling, and encoding categorical variables.</li><li>Develop skills in feature engineering to create new, impactful features from existing data.</li><li>Implement data validation strategies to ensure data integrity and reliability.</li><li>Prepare datasets specifically for common AI tasks such as classification, regression, and clustering.</li><li>Utilize best practices for maintaining data governance and quality in AI pipelines.</li></ul>\";s:6:\"format\";s:9:\"full_html\";}}s:19:\"field_prerequisites\";a:1:{s:9:\"x-default\";a:2:{s:5:\"value\";s:405:\"<p>Participants should have a basic understanding of data concepts and some familiarity with the general principles of Artificial Intelligence. Prior experience with data analysis tools or programming (e.g., Python) is beneficial but not strictly required, as the course focuses on conceptual understanding and practical methodologies. A willingness to engage with data and problem-solve is essential.</p>\";s:6:\"format\";s:9:\"full_html\";}}s:13:\"field_who_for\";a:1:{s:9:\"x-default\";a:2:{s:5:\"value\";s:661:\"<p>This course is ideal for:</p><ul><li><strong>Data Analysts and Scientists:</strong> Looking to refine their data preparation skills for AI projects.</li><li><strong>Business Intelligence Professionals:</strong> Aiming to understand how to ready their organizational data for AI initiatives.</li><li><strong>AI Project Managers:</strong> Needing insight into the data requirements and challenges of AI development.</li><li><strong>IT Professionals:</strong> Supporting data infrastructure for AI applications.</li><li><strong>Anyone involved in AI development:</strong> Who wants to ensure the foundation of their AI projects is robust and reliable.</li></ul>\";s:6:\"format\";s:9:\"full_html\";}}s:12:\"field_rating\";a:1:{s:9:\"x-default\";s:3:\"5.0\";}s:14:\"field_chapters\";a:1:{s:9:\"x-default\";a:2:{i:0;a:1:{s:9:\"target_id\";s:3:\"103\";}i:1;a:1:{s:9:\"target_id\";s:3:\"104\";}}}}s:9:\"\0*\0fields\";a:0:{}s:19:\"\0*\0fieldDefinitions\";N;s:12:\"\0*\0languages\";N;s:14:\"\0*\0langcodeKey\";s:8:\"langcode\";s:21:\"\0*\0defaultLangcodeKey\";s:16:\"default_langcode\";s:17:\"\0*\0activeLangcode\";s:9:\"x-default\";s:28:\"\0*\0enforceDefaultTranslation\";N;s:18:\"\0*\0defaultLangcode\";s:2:\"en\";s:15:\"\0*\0translations\";a:1:{s:9:\"x-default\";a:1:{s:6:\"status\";i:1;}}s:24:\"\0*\0translationInitialize\";b:0;s:14:\"\0*\0newRevision\";b:0;s:20:\"\0*\0isDefaultRevision\";b:1;s:13:\"\0*\0entityKeys\";a:4:{s:6:\"bundle\";s:10:\"lms_course\";s:2:\"id\";s:2:\"36\";s:4:\"uuid\";s:36:\"e4a452d5-1403-42dc-9e30-cef6a696153d\";s:9:\"published\";s:1:\"1\";}s:25:\"\0*\0translatableEntityKeys\";a:4:{s:5:\"label\";a:1:{s:9:\"x-default\";s:39:\"Preparing Your Data for AI Applications\";}s:8:\"langcode\";a:1:{s:9:\"x-default\";s:2:\"en\";}s:5:\"owner\";a:1:{s:9:\"x-default\";s:1:\"1\";}s:16:\"default_langcode\";a:1:{s:9:\"x-default\";s:1:\"1\";}}s:12:\"\0*\0validated\";b:0;s:21:\"\0*\0validationRequired\";b:0;s:19:\"\0*\0loadedRevisionId\";N;s:33:\"\0*\0revisionTranslationAffectedKey\";s:29:\"revision_translation_affected\";s:37:\"\0*\0enforceRevisionTranslationAffected\";a:0:{}s:12:\"\0*\0isSyncing\";b:0;}',-1,1774587141.787,1,'entity_field_info','0'),
('values:lms_course:37','O:31:\"Drupal\\lms_course\\Entity\\Course\":30:{s:15:\"\0*\0entityTypeId\";s:10:\"lms_course\";s:15:\"\0*\0enforceIsNew\";N;s:12:\"\0*\0typedData\";N;s:17:\"\0*\0originalEntity\";N;s:16:\"\0*\0cacheContexts\";a:0:{}s:12:\"\0*\0cacheTags\";a:0:{}s:14:\"\0*\0cacheMaxAge\";i:-1;s:14:\"\0*\0_serviceIds\";a:0:{}s:18:\"\0*\0_entityStorages\";a:0:{}s:9:\"\0*\0values\";a:26:{s:2:\"id\";a:1:{s:9:\"x-default\";s:2:\"37\";}s:4:\"uuid\";a:1:{s:9:\"x-default\";s:36:\"92137dd9-40b8-419c-87aa-e2b39be8775d\";}s:8:\"langcode\";a:1:{s:9:\"x-default\";s:2:\"en\";}s:3:\"uid\";a:1:{s:9:\"x-default\";s:1:\"1\";}s:4:\"name\";a:1:{s:9:\"x-default\";s:45:\"Building a Data-Driven Culture for AI Success\";}s:17:\"field_description\";a:1:{s:9:\"x-default\";a:2:{s:5:\"value\";s:1835:\"<p>In today\'s rapidly evolving business landscape, Artificial Intelligence (AI) is no longer a futuristic concept but a present-day imperative for competitive advantage. However, the true power of AI can only be unleashed when an organization embraces a strong data-driven culture. This course, \"Building a Data-Driven Culture for AI Success,\" is designed to equip leaders, managers, and data professionals with the strategies and insights needed to foster an environment where data is valued, understood, and utilized across all levels to inform decision-making and drive AI initiatives.</p>\n\n<p>You will explore the fundamental components of a data-driven culture, from establishing clear data governance policies and promoting data literacy to encouraging experimentation and learning from data insights. We will delve into practical frameworks for integrating data into daily operations, aligning organizational goals with data strategies, and overcoming common cultural barriers to AI adoption. By the end of this course, you will have a comprehensive understanding of how to transform your organization into one that not only uses AI effectively but thrives on data-driven intelligence, paving the way for sustainable innovation and growth.</p>\n\n<p><strong>Key topics include:</strong></p>\n<ul>\n    <li>Understanding the synergy between data culture and AI success.</li>\n    <li>Developing a data vision and strategy that aligns with business objectives.</li>\n    <li>Implementing effective data governance and stewardship programs.</li>\n    <li>Strategies for enhancing data literacy and skills across the workforce.</li>\n    <li>Fostering a culture of experimentation, continuous learning, and data-informed decision-making.</li>\n    <li>Leadership\'s role in championing data initiatives and driving cultural change.</li>\n</ul>\";s:6:\"format\";s:9:\"full_html\";}}s:23:\"field_short_description\";a:1:{s:9:\"x-default\";a:2:{s:5:\"value\";s:158:\"Learn how to cultivate a robust data-driven culture within your organization, essential for successful AI adoption and maximizing its impact in the workplace.\";s:6:\"format\";s:9:\"full_html\";}}s:15:\"field_thumbnail\";a:1:{s:9:\"x-default\";a:5:{s:9:\"target_id\";s:2:\"76\";s:3:\"alt\";s:57:\"Building a Data-Driven Culture for AI Success Cover Image\";s:5:\"title\";N;s:5:\"width\";s:3:\"640\";s:6:\"height\";s:3:\"640\";}}s:12:\"field_banner\";a:1:{s:9:\"x-default\";a:5:{s:9:\"target_id\";N;s:3:\"alt\";N;s:5:\"title\";N;s:5:\"width\";N;s:6:\"height\";N;}}s:14:\"field_category\";a:1:{s:9:\"x-default\";s:2:\"55\";}s:11:\"field_level\";a:1:{s:9:\"x-default\";s:1:\"2\";}s:14:\"field_language\";a:1:{s:9:\"x-default\";N;}s:11:\"field_price\";a:1:{s:9:\"x-default\";s:6:\"199.99\";}s:16:\"field_price_type\";a:1:{s:9:\"x-default\";s:4:\"paid\";}s:14:\"field_duration\";a:1:{s:9:\"x-default\";s:3:\"210\";}s:16:\"field_bestseller\";a:1:{s:9:\"x-default\";s:1:\"1\";}s:14:\"field_featured\";a:1:{s:9:\"x-default\";s:1:\"1\";}s:6:\"status\";a:1:{s:9:\"x-default\";s:1:\"1\";}s:7:\"created\";a:1:{s:9:\"x-default\";s:10:\"1774442931\";}s:7:\"changed\";a:1:{s:9:\"x-default\";s:10:\"1774451280\";}s:16:\"default_langcode\";a:1:{s:9:\"x-default\";s:1:\"1\";}s:16:\"field_what_learn\";a:1:{s:9:\"x-default\";a:2:{s:5:\"value\";s:742:\"Upon completing this course, you will be able to:\n*   Articulate the critical link between a robust data culture and successful AI implementation.\n*   Develop and champion a data vision and strategy aligned with your organization\'s business goals.\n*   Implement foundational data governance principles and data stewardship roles.\n*   Design and execute programs to improve data literacy and analytical skills across various departments.\n*   Cultivate an organizational mindset that embraces data-driven experimentation and continuous improvement.\n*   Identify and overcome common cultural and organizational barriers to AI adoption.\n*   Lead initiatives to integrate data-informed decision-making into daily operations and strategic planning.\";s:6:\"format\";s:9:\"full_html\";}}s:19:\"field_prerequisites\";a:1:{s:9:\"x-default\";a:2:{s:5:\"value\";s:354:\"*   Basic understanding of business operations and organizational structures.\n*   Familiarity with the general concept of Artificial Intelligence and its potential applications (e.g., from \"Data Fundamentals for AI Projects\" or \"Preparing Your Data for AI Applications\" courses).\n*   No prior technical data science or programming experience is required.\";s:6:\"format\";s:9:\"full_html\";}}s:13:\"field_who_for\";a:1:{s:9:\"x-default\";a:2:{s:5:\"value\";s:505:\"This course is ideal for:\n*   Business Leaders and Executives looking to drive AI adoption and digital transformation.\n*   Department Managers and Team Leads responsible for implementing data-driven strategies.\n*   Data Strategists, Data Governance Professionals, and Analytics Managers.\n*   HR Professionals involved in workforce development and skill-building for AI readiness.\n*   Anyone interested in understanding the organizational and cultural aspects of successful AI integration in the workplace.\";s:6:\"format\";s:9:\"full_html\";}}s:12:\"field_rating\";a:1:{s:9:\"x-default\";s:3:\"5.0\";}s:14:\"field_chapters\";a:1:{s:9:\"x-default\";a:2:{i:0;a:1:{s:9:\"target_id\";s:3:\"105\";}i:1;a:1:{s:9:\"target_id\";s:3:\"106\";}}}}s:9:\"\0*\0fields\";a:0:{}s:19:\"\0*\0fieldDefinitions\";N;s:12:\"\0*\0languages\";N;s:14:\"\0*\0langcodeKey\";s:8:\"langcode\";s:21:\"\0*\0defaultLangcodeKey\";s:16:\"default_langcode\";s:17:\"\0*\0activeLangcode\";s:9:\"x-default\";s:28:\"\0*\0enforceDefaultTranslation\";N;s:18:\"\0*\0defaultLangcode\";s:2:\"en\";s:15:\"\0*\0translations\";a:1:{s:9:\"x-default\";a:1:{s:6:\"status\";i:1;}}s:24:\"\0*\0translationInitialize\";b:0;s:14:\"\0*\0newRevision\";b:0;s:20:\"\0*\0isDefaultRevision\";b:1;s:13:\"\0*\0entityKeys\";a:4:{s:6:\"bundle\";s:10:\"lms_course\";s:2:\"id\";s:2:\"37\";s:4:\"uuid\";s:36:\"92137dd9-40b8-419c-87aa-e2b39be8775d\";s:9:\"published\";s:1:\"1\";}s:25:\"\0*\0translatableEntityKeys\";a:4:{s:5:\"label\";a:1:{s:9:\"x-default\";s:45:\"Building a Data-Driven Culture for AI Success\";}s:8:\"langcode\";a:1:{s:9:\"x-default\";s:2:\"en\";}s:5:\"owner\";a:1:{s:9:\"x-default\";s:1:\"1\";}s:16:\"default_langcode\";a:1:{s:9:\"x-default\";s:1:\"1\";}}s:12:\"\0*\0validated\";b:0;s:21:\"\0*\0validationRequired\";b:0;s:19:\"\0*\0loadedRevisionId\";N;s:33:\"\0*\0revisionTranslationAffectedKey\";s:29:\"revision_translation_affected\";s:37:\"\0*\0enforceRevisionTranslationAffected\";a:0:{}s:12:\"\0*\0isSyncing\";b:0;}',-1,1774587141.787,1,'entity_field_info','0'),
('values:lms_course:38','O:31:\"Drupal\\lms_course\\Entity\\Course\":30:{s:15:\"\0*\0entityTypeId\";s:10:\"lms_course\";s:15:\"\0*\0enforceIsNew\";N;s:12:\"\0*\0typedData\";N;s:17:\"\0*\0originalEntity\";N;s:16:\"\0*\0cacheContexts\";a:0:{}s:12:\"\0*\0cacheTags\";a:0:{}s:14:\"\0*\0cacheMaxAge\";i:-1;s:14:\"\0*\0_serviceIds\";a:0:{}s:18:\"\0*\0_entityStorages\";a:0:{}s:9:\"\0*\0values\";a:26:{s:2:\"id\";a:1:{s:9:\"x-default\";s:2:\"38\";}s:4:\"uuid\";a:1:{s:9:\"x-default\";s:36:\"92b0cc13-b806-4b31-8fe2-cfac8fb66085\";}s:8:\"langcode\";a:1:{s:9:\"x-default\";s:2:\"en\";}s:3:\"uid\";a:1:{s:9:\"x-default\";s:1:\"1\";}s:4:\"name\";a:1:{s:9:\"x-default\";s:49:\"Cloud Platforms for AI Development and Deployment\";}s:17:\"field_description\";a:1:{s:9:\"x-default\";a:2:{s:5:\"value\";s:1859:\"<p>In today\'s fast-paced digital landscape, Artificial Intelligence (AI) is no longer confined to specialized labs but is rapidly becoming an integral part of enterprise operations. To harness the full potential of AI, organizations need robust, scalable, and cost-effective infrastructure. This is where cloud platforms shine.</p>\n\n<p>The <strong>\"Cloud Platforms for AI Development and Deployment\"</strong> course provides a comprehensive deep dive into how leading cloud providers empower businesses to develop, train, and deploy AI applications at scale. You\'ll move beyond theoretical concepts and gain practical insights into selecting the right cloud services, optimizing resource utilization, and ensuring the security and compliance of your AI workloads.</p>\n\n<h3>Why is this course crucial for your career?</h3>\n<ul>\n    <li><strong>Scalability:</strong> Understand how cloud platforms offer unparalleled scalability, allowing AI models to handle vast amounts of data and complex computations.</li>\n    <li><strong>Accessibility:</strong> Learn to access cutting-edge AI tools and services without significant upfront hardware investments.</li>\n    <li><strong>Efficiency:</strong> Discover techniques to streamline AI development pipelines, from data ingestion to model deployment and monitoring.</li>\n    <li><strong>Cost-Effectiveness:</strong> Grasp strategies for managing cloud costs effectively while maximizing AI project ROI.</li>\n    <li><strong>Innovation:</strong> Stay ahead by leveraging the latest advancements in AI services offered by major cloud providers.</li>\n</ul>\n\n<p>Whether you\'re an AI developer, data scientist, solution architect, or IT manager, this course will equip you with the knowledge to build and manage powerful AI applications that drive real business value, leveraging the elasticity and power of the cloud.</p>\";s:6:\"format\";s:9:\"full_html\";}}s:23:\"field_short_description\";a:1:{s:9:\"x-default\";a:2:{s:5:\"value\";s:224:\"Explore the essential cloud platforms and services designed for building, training, and deploying AI models efficiently. Learn to leverage cloud infrastructure for scalable and robust AI solutions in enterprise environments.\";s:6:\"format\";s:9:\"full_html\";}}s:15:\"field_thumbnail\";a:1:{s:9:\"x-default\";a:5:{s:9:\"target_id\";s:2:\"77\";s:3:\"alt\";s:61:\"Cloud Platforms for AI Development and Deployment Cover Image\";s:5:\"title\";N;s:5:\"width\";s:3:\"640\";s:6:\"height\";s:3:\"640\";}}s:12:\"field_banner\";a:1:{s:9:\"x-default\";a:5:{s:9:\"target_id\";N;s:3:\"alt\";N;s:5:\"title\";N;s:5:\"width\";N;s:6:\"height\";N;}}s:14:\"field_category\";a:1:{s:9:\"x-default\";s:2:\"55\";}s:11:\"field_level\";a:1:{s:9:\"x-default\";s:1:\"2\";}s:14:\"field_language\";a:1:{s:9:\"x-default\";N;}s:11:\"field_price\";a:1:{s:9:\"x-default\";s:6:\"149.99\";}s:16:\"field_price_type\";a:1:{s:9:\"x-default\";s:4:\"paid\";}s:14:\"field_duration\";a:1:{s:9:\"x-default\";s:3:\"300\";}s:16:\"field_bestseller\";a:1:{s:9:\"x-default\";s:1:\"0\";}s:14:\"field_featured\";a:1:{s:9:\"x-default\";s:1:\"1\";}s:6:\"status\";a:1:{s:9:\"x-default\";s:1:\"1\";}s:7:\"created\";a:1:{s:9:\"x-default\";s:10:\"1774442931\";}s:7:\"changed\";a:1:{s:9:\"x-default\";s:10:\"1774451280\";}s:16:\"default_langcode\";a:1:{s:9:\"x-default\";s:1:\"1\";}s:16:\"field_what_learn\";a:1:{s:9:\"x-default\";a:2:{s:5:\"value\";s:793:\"<ul>\n    <li>Understand the fundamental benefits of using cloud platforms for AI development and deployment.</li>\n    <li>Identify and compare key AI/ML services offered by major cloud providers (e.g., AWS, Azure, GCP).</li>\n    <li>Learn to set up and configure cloud environments optimized for AI model training and inference.</li>\n    <li>Explore strategies for managing data storage, processing, and governance for AI projects in the cloud.</li>\n    <li>Master techniques for deploying, monitoring, and updating AI models in production environments using cloud tools.</li>\n    <li>Evaluate security best practices and compliance considerations for AI workloads on cloud platforms.</li>\n    <li>Optimize cloud resource utilization and manage costs associated with AI initiatives.</li>\n</ul>\";s:6:\"format\";s:9:\"full_html\";}}s:19:\"field_prerequisites\";a:1:{s:9:\"x-default\";a:2:{s:5:\"value\";s:282:\"Basic understanding of AI/ML concepts and data science workflows. Familiarity with programming languages like Python is beneficial but not strictly required for conceptual understanding. No prior cloud experience is necessary, but a general understanding of IT infrastructure helps.\";s:6:\"format\";s:9:\"full_html\";}}s:13:\"field_who_for\";a:1:{s:9:\"x-default\";a:2:{s:5:\"value\";s:210:\"AI Developers, Data Scientists, Machine Learning Engineers, Solution Architects, IT Managers, and anyone looking to leverage cloud platforms for building and deploying AI applications in a professional setting.\";s:6:\"format\";s:9:\"full_html\";}}s:12:\"field_rating\";a:1:{s:9:\"x-default\";s:3:\"5.0\";}s:14:\"field_chapters\";a:1:{s:9:\"x-default\";a:2:{i:0;a:1:{s:9:\"target_id\";s:3:\"107\";}i:1;a:1:{s:9:\"target_id\";s:3:\"108\";}}}}s:9:\"\0*\0fields\";a:0:{}s:19:\"\0*\0fieldDefinitions\";N;s:12:\"\0*\0languages\";N;s:14:\"\0*\0langcodeKey\";s:8:\"langcode\";s:21:\"\0*\0defaultLangcodeKey\";s:16:\"default_langcode\";s:17:\"\0*\0activeLangcode\";s:9:\"x-default\";s:28:\"\0*\0enforceDefaultTranslation\";N;s:18:\"\0*\0defaultLangcode\";s:2:\"en\";s:15:\"\0*\0translations\";a:1:{s:9:\"x-default\";a:1:{s:6:\"status\";i:1;}}s:24:\"\0*\0translationInitialize\";b:0;s:14:\"\0*\0newRevision\";b:0;s:20:\"\0*\0isDefaultRevision\";b:1;s:13:\"\0*\0entityKeys\";a:4:{s:6:\"bundle\";s:10:\"lms_course\";s:2:\"id\";s:2:\"38\";s:4:\"uuid\";s:36:\"92b0cc13-b806-4b31-8fe2-cfac8fb66085\";s:9:\"published\";s:1:\"1\";}s:25:\"\0*\0translatableEntityKeys\";a:4:{s:5:\"label\";a:1:{s:9:\"x-default\";s:49:\"Cloud Platforms for AI Development and Deployment\";}s:8:\"langcode\";a:1:{s:9:\"x-default\";s:2:\"en\";}s:5:\"owner\";a:1:{s:9:\"x-default\";s:1:\"1\";}s:16:\"default_langcode\";a:1:{s:9:\"x-default\";s:1:\"1\";}}s:12:\"\0*\0validated\";b:0;s:21:\"\0*\0validationRequired\";b:0;s:19:\"\0*\0loadedRevisionId\";N;s:33:\"\0*\0revisionTranslationAffectedKey\";s:29:\"revision_translation_affected\";s:37:\"\0*\0enforceRevisionTranslationAffected\";a:0:{}s:12:\"\0*\0isSyncing\";b:0;}',-1,1774587141.787,1,'entity_field_info','0'),
('values:lms_course:39','O:31:\"Drupal\\lms_course\\Entity\\Course\":30:{s:15:\"\0*\0entityTypeId\";s:10:\"lms_course\";s:15:\"\0*\0enforceIsNew\";N;s:12:\"\0*\0typedData\";N;s:17:\"\0*\0originalEntity\";N;s:16:\"\0*\0cacheContexts\";a:0:{}s:12:\"\0*\0cacheTags\";a:0:{}s:14:\"\0*\0cacheMaxAge\";i:-1;s:14:\"\0*\0_serviceIds\";a:0:{}s:18:\"\0*\0_entityStorages\";a:0:{}s:9:\"\0*\0values\";a:26:{s:2:\"id\";a:1:{s:9:\"x-default\";s:2:\"39\";}s:4:\"uuid\";a:1:{s:9:\"x-default\";s:36:\"fd946675-cb4f-4418-99e3-716ec6d97d26\";}s:8:\"langcode\";a:1:{s:9:\"x-default\";s:2:\"en\";}s:3:\"uid\";a:1:{s:9:\"x-default\";s:1:\"1\";}s:4:\"name\";a:1:{s:9:\"x-default\";s:35:\"AI Project Management and Lifecycle\";}s:17:\"field_description\";a:1:{s:9:\"x-default\";a:2:{s:5:\"value\";s:1443:\"<p>Embark on a comprehensive journey to master the art and science of managing Artificial Intelligence projects. Unlike traditional software development, AI projects present unique complexities, from data acquisition and model training to iterative refinement and ethical considerations. This course provides a robust framework for navigating these challenges, ensuring your AI initiatives deliver tangible value and maintain alignment with organizational goals.</p><p>You\'ll delve into the distinct phases of an AI project lifecycle, starting with problem definition and feasibility assessment. We\'ll cover strategies for effective data collection, cleaning, and annotation, which are foundational to any successful AI endeavor. Learn how to select appropriate machine learning models, manage experimentation, and rigorously evaluate performance. The course emphasizes agile methodologies adapted for AI, promoting iterative development, rapid prototyping, and continuous feedback loops.</p><p>Beyond technical aspects, we address critical managerial components: building cross-functional teams, stakeholder communication, risk identification and mitigation, and ensuring ethical AI deployment. Practical case studies and real-world scenarios will illustrate best practices and common pitfalls, equipping you with the foresight to lead your AI projects with confidence and achieve impactful, responsible outcomes within your organization.</p>\";s:6:\"format\";s:9:\"full_html\";}}s:23:\"field_short_description\";a:1:{s:9:\"x-default\";a:2:{s:5:\"value\";s:256:\"Master the unique challenges of AI projects, from ideation and data preparation to model deployment and maintenance. Learn agile methodologies tailored for AI, risk management, and ethical considerations to drive successful AI initiatives in the workplace.\";s:6:\"format\";s:9:\"full_html\";}}s:15:\"field_thumbnail\";a:1:{s:9:\"x-default\";a:5:{s:9:\"target_id\";s:2:\"78\";s:3:\"alt\";s:47:\"AI Project Management and Lifecycle Cover Image\";s:5:\"title\";N;s:5:\"width\";s:3:\"640\";s:6:\"height\";s:3:\"640\";}}s:12:\"field_banner\";a:1:{s:9:\"x-default\";a:5:{s:9:\"target_id\";N;s:3:\"alt\";N;s:5:\"title\";N;s:5:\"width\";N;s:6:\"height\";N;}}s:14:\"field_category\";a:1:{s:9:\"x-default\";s:2:\"56\";}s:11:\"field_level\";a:1:{s:9:\"x-default\";s:1:\"2\";}s:14:\"field_language\";a:1:{s:9:\"x-default\";N;}s:11:\"field_price\";a:1:{s:9:\"x-default\";s:6:\"249.99\";}s:16:\"field_price_type\";a:1:{s:9:\"x-default\";s:4:\"paid\";}s:14:\"field_duration\";a:1:{s:9:\"x-default\";s:3:\"360\";}s:16:\"field_bestseller\";a:1:{s:9:\"x-default\";s:1:\"0\";}s:14:\"field_featured\";a:1:{s:9:\"x-default\";s:1:\"1\";}s:6:\"status\";a:1:{s:9:\"x-default\";s:1:\"1\";}s:7:\"created\";a:1:{s:9:\"x-default\";s:10:\"1774442931\";}s:7:\"changed\";a:1:{s:9:\"x-default\";s:10:\"1774451280\";}s:16:\"default_langcode\";a:1:{s:9:\"x-default\";s:1:\"1\";}s:16:\"field_what_learn\";a:1:{s:9:\"x-default\";a:2:{s:5:\"value\";s:741:\"<ul><li>Understand the distinct phases and challenges of the AI project lifecycle.</li><li>Apply agile methodologies and iterative approaches specifically designed for AI development.</li><li>Master techniques for effective data acquisition, preparation, and management in AI projects.</li><li>Learn strategies for model selection, experimentation, evaluation, and iteration.</li><li>Identify and mitigate common risks associated with AI project development and deployment.</li><li>Develop skills in building and leading cross-functional AI teams.</li><li>Address ethical considerations and ensure responsible AI deployment.</li><li>Communicate project progress and outcomes effectively to technical and non-technical stakeholders.</li></ul>\";s:6:\"format\";s:9:\"full_html\";}}s:19:\"field_prerequisites\";a:1:{s:9:\"x-default\";a:2:{s:5:\"value\";s:230:\"A basic understanding of data concepts and general project management principles is recommended. Familiarity with fundamental AI/ML terminology is beneficial but not strictly required. No advanced programming skills are necessary.\";s:6:\"format\";s:9:\"full_html\";}}s:13:\"field_who_for\";a:1:{s:9:\"x-default\";a:2:{s:5:\"value\";s:198:\"Project managers, team leads, business analysts, product owners, aspiring AI project managers, and anyone involved in initiating, planning, or overseeing AI/ML initiatives within their organization.\";s:6:\"format\";s:9:\"full_html\";}}s:12:\"field_rating\";a:1:{s:9:\"x-default\";s:3:\"5.0\";}s:14:\"field_chapters\";a:1:{s:9:\"x-default\";a:2:{i:0;a:1:{s:9:\"target_id\";s:3:\"109\";}i:1;a:1:{s:9:\"target_id\";s:3:\"110\";}}}}s:9:\"\0*\0fields\";a:0:{}s:19:\"\0*\0fieldDefinitions\";N;s:12:\"\0*\0languages\";N;s:14:\"\0*\0langcodeKey\";s:8:\"langcode\";s:21:\"\0*\0defaultLangcodeKey\";s:16:\"default_langcode\";s:17:\"\0*\0activeLangcode\";s:9:\"x-default\";s:28:\"\0*\0enforceDefaultTranslation\";N;s:18:\"\0*\0defaultLangcode\";s:2:\"en\";s:15:\"\0*\0translations\";a:1:{s:9:\"x-default\";a:1:{s:6:\"status\";i:1;}}s:24:\"\0*\0translationInitialize\";b:0;s:14:\"\0*\0newRevision\";b:0;s:20:\"\0*\0isDefaultRevision\";b:1;s:13:\"\0*\0entityKeys\";a:4:{s:6:\"bundle\";s:10:\"lms_course\";s:2:\"id\";s:2:\"39\";s:4:\"uuid\";s:36:\"fd946675-cb4f-4418-99e3-716ec6d97d26\";s:9:\"published\";s:1:\"1\";}s:25:\"\0*\0translatableEntityKeys\";a:4:{s:5:\"label\";a:1:{s:9:\"x-default\";s:35:\"AI Project Management and Lifecycle\";}s:8:\"langcode\";a:1:{s:9:\"x-default\";s:2:\"en\";}s:5:\"owner\";a:1:{s:9:\"x-default\";s:1:\"1\";}s:16:\"default_langcode\";a:1:{s:9:\"x-default\";s:1:\"1\";}}s:12:\"\0*\0validated\";b:0;s:21:\"\0*\0validationRequired\";b:0;s:19:\"\0*\0loadedRevisionId\";N;s:33:\"\0*\0revisionTranslationAffectedKey\";s:29:\"revision_translation_affected\";s:37:\"\0*\0enforceRevisionTranslationAffected\";a:0:{}s:12:\"\0*\0isSyncing\";b:0;}',-1,1774587141.787,1,'entity_field_info','0'),
('values:lms_course:40','O:31:\"Drupal\\lms_course\\Entity\\Course\":30:{s:15:\"\0*\0entityTypeId\";s:10:\"lms_course\";s:15:\"\0*\0enforceIsNew\";N;s:12:\"\0*\0typedData\";N;s:17:\"\0*\0originalEntity\";N;s:16:\"\0*\0cacheContexts\";a:0:{}s:12:\"\0*\0cacheTags\";a:0:{}s:14:\"\0*\0cacheMaxAge\";i:-1;s:14:\"\0*\0_serviceIds\";a:0:{}s:18:\"\0*\0_entityStorages\";a:0:{}s:9:\"\0*\0values\";a:26:{s:2:\"id\";a:1:{s:9:\"x-default\";s:2:\"40\";}s:4:\"uuid\";a:1:{s:9:\"x-default\";s:36:\"a54d80d5-e54d-4416-bc0d-2722e09052c6\";}s:8:\"langcode\";a:1:{s:9:\"x-default\";s:2:\"en\";}s:3:\"uid\";a:1:{s:9:\"x-default\";s:1:\"1\";}s:4:\"name\";a:1:{s:9:\"x-default\";s:42:\"AI Model Deployment and MLOps Fundamentals\";}s:17:\"field_description\";a:1:{s:9:\"x-default\";a:2:{s:5:\"value\";s:1096:\"<p>Bringing an AI model from development to production is often the most challenging phase of an AI project. This comprehensive course, <strong>\"AI Model Deployment and MLOps Fundamentals,\"</strong> equips you with the critical knowledge and practical skills to navigate this complex landscape. You\'ll delve into the principles of Machine Learning Operations (MLOps), understanding how to streamline the entire AI lifecycle from data ingestion and model training to deployment, monitoring, and maintenance.</p><p>We\'ll cover key topics such as containerization with Docker, orchestration with Kubernetes, setting up CI/CD pipelines for machine learning, model versioning, monitoring model performance in real-time, and strategies for ensuring model fairness and explainability in production environments. Learn how to build robust, scalable, and maintainable AI systems that deliver continuous value to your organization. This course is essential for anyone looking to operationalize AI effectively and ensure their models move beyond the lab and into real-world applications with confidence.</p>\";s:6:\"format\";s:9:\"full_html\";}}s:23:\"field_short_description\";a:1:{s:9:\"x-default\";a:2:{s:5:\"value\";s:176:\"Master the essential practices for deploying AI models reliably and efficiently, and learn the core principles of MLOps to bridge the gap between AI development and production.\";s:6:\"format\";s:9:\"full_html\";}}s:15:\"field_thumbnail\";a:1:{s:9:\"x-default\";a:5:{s:9:\"target_id\";s:2:\"74\";s:3:\"alt\";s:54:\"AI Model Deployment and MLOps Fundamentals Cover Image\";s:5:\"title\";N;s:5:\"width\";s:3:\"640\";s:6:\"height\";s:3:\"640\";}}s:12:\"field_banner\";a:1:{s:9:\"x-default\";a:5:{s:9:\"target_id\";N;s:3:\"alt\";N;s:5:\"title\";N;s:5:\"width\";N;s:6:\"height\";N;}}s:14:\"field_category\";a:1:{s:9:\"x-default\";s:2:\"56\";}s:11:\"field_level\";a:1:{s:9:\"x-default\";s:1:\"1\";}s:14:\"field_language\";a:1:{s:9:\"x-default\";N;}s:11:\"field_price\";a:1:{s:9:\"x-default\";s:6:\"299.99\";}s:16:\"field_price_type\";a:1:{s:9:\"x-default\";s:4:\"paid\";}s:14:\"field_duration\";a:1:{s:9:\"x-default\";s:3:\"540\";}s:16:\"field_bestseller\";a:1:{s:9:\"x-default\";s:1:\"1\";}s:14:\"field_featured\";a:1:{s:9:\"x-default\";s:1:\"1\";}s:6:\"status\";a:1:{s:9:\"x-default\";s:1:\"1\";}s:7:\"created\";a:1:{s:9:\"x-default\";s:10:\"1774442931\";}s:7:\"changed\";a:1:{s:9:\"x-default\";s:10:\"1774451280\";}s:16:\"default_langcode\";a:1:{s:9:\"x-default\";s:1:\"1\";}s:16:\"field_what_learn\";a:1:{s:9:\"x-default\";a:2:{s:5:\"value\";s:729:\"<ul><li>Understand the core concepts and benefits of MLOps.</li><li>Design and implement robust CI/CD pipelines for machine learning models.</li><li>Utilize containerization (Docker) and orchestration (Kubernetes) for scalable model deployment.</li><li>Implement strategies for model versioning, tracking, and reproducibility.</li><li>Set up effective monitoring and alerting for deployed AI models.</li><li>Learn best practices for model retraining, updating, and rollback.</li><li>Address challenges related to data drift, concept drift, and model decay in production.</li><li>Explore tools and platforms commonly used in MLOps workflows.</li><li>Ensure the ethical deployment and responsible governance of AI models.</li></ul>\";s:6:\"format\";s:9:\"full_html\";}}s:19:\"field_prerequisites\";a:1:{s:9:\"x-default\";a:2:{s:5:\"value\";s:380:\"<p>Participants should have a foundational understanding of machine learning concepts, including model training, evaluation metrics, and common algorithms. Basic proficiency in Python programming and familiarity with command-line interfaces are also recommended. Prior exposure to cloud platforms (AWS, Azure, GCP) or DevOps principles is beneficial but not strictly required.</p>\";s:6:\"format\";s:9:\"full_html\";}}s:13:\"field_who_for\";a:1:{s:9:\"x-default\";a:2:{s:5:\"value\";s:592:\"<p>This course is ideal for:</p><ul><li><strong>Data Scientists and Machine Learning Engineers</strong> looking to transition their models from research to production.</li><li><strong>DevOps Engineers</strong> interested in extending their expertise to machine learning workflows.</li><li><strong>AI Project Managers</strong> who need to understand the operational aspects of AI projects.</li><li><strong>Software Developers</strong> working on AI-powered applications.</li><li><strong>Technical Leads and Architects</strong> responsible for designing and implementing AI solutions.</li></ul>\";s:6:\"format\";s:9:\"full_html\";}}s:12:\"field_rating\";a:1:{s:9:\"x-default\";s:3:\"5.0\";}s:14:\"field_chapters\";a:1:{s:9:\"x-default\";a:2:{i:0;a:1:{s:9:\"target_id\";s:3:\"111\";}i:1;a:1:{s:9:\"target_id\";s:3:\"112\";}}}}s:9:\"\0*\0fields\";a:0:{}s:19:\"\0*\0fieldDefinitions\";N;s:12:\"\0*\0languages\";N;s:14:\"\0*\0langcodeKey\";s:8:\"langcode\";s:21:\"\0*\0defaultLangcodeKey\";s:16:\"default_langcode\";s:17:\"\0*\0activeLangcode\";s:9:\"x-default\";s:28:\"\0*\0enforceDefaultTranslation\";N;s:18:\"\0*\0defaultLangcode\";s:2:\"en\";s:15:\"\0*\0translations\";a:1:{s:9:\"x-default\";a:1:{s:6:\"status\";i:1;}}s:24:\"\0*\0translationInitialize\";b:0;s:14:\"\0*\0newRevision\";b:0;s:20:\"\0*\0isDefaultRevision\";b:1;s:13:\"\0*\0entityKeys\";a:4:{s:6:\"bundle\";s:10:\"lms_course\";s:2:\"id\";s:2:\"40\";s:4:\"uuid\";s:36:\"a54d80d5-e54d-4416-bc0d-2722e09052c6\";s:9:\"published\";s:1:\"1\";}s:25:\"\0*\0translatableEntityKeys\";a:4:{s:5:\"label\";a:1:{s:9:\"x-default\";s:42:\"AI Model Deployment and MLOps Fundamentals\";}s:8:\"langcode\";a:1:{s:9:\"x-default\";s:2:\"en\";}s:5:\"owner\";a:1:{s:9:\"x-default\";s:1:\"1\";}s:16:\"default_langcode\";a:1:{s:9:\"x-default\";s:1:\"1\";}}s:12:\"\0*\0validated\";b:0;s:21:\"\0*\0validationRequired\";b:0;s:19:\"\0*\0loadedRevisionId\";N;s:33:\"\0*\0revisionTranslationAffectedKey\";s:29:\"revision_translation_affected\";s:37:\"\0*\0enforceRevisionTranslationAffected\";a:0:{}s:12:\"\0*\0isSyncing\";b:0;}',-1,1774587141.787,1,'entity_field_info','0'),
('values:lms_course:41','O:31:\"Drupal\\lms_course\\Entity\\Course\":30:{s:15:\"\0*\0entityTypeId\";s:10:\"lms_course\";s:15:\"\0*\0enforceIsNew\";N;s:12:\"\0*\0typedData\";N;s:17:\"\0*\0originalEntity\";N;s:16:\"\0*\0cacheContexts\";a:0:{}s:12:\"\0*\0cacheTags\";a:0:{}s:14:\"\0*\0cacheMaxAge\";i:-1;s:14:\"\0*\0_serviceIds\";a:0:{}s:18:\"\0*\0_entityStorages\";a:0:{}s:9:\"\0*\0values\";a:26:{s:2:\"id\";a:1:{s:9:\"x-default\";s:2:\"41\";}s:4:\"uuid\";a:1:{s:9:\"x-default\";s:36:\"42a72ef7-3521-447e-8bc7-4d4a742ffb03\";}s:8:\"langcode\";a:1:{s:9:\"x-default\";s:2:\"en\";}s:3:\"uid\";a:1:{s:9:\"x-default\";s:1:\"1\";}s:4:\"name\";a:1:{s:9:\"x-default\";s:34:\"Measuring and Demonstrating AI ROI\";}s:17:\"field_description\";a:1:{s:9:\"x-default\";a:2:{s:5:\"value\";s:1482:\"<h3>Unlock the True Value of Your AI Investments</h3><p>In today\'s data-driven landscape, organizations are investing heavily in Artificial Intelligence. But how do you prove these investments are paying off? This comprehensive course, <strong>Measuring and Demonstrating AI ROI</strong>, provides you with the frameworks, tools, and best practices to quantify the tangible and intangible benefits of your AI projects.</p><p>You will move beyond mere technical implementation to understand the financial and strategic impact of AI. From identifying key performance indicators (KPIs) to building robust business cases and presenting compelling results to stakeholders, this course equips you to become a champion for AI\'s value within your enterprise.</p><h4>What makes this course essential?</h4><ul><li><strong>Practical Frameworks:</strong> Learn proven methodologies for ROI calculation specific to AI projects.</li><li><strong>Real-World Examples:</strong> Explore case studies illustrating successful AI ROI measurement across various industries.</li><li><strong>Stakeholder Communication:</strong> Master the art of articulating AI\'s value to executives, investors, and teams.</li><li><strong>Risk Mitigation:</strong> Understand how to factor in costs, risks, and ethical considerations for a holistic ROI view.</li></ul><p>Empower yourself to not only implement AI but also to strategically justify its existence and expansion, ensuring long-term success and innovation.</p>\";s:6:\"format\";s:9:\"full_html\";}}s:23:\"field_short_description\";a:1:{s:9:\"x-default\";a:2:{s:5:\"value\";s:191:\"Learn to effectively measure, quantify, and communicate the return on investment (ROI) for AI initiatives, ensuring their strategic value is recognized and sustained within your organization.\";s:6:\"format\";s:9:\"full_html\";}}s:15:\"field_thumbnail\";a:1:{s:9:\"x-default\";a:5:{s:9:\"target_id\";s:2:\"79\";s:3:\"alt\";s:46:\"Measuring and Demonstrating AI ROI Cover Image\";s:5:\"title\";N;s:5:\"width\";s:3:\"640\";s:6:\"height\";s:3:\"640\";}}s:12:\"field_banner\";a:1:{s:9:\"x-default\";a:5:{s:9:\"target_id\";N;s:3:\"alt\";N;s:5:\"title\";N;s:5:\"width\";N;s:6:\"height\";N;}}s:14:\"field_category\";a:1:{s:9:\"x-default\";s:2:\"56\";}s:11:\"field_level\";a:1:{s:9:\"x-default\";s:1:\"2\";}s:14:\"field_language\";a:1:{s:9:\"x-default\";N;}s:11:\"field_price\";a:1:{s:9:\"x-default\";s:6:\"149.99\";}s:16:\"field_price_type\";a:1:{s:9:\"x-default\";s:4:\"paid\";}s:14:\"field_duration\";a:1:{s:9:\"x-default\";s:3:\"240\";}s:16:\"field_bestseller\";a:1:{s:9:\"x-default\";s:1:\"0\";}s:14:\"field_featured\";a:1:{s:9:\"x-default\";s:1:\"1\";}s:6:\"status\";a:1:{s:9:\"x-default\";s:1:\"1\";}s:7:\"created\";a:1:{s:9:\"x-default\";s:10:\"1774442931\";}s:7:\"changed\";a:1:{s:9:\"x-default\";s:10:\"1774451280\";}s:16:\"default_langcode\";a:1:{s:9:\"x-default\";s:1:\"1\";}s:16:\"field_what_learn\";a:1:{s:9:\"x-default\";a:2:{s:5:\"value\";s:664:\"<ul><li>Identify and define key metrics for measuring AI project success and ROI.</li><li>Develop robust methodologies for quantifying direct and indirect financial benefits of AI applications.</li><li>Construct compelling business cases and financial models for AI initiatives.</li><li>Effectively communicate AI\'s value proposition and ROI to diverse stakeholders.</li><li>Understand the challenges and best practices in attributing ROI to complex AI systems.</li><li>Evaluate the impact of AI on operational efficiency, customer experience, and strategic growth.</li><li>Incorporate ethical considerations and risk assessment into AI ROI calculations.</li></ul>\";s:6:\"format\";s:9:\"full_html\";}}s:19:\"field_prerequisites\";a:1:{s:9:\"x-default\";a:2:{s:5:\"value\";s:167:\"Basic understanding of business finance concepts and familiarity with AI terminology and typical AI project lifecycles. No advanced technical AI knowledge is required.\";s:6:\"format\";s:9:\"full_html\";}}s:13:\"field_who_for\";a:1:{s:9:\"x-default\";a:2:{s:5:\"value\";s:349:\"This course is ideal for project managers, business analysts, data scientists, AI strategists, IT leaders, financial managers, and anyone involved in the evaluation, funding, or oversight of AI initiatives within their organization. It is particularly valuable for professionals seeking to bridge the gap between AI technology and business outcomes.\";s:6:\"format\";s:9:\"full_html\";}}s:12:\"field_rating\";a:1:{s:9:\"x-default\";s:3:\"5.0\";}s:14:\"field_chapters\";a:1:{s:9:\"x-default\";a:2:{i:0;a:1:{s:9:\"target_id\";s:3:\"113\";}i:1;a:1:{s:9:\"target_id\";s:3:\"114\";}}}}s:9:\"\0*\0fields\";a:0:{}s:19:\"\0*\0fieldDefinitions\";N;s:12:\"\0*\0languages\";N;s:14:\"\0*\0langcodeKey\";s:8:\"langcode\";s:21:\"\0*\0defaultLangcodeKey\";s:16:\"default_langcode\";s:17:\"\0*\0activeLangcode\";s:9:\"x-default\";s:28:\"\0*\0enforceDefaultTranslation\";N;s:18:\"\0*\0defaultLangcode\";s:2:\"en\";s:15:\"\0*\0translations\";a:1:{s:9:\"x-default\";a:1:{s:6:\"status\";i:1;}}s:24:\"\0*\0translationInitialize\";b:0;s:14:\"\0*\0newRevision\";b:0;s:20:\"\0*\0isDefaultRevision\";b:1;s:13:\"\0*\0entityKeys\";a:4:{s:6:\"bundle\";s:10:\"lms_course\";s:2:\"id\";s:2:\"41\";s:4:\"uuid\";s:36:\"42a72ef7-3521-447e-8bc7-4d4a742ffb03\";s:9:\"published\";s:1:\"1\";}s:25:\"\0*\0translatableEntityKeys\";a:4:{s:5:\"label\";a:1:{s:9:\"x-default\";s:34:\"Measuring and Demonstrating AI ROI\";}s:8:\"langcode\";a:1:{s:9:\"x-default\";s:2:\"en\";}s:5:\"owner\";a:1:{s:9:\"x-default\";s:1:\"1\";}s:16:\"default_langcode\";a:1:{s:9:\"x-default\";s:1:\"1\";}}s:12:\"\0*\0validated\";b:0;s:21:\"\0*\0validationRequired\";b:0;s:19:\"\0*\0loadedRevisionId\";N;s:33:\"\0*\0revisionTranslationAffectedKey\";s:29:\"revision_translation_affected\";s:37:\"\0*\0enforceRevisionTranslationAffected\";a:0:{}s:12:\"\0*\0isSyncing\";b:0;}',-1,1774587141.787,1,'entity_field_info','0'),
('values:lms_course:42','O:31:\"Drupal\\lms_course\\Entity\\Course\":30:{s:15:\"\0*\0entityTypeId\";s:10:\"lms_course\";s:15:\"\0*\0enforceIsNew\";N;s:12:\"\0*\0typedData\";N;s:17:\"\0*\0originalEntity\";N;s:16:\"\0*\0cacheContexts\";a:0:{}s:12:\"\0*\0cacheTags\";a:0:{}s:14:\"\0*\0cacheMaxAge\";i:-1;s:14:\"\0*\0_serviceIds\";a:0:{}s:18:\"\0*\0_entityStorages\";a:0:{}s:9:\"\0*\0values\";a:26:{s:2:\"id\";a:1:{s:9:\"x-default\";s:2:\"42\";}s:4:\"uuid\";a:1:{s:9:\"x-default\";s:36:\"aa328944-6b74-4f49-9dca-cdcd923be658\";}s:8:\"langcode\";a:1:{s:9:\"x-default\";s:2:\"en\";}s:3:\"uid\";a:1:{s:9:\"x-default\";s:1:\"1\";}s:4:\"name\";a:1:{s:9:\"x-default\";s:30:\"Building and Managing AI Teams\";}s:17:\"field_description\";a:1:{s:9:\"x-default\";a:2:{s:5:\"value\";s:1555:\"<p>In today\'s rapidly evolving business landscape, the success of AI initiatives hinges not just on cutting-edge algorithms, but on the strength and synergy of the teams behind them. The \'Building and Managing AI Teams\' course provides a comprehensive framework for leaders, managers, and aspiring professionals to effectively construct, lead, and sustain robust AI teams that deliver tangible value.</p><p>You will delve into the critical aspects of AI team dynamics, including defining essential roles, structuring teams for optimal collaboration, and implementing agile methodologies tailored for AI projects. The course emphasizes practical strategies for talent acquisition, skill development, and performance management unique to the AI domain.</p><p>Furthermore, we will explore the nuances of fostering an innovative culture, managing cross-functional dependencies, and addressing the ethical considerations inherent in AI development. By the end of this course, you will possess the knowledge and tools to empower your AI teams to overcome challenges, accelerate development cycles, and integrate AI solutions seamlessly into your workplace.</p><p><b>Key Takeaways:</b></p><ul><li>Understand the unique demands of leading AI projects.</li><li>Learn to identify and recruit the right talent for diverse AI roles.</li><li>Develop strategies for effective team structure and collaboration.</li><li>Master techniques for managing performance and fostering innovation.</li><li>Navigate ethical AI development and governance within your team.</li></ul>\";s:6:\"format\";s:9:\"full_html\";}}s:23:\"field_short_description\";a:1:{s:9:\"x-default\";a:2:{s:5:\"value\";s:267:\"Master the art of forming, leading, and optimizing high-performing AI teams to drive successful AI adoption and innovation within your organization. This course covers everything from identifying key roles to fostering collaboration and navigating ethical challenges.\";s:6:\"format\";s:9:\"full_html\";}}s:15:\"field_thumbnail\";a:1:{s:9:\"x-default\";a:5:{s:9:\"target_id\";s:2:\"80\";s:3:\"alt\";s:42:\"Building and Managing AI Teams Cover Image\";s:5:\"title\";N;s:5:\"width\";s:3:\"640\";s:6:\"height\";s:3:\"640\";}}s:12:\"field_banner\";a:1:{s:9:\"x-default\";a:5:{s:9:\"target_id\";N;s:3:\"alt\";N;s:5:\"title\";N;s:5:\"width\";N;s:6:\"height\";N;}}s:14:\"field_category\";a:1:{s:9:\"x-default\";s:2:\"56\";}s:11:\"field_level\";a:1:{s:9:\"x-default\";s:1:\"2\";}s:14:\"field_language\";a:1:{s:9:\"x-default\";N;}s:11:\"field_price\";a:1:{s:9:\"x-default\";s:6:\"299.99\";}s:16:\"field_price_type\";a:1:{s:9:\"x-default\";s:4:\"paid\";}s:14:\"field_duration\";a:1:{s:9:\"x-default\";s:3:\"300\";}s:16:\"field_bestseller\";a:1:{s:9:\"x-default\";s:1:\"0\";}s:14:\"field_featured\";a:1:{s:9:\"x-default\";s:1:\"1\";}s:6:\"status\";a:1:{s:9:\"x-default\";s:1:\"1\";}s:7:\"created\";a:1:{s:9:\"x-default\";s:10:\"1774442931\";}s:7:\"changed\";a:1:{s:9:\"x-default\";s:10:\"1774451280\";}s:16:\"default_langcode\";a:1:{s:9:\"x-default\";s:1:\"1\";}s:16:\"field_what_learn\";a:1:{s:9:\"x-default\";a:2:{s:5:\"value\";s:686:\"<ul><li>Identify and define the essential roles and skill sets required for a successful AI team.</li><li>Design effective organizational structures and collaboration models for AI projects.</li><li>Implement best practices for AI project management, including agile and MLOps principles.</li><li>Develop strategies for talent acquisition, retention, and continuous skill development within AI teams.</li><li>Foster a culture of innovation, continuous learning, and ethical responsibility.</li><li>Effectively manage cross-functional stakeholders and integrate AI solutions with business objectives.</li><li>Measure and demonstrate the impact and performance of your AI teams.</li></ul>\";s:6:\"format\";s:9:\"full_html\";}}s:19:\"field_prerequisites\";a:1:{s:9:\"x-default\";a:2:{s:5:\"value\";s:376:\"<ul><li>A foundational understanding of Artificial Intelligence and Machine Learning concepts.</li><li>Basic experience in project management or team leadership is beneficial.</li><li>Familiarity with general business operations and strategic thinking.</li><li>No advanced technical coding skills are required, but an appreciation for technical workflows is helpful.</li></ul>\";s:6:\"format\";s:9:\"full_html\";}}s:13:\"field_who_for\";a:1:{s:9:\"x-default\";a:2:{s:5:\"value\";s:561:\"<ul><li>Project Managers and Program Managers leading AI or data science initiatives.</li><li>Team Leads and Department Heads overseeing technical or innovation teams.</li><li>Aspiring AI Leaders, Directors, and Managers looking to specialize in AI team management.</li><li>HR Professionals involved in recruiting and developing AI talent.</li><li>Business Leaders and Executives seeking to understand how to best structure and support AI efforts.</li><li>Anyone interested in the organizational and leadership aspects of AI adoption in the workplace.</li></ul>\";s:6:\"format\";s:9:\"full_html\";}}s:12:\"field_rating\";a:1:{s:9:\"x-default\";s:3:\"5.0\";}s:14:\"field_chapters\";a:1:{s:9:\"x-default\";a:2:{i:0;a:1:{s:9:\"target_id\";s:3:\"115\";}i:1;a:1:{s:9:\"target_id\";s:3:\"116\";}}}}s:9:\"\0*\0fields\";a:0:{}s:19:\"\0*\0fieldDefinitions\";N;s:12:\"\0*\0languages\";N;s:14:\"\0*\0langcodeKey\";s:8:\"langcode\";s:21:\"\0*\0defaultLangcodeKey\";s:16:\"default_langcode\";s:17:\"\0*\0activeLangcode\";s:9:\"x-default\";s:28:\"\0*\0enforceDefaultTranslation\";N;s:18:\"\0*\0defaultLangcode\";s:2:\"en\";s:15:\"\0*\0translations\";a:1:{s:9:\"x-default\";a:1:{s:6:\"status\";i:1;}}s:24:\"\0*\0translationInitialize\";b:0;s:14:\"\0*\0newRevision\";b:0;s:20:\"\0*\0isDefaultRevision\";b:1;s:13:\"\0*\0entityKeys\";a:4:{s:6:\"bundle\";s:10:\"lms_course\";s:2:\"id\";s:2:\"42\";s:4:\"uuid\";s:36:\"aa328944-6b74-4f49-9dca-cdcd923be658\";s:9:\"published\";s:1:\"1\";}s:25:\"\0*\0translatableEntityKeys\";a:4:{s:5:\"label\";a:1:{s:9:\"x-default\";s:30:\"Building and Managing AI Teams\";}s:8:\"langcode\";a:1:{s:9:\"x-default\";s:2:\"en\";}s:5:\"owner\";a:1:{s:9:\"x-default\";s:1:\"1\";}s:16:\"default_langcode\";a:1:{s:9:\"x-default\";s:1:\"1\";}}s:12:\"\0*\0validated\";b:0;s:21:\"\0*\0validationRequired\";b:0;s:19:\"\0*\0loadedRevisionId\";N;s:33:\"\0*\0revisionTranslationAffectedKey\";s:29:\"revision_translation_affected\";s:37:\"\0*\0enforceRevisionTranslationAffected\";a:0:{}s:12:\"\0*\0isSyncing\";b:0;}',-1,1774587141.787,1,'entity_field_info','0'),
('values:lms_course:43','O:31:\"Drupal\\lms_course\\Entity\\Course\":30:{s:15:\"\0*\0entityTypeId\";s:10:\"lms_course\";s:15:\"\0*\0enforceIsNew\";N;s:12:\"\0*\0typedData\";N;s:17:\"\0*\0originalEntity\";N;s:16:\"\0*\0cacheContexts\";a:0:{}s:12:\"\0*\0cacheTags\";a:0:{}s:14:\"\0*\0cacheMaxAge\";i:-1;s:14:\"\0*\0_serviceIds\";a:0:{}s:18:\"\0*\0_entityStorages\";a:0:{}s:9:\"\0*\0values\";a:26:{s:2:\"id\";a:1:{s:9:\"x-default\";s:2:\"43\";}s:4:\"uuid\";a:1:{s:9:\"x-default\";s:36:\"c61c004b-009b-438a-be0b-0cb99ca9ba03\";}s:8:\"langcode\";a:1:{s:9:\"x-default\";s:2:\"en\";}s:3:\"uid\";a:1:{s:9:\"x-default\";s:1:\"1\";}s:4:\"name\";a:1:{s:9:\"x-default\";s:33:\"AI Governance and Risk Management\";}s:17:\"field_description\";a:1:{s:9:\"x-default\";a:2:{s:5:\"value\";s:1417:\"<p>As artificial intelligence becomes increasingly integrated into daily business operations, the need for robust governance frameworks and proactive risk management strategies is paramount. This comprehensive course, <b>AI Governance and Risk Management</b>, equips professionals with the essential knowledge and tools to establish ethical, compliant, and secure AI practices within their organizations.</p><p>You will delve into the core principles of AI ethics, understanding how to identify and mitigate biases, ensure transparency, and uphold accountability in AI systems. The course covers critical regulatory landscapes, including data privacy laws and emerging AI-specific regulations, providing a roadmap for achieving compliance. Learn to assess and manage various AI-related risks, from data security breaches and model failures to reputational damage and legal liabilities. Through practical frameworks and case studies, you\'ll gain the ability to develop and implement effective AI governance policies, risk assessment methodologies, and incident response plans that foster trust and drive sustainable AI innovation.</p><p>Whether you are a project manager, compliance officer, data scientist, or business leader, this course will empower you to lead your organization towards responsible AI adoption, transforming potential challenges into opportunities for ethical growth and competitive advantage.</p>\";s:6:\"format\";s:9:\"full_html\";}}s:23:\"field_short_description\";a:1:{s:9:\"x-default\";a:2:{s:5:\"value\";s:168:\"Navigate the complex landscape of AI governance, ethical considerations, and risk management to ensure responsible and compliant AI implementation in your organization.\";s:6:\"format\";s:9:\"full_html\";}}s:15:\"field_thumbnail\";a:1:{s:9:\"x-default\";a:5:{s:9:\"target_id\";s:2:\"81\";s:3:\"alt\";s:45:\"AI Governance and Risk Management Cover Image\";s:5:\"title\";N;s:5:\"width\";s:3:\"640\";s:6:\"height\";s:3:\"640\";}}s:12:\"field_banner\";a:1:{s:9:\"x-default\";a:5:{s:9:\"target_id\";N;s:3:\"alt\";N;s:5:\"title\";N;s:5:\"width\";N;s:6:\"height\";N;}}s:14:\"field_category\";a:1:{s:9:\"x-default\";s:2:\"56\";}s:11:\"field_level\";a:1:{s:9:\"x-default\";s:1:\"2\";}s:14:\"field_language\";a:1:{s:9:\"x-default\";N;}s:11:\"field_price\";a:1:{s:9:\"x-default\";s:6:\"149.99\";}s:16:\"field_price_type\";a:1:{s:9:\"x-default\";s:4:\"paid\";}s:14:\"field_duration\";a:1:{s:9:\"x-default\";s:3:\"240\";}s:16:\"field_bestseller\";a:1:{s:9:\"x-default\";s:1:\"0\";}s:14:\"field_featured\";a:1:{s:9:\"x-default\";s:1:\"1\";}s:6:\"status\";a:1:{s:9:\"x-default\";s:1:\"1\";}s:7:\"created\";a:1:{s:9:\"x-default\";s:10:\"1774442931\";}s:7:\"changed\";a:1:{s:9:\"x-default\";s:10:\"1774451280\";}s:16:\"default_langcode\";a:1:{s:9:\"x-default\";s:1:\"1\";}s:16:\"field_what_learn\";a:1:{s:9:\"x-default\";a:2:{s:5:\"value\";s:5:\"Array\";s:6:\"format\";s:9:\"full_html\";}}s:19:\"field_prerequisites\";a:1:{s:9:\"x-default\";a:2:{s:5:\"value\";s:5:\"Array\";s:6:\"format\";s:9:\"full_html\";}}s:13:\"field_who_for\";a:1:{s:9:\"x-default\";a:2:{s:5:\"value\";s:5:\"Array\";s:6:\"format\";s:9:\"full_html\";}}s:12:\"field_rating\";a:1:{s:9:\"x-default\";s:3:\"5.0\";}s:14:\"field_chap