('values:lms_lesson:350','O:31:\"Drupal\\lms_lesson\\Entity\\Lesson\":30:{s:15:\"\0*\0entityTypeId\";s:10:\"lms_lesson\";s:15:\"\0*\0enforceIsNew\";N;s:12:\"\0*\0typedData\";N;s:17:\"\0*\0originalEntity\";N;s:16:\"\0*\0cacheContexts\";a:0:{}s:12:\"\0*\0cacheTags\";a:0:{}s:14:\"\0*\0cacheMaxAge\";i:-1;s:14:\"\0*\0_serviceIds\";a:0:{}s:18:\"\0*\0_entityStorages\";a:0:{}s:9:\"\0*\0values\";a:23:{s:2:\"id\";a:1:{s:9:\"x-default\";s:3:\"350\";}s:4:\"uuid\";a:1:{s:9:\"x-default\";s:36:\"39a5d5e9-6635-4849-b277-cbef849335ff\";}s:8:\"langcode\";a:1:{s:9:\"x-default\";s:2:\"en\";}s:4:\"name\";a:1:{s:9:\"x-default\";s:43:\"What is AI and Why it Matters for Business?\";}s:13:\"field_content\";a:1:{s:9:\"x-default\";a:2:{s:5:\"value\";s:1438:\"<h1>Introduction</h1><p>Artificial Intelligence (AI) is a transformative technology that is reshaping the way businesses operate. At its core, AI involves the development of computer systems capable of performing tasks that typically require human intelligence, such as decision-making, problem-solving, and language understanding.</p><h2>The Importance of AI in Business</h2><p>AI matters for businesses because it has the potential to enhance efficiency, reduce costs, and create new opportunities. By automating repetitive tasks, AI allows employees to focus on more strategic activities. Moreover, AI-driven insights can lead to better decision-making and improved customer experiences.</p><h3>Applications of AI</h3><ul><li>Predictive Analytics: AI can analyze past data to forecast future trends, helping businesses anticipate market changes.</li><li>Customer Service: AI-powered chatbots provide 24/7 customer support, improving response times and customer satisfaction.</li><li>Supply Chain Optimization: AI can optimize logistics and inventory management, reducing waste and increasing efficiency.</li></ul><h3>Conclusion</h3><p>Understanding AI and its implications is crucial for business leaders. It provides a competitive edge by enabling smarter, faster, and more efficient operations. As AI technologies continue to evolve, businesses that leverage these advancements will be better positioned to succeed in the future.</p>\";s:6:\"format\";s:9:\"full_html\";}}s:10:\"field_type\";a:1:{s:9:\"x-default\";s:5:\"scorm\";}s:15:\"field_video_url\";a:1:{s:9:\"x-default\";s:136:\"https://www.youtube.com/results?search_query=AI+in+business%2C+importance+of+AI%2C+business+applications+of+AI%2C+AI+technology+overview\";}s:16:\"field_video_file\";a:1:{s:9:\"x-default\";a:3:{s:9:\"target_id\";N;s:7:\"display\";N;s:11:\"description\";N;}}s:21:\"field_zoom_meeting_id\";a:1:{s:9:\"x-default\";N;}s:19:\"field_zoom_schedule\";a:1:{s:9:\"x-default\";N;}s:19:\"field_scorm_package\";a:1:{s:9:\"x-default\";a:3:{s:9:\"target_id\";s:2:\"92\";s:7:\"display\";N;s:11:\"description\";N;}}s:14:\"field_duration\";a:1:{s:9:\"x-default\";s:1:\"0\";}s:18:\"field_free_preview\";a:1:{s:9:\"x-default\";s:1:\"0\";}s:15:\"field_drip_days\";a:1:{s:9:\"x-default\";s:1:\"0\";}s:6:\"weight\";a:1:{s:9:\"x-default\";s:1:\"0\";}s:6:\"status\";a:1:{s:9:\"x-default\";s:1:\"1\";}s:7:\"created\";a:1:{s:9:\"x-default\";s:10:\"1774442931\";}s:7:\"changed\";a:1:{s:9:\"x-default\";s:10:\"1774519648\";}s:16:\"default_langcode\";a:1:{s:9:\"x-default\";s:1:\"1\";}s:10:\"field_quiz\";a:1:{s:9:\"x-default\";N;}s:21:\"field_pptx_attachment\";a:1:{s:9:\"x-default\";a:3:{s:9:\"target_id\";N;s:7:\"display\";N;s:11:\"description\";N;}}s:14:\"field_comments\";a:1:{s:9:\"x-default\";a:1:{i:0;a:6:{s:6:\"status\";s:1:\"2\";s:3:\"cid\";s:1:\"0\";s:22:\"last_comment_timestamp\";s:10:\"1774442931\";s:17:\"last_comment_name\";N;s:16:\"last_comment_uid\";s:1:\"0\";s:13:\"comment_count\";s:1:\"0\";}}}s:15:\"field_h5p_embed\";a:1:{s:9:\"x-default\";N;}}s:9:\"\0*\0fields\";a:0:{}s:19:\"\0*\0fieldDefinitions\";N;s:12:\"\0*\0languages\";N;s:14:\"\0*\0langcodeKey\";s:8:\"langcode\";s:21:\"\0*\0defaultLangcodeKey\";s:16:\"default_langcode\";s:17:\"\0*\0activeLangcode\";s:9:\"x-default\