('values:lms_lesson:351','O:31:\"Drupal\\lms_lesson\\Entity\\Lesson\":30:{s:15:\"\0*\0entityTypeId\";s:10:\"lms_lesson\";s:15:\"\0*\0enforceIsNew\";N;s:12:\"\0*\0typedData\";N;s:17:\"\0*\0originalEntity\";N;s:16:\"\0*\0cacheContexts\";a:0:{}s:12:\"\0*\0cacheTags\";a:0:{}s:14:\"\0*\0cacheMaxAge\";i:-1;s:14:\"\0*\0_serviceIds\";a:0:{}s:18:\"\0*\0_entityStorages\";a:0:{}s:9:\"\0*\0values\";a:23:{s:2:\"id\";a:1:{s:9:\"x-default\";s:3:\"351\";}s:4:\"uuid\";a:1:{s:9:\"x-default\";s:36:\"7f1e0d9f-e577-46dc-8b81-9a33d1d9c174\";}s:8:\"langcode\";a:1:{s:9:\"x-default\";s:2:\"en\";}s:4:\"name\";a:1:{s:9:\"x-default\";s:51:\"Machine Learning vs. Deep Learning: Key Differences\";}s:13:\"field_content\";a:1:{s:9:\"x-default\";a:2:{s:5:\"value\";s:1698:\"<h2>Introduction</h2> <p>Machine Learning (ML) and Deep Learning (DL) are both subsets of Artificial Intelligence (AI) that have revolutionized various industries. Understanding their key differences is crucial for implementing the right technology in business applications.</p> <h3>What is Machine Learning?</h3> <p>Machine Learning involves algorithms that learn from data and improve over time. It is used in predictive analytics, customer segmentation, and more. The focus is on enabling machines to learn from past data.</p> <h3>What is Deep Learning?</h3> <p>Deep Learning, a specialized form of ML, uses neural networks with many layers (deep networks) to analyze complex patterns in data. It is the driving force behind advancements in computer vision, NLP, and autonomous systems.</p> <h3>Key Differences</h3> <ul><li><strong>Data Dependency:</strong> ML works well with small to medium data sets, while DL requires large datasets.</li><li><strong>Hardware Requirements:</strong> DL often requires powerful GPUs due to its complex computations.</li><li><strong>Feature Engineering:</strong> ML involves manual feature extraction, whereas DL networks automatically derive features.</li></ul> <h3>Applications in Business</h3> <p>Machine Learning is widely used for predictive analytics, fraud detection, and customer insights. Deep Learning excels in image recognition, speech recognition, and natural language processing.</p> <h3>Conclusion</h3> <p>Choosing between ML and DL depends on the specific needs of your business, including data volume, computational resources, and the desired outcome. Both technologies offer significant advantages and can be leveraged for business growth.</p>\";s:6:\"format\";s:9:\"full_html\";}}s:10:\"field_type\";a:1:{s:9:\"x-default\";s:4:\"text\";}s:15:\"field_video_url\";a:1:{s:9:\"x-default\";s:145:\"https://www.youtube.com/results?search_query=Machine+Learning+vs+Deep+Learning+differences%2C+AI+applications+in+business%2C+ML+and+DL+comparison\";}s:16:\"field_video_file\";a:1:{s:9:\"x-default\";a:3:{s:9:\"target_id\";N;s:7:\"display\";N;s:11:\"description\";N;}}s:21:\"field_zoom_meeting_id\";a:1:{s:9:\"x-default\";N;}s:19:\"field_zoom_schedule\";a:1:{s:9:\"x-default\";N;}s:19:\"field_scorm_package\";a:1:{s:9:\"x-default\";a:3:{s:9:\"target_id\";N;s:7:\"display\";N;s:11:\"description\";N;}}s:14:\"field_duration\";a:1:{s:9:\"x-default\";s:1:\"0\";}s:18:\"field_free_preview\";a:1:{s:9:\"x-default\";s:1:\"0\";}s:15:\"field_drip_days\";a:1:{s:9:\"x-default\";s:1:\"0\";}s:6:\"weight\";a:1:{s:9:\"x-default\";s:1:\"0\";}s:6:\"status\";a:1:{s:9:\"x-default\";s:1:\"1\";}s:7:\"created\";a:1:{s:9:\"x-default\";s:10:\"1774442931\";}s:7:\"changed\";a:1:{s:9:\"x-default\";s:10:\"1774519648\";}s:16:\"default_langcode\";a:1:{s:9:\"x-default\";s:1:\"1\";}s:10:\"field_quiz\";a:1:{s:9:\"x-default\";N;}s:21:\"field_pptx_attachment\";a:1:{s:9:\"x-default\";a:3:{s:9:\"target_id\";N;s:7:\"display\";N;s:11:\"description\";N;}}s:14:\"field_comments\";a:1:{s:9:\"x-default\";a:1:{i:0;a:6:{s:6:\"status\";s:1:\"2\";s:3:\"cid\";s:1:\"0\";s:22:\"last_comment_timestamp\";s:10:\"1774442931\";s:17:\"last_comment_name\";N;s:16:\"last_comment_uid\";s:1:\"0\";s:13:\"comment_count\";s:1:\"0\";}}}s:15:\"field_h5p_