('values:lms_lesson:353','O:31:\"Drupal\\lms_lesson\\Entity\\Lesson\":30:{s:15:\"\0*\0entityTypeId\";s:10:\"lms_lesson\";s:15:\"\0*\0enforceIsNew\";N;s:12:\"\0*\0typedData\";N;s:17:\"\0*\0originalEntity\";N;s:16:\"\0*\0cacheContexts\";a:0:{}s:12:\"\0*\0cacheTags\";a:0:{}s:14:\"\0*\0cacheMaxAge\";i:-1;s:14:\"\0*\0_serviceIds\";a:0:{}s:18:\"\0*\0_entityStorages\";a:0:{}s:9:\"\0*\0values\";a:23:{s:2:\"id\";a:1:{s:9:\"x-default\";s:3:\"353\";}s:4:\"uuid\";a:1:{s:9:\"x-default\";s:36:\"c40286a9-7f0f-43f4-85cc-737c81a78bac\";}s:8:\"langcode\";a:1:{s:9:\"x-default\";s:2:\"en\";}s:4:\"name\";a:1:{s:9:\"x-default\";s:45:\"Computer Vision and its Business Applications\";}s:13:\"field_content\";a:1:{s:9:\"x-default\";a:2:{s:5:\"value\";s:1671:\"<h2>Introduction to Computer Vision</h2> <p>Computer vision is a field of artificial intelligence that trains computers to interpret and understand the visual world. By utilizing digital images from cameras and videos and deep learning models, machines can accurately identify and classify objects, and then react to what they \'see\'.</p> <h3>How Computer Vision Works</h3> <p>Computer vision involves acquiring, processing, analyzing and understanding digital images and extraction of high-dimensional data from the real world in order to produce numerical or symbolic information.</p> <ul> <li><strong>Image Acquisition:</strong> Capturing or receiving an image.</li> <li><strong>Image Processing:</strong> Enhancing or transforming the image.</li> <li><strong>Feature Extraction:</strong> Identifying key features.</li> <li><strong>Pattern Recognition:</strong> Classifying objects based on extracted features.</li> </ul> <h3>Applications in Business</h3> <p>Computer vision has numerous applications in business, including:</p> <ol> <li><strong>Retail:</strong> Enhancing customer experience with visual search and personalized recommendations.</li> <li><strong>Manufacturing:</strong> Improving product quality through automated defect detection.</li> <li><strong>Healthcare:</strong> Assisting in diagnostics with imaging analysis.</li> <li><strong>Transportation:</strong> Enabling autonomous vehicles and improving traffic management.</li> </ol> <h4>Challenges and Considerations</h4> <p>Implementing computer vision solutions requires addressing challenges such as data privacy, model accuracy, and scalability, while ensuring ethical use and bias mitigation.</p>\";s:6:\"format\";s:9:\"full_html\";}}s:10:\"field_type\";a:1:{s:9:\"x-default\";s:4:\"text\";}s:15:\"field_video_url\";a:1:{s:9:\"x-default\";s:164:\"https://www.youtube.com/results?search_query=Computer+Vision+Applications+in+Business%2C+Introduction+to+Computer+Vision+AI%2C+Business+Use+Cases+of+Computer+Vision\";}s:16:\"field_video_file\";a:1:{s:9:\"x-default\";a:3:{s:9:\"target_id\";N;s:7:\"display\";N;s:11:\"description\";N;}}s:21:\"field_zoom_meeting_id\";a:1:{s:9:\"x-default\";N;}s:19:\"field_zoom_schedule\";a:1:{s:9:\"x-default\";N;}s:19:\"field_scorm_package\";a:1:{s:9:\"x-default\";a:3:{s:9:\"target_id\";N;s:7:\"display\";N;s:11:\"description\";N;}}s:14:\"field_duration\";a:1:{s:9:\"x-default\";s:1:\"0\";}s:18:\"field_free_preview\";a:1:{s:9:\"x-default\";s:1:\"0\";}s:15:\"field_drip_days\";a:1:{s:9:\"x-default\";s:1:\"0\";}s:6:\"weight\";a:1:{s:9:\"x-default\";s:1:\"0\";}s:6:\"status\";a:1:{s:9:\"x-default\";s:1:\"1\";}s:7:\"created\";a:1:{s:9:\"x-default\";s:10:\"1774442931\";}s:7:\"changed\";a:1:{s:9:\"x-default\";s:10:\"1774519648\";}s:16:\"default_langcode\";a:1:{s:9:\"x-default\";s:1:\"1\";}s:10:\"field_quiz\";a:1:{s:9:\"x-default\";N;}s:21:\"field_pptx_attachment\";a:1:{s:9:\"x-default\";a:3:{s:9:\"target_id\";N;s:7:\"display\";N;s:11:\"description\";N;}}s:14:\"field_comments\";a:1:{s:9:\"x-default\";a:1:{i:0;a:6:{s:6:\"status\";s:1:\"2\";s:3:\"cid\";s:1:\"0\";s:22:\"last_comment_timestamp\";s:10:\"1774442931\";s:17:\"last_comment_name\";N;s:16:\"last_comment_uid\";s:1:\"0\";s:13:\"comment_count\";s:1:\"0\";}}}s:15:\"field_h5p_embed\";a:1: