('values:lms_lesson:368','O:31:\"Drupal\\lms_lesson\\Entity\\Lesson\":30:{s:15:\"\0*\0entityTypeId\";s:10:\"lms_lesson\";s:15:\"\0*\0enforceIsNew\";N;s:12:\"\0*\0typedData\";N;s:17:\"\0*\0originalEntity\";N;s:16:\"\0*\0cacheContexts\";a:0:{}s:12:\"\0*\0cacheTags\";a:0:{}s:14:\"\0*\0cacheMaxAge\";i:-1;s:14:\"\0*\0_serviceIds\";a:0:{}s:18:\"\0*\0_entityStorages\";a:0:{}s:9:\"\0*\0values\";a:23:{s:2:\"id\";a:1:{s:9:\"x-default\";s:3:\"368\";}s:4:\"uuid\";a:1:{s:9:\"x-default\";s:36:\"4c73cd0c-b968-42d4-80bc-882d29630923\";}s:8:\"langcode\";a:1:{s:9:\"x-default\";s:2:\"en\";}s:4:\"name\";a:1:{s:9:\"x-default\";s:45:\"How Recommender Systems Drive Business Growth\";}s:13:\"field_content\";a:1:{s:9:\"x-default\";a:2:{s:5:\"value\";s:1187:\"<h1>How Recommender Systems Drive Business Growth</h1><p>Recommender systems are pivotal in enhancing customer engagement and driving sales. By analyzing user behavior and preferences, they provide personalized product suggestions.</p><p><h2>Understanding the Basics</h2>Recommender systems use algorithms to filter information and predict what users will like. They can be content-based, collaborative filtering, or hybrid systems.</p><p><h2>Benefits for Businesses</h2>The primary benefit of recommender systems is their ability to increase sales. Personalized recommendations lead to higher conversion rates and customer satisfaction.</p><p><h2>Implementation Challenges</h2>Implementing an effective recommender system can be challenging. It requires significant data and processing power, as well as strategies to maintain user privacy.</p><p><h2>Case Studies</h2>Leading companies like Amazon and Netflix have successfully used recommender systems to boost their business, demonstrating their effectiveness across industries.</p><p>In conclusion, recommender systems are a powerful tool for business growth, leveraging AI to provide value both to companies and their customers.</p>\";s:6:\"format\";s:9:\"full_html\";}}s:10:\"field_type\";a:1:{s:9:\"x-default\";s:4:\"text\";}s:15:\"field_video_url\";a:1:{s:9:\"x-default\";s:83:\"https://www.youtube.com/results?search_query=recommender+systems+business+growth+AI\";}s:16:\"field_video_file\";a:1:{s:9:\"x-default\";a:3:{s:9:\"target_id\";N;s:7:\"display\";N;s:11:\"description\";N;}}s:21:\"field_zoom_meeting_id\";a:1:{s:9:\"x-default\";N;}s:19:\"field_zoom_schedule\";a:1:{s:9:\"x-default\";N;}s:19:\"field_scorm_package\";a:1:{s:9:\"x-default\";a:3:{s:9:\"target_id\";N;s:7:\"display\";N;s:11:\"description\";N;}}s:14:\"field_duration\";a:1:{s:9:\"x-default\";s:1:\"0\";}s:18:\"field_free_preview\";a:1:{s:9:\"x-default\";s:1:\"0\";}s:15:\"field_drip_days\";a:1:{s:9:\"x-default\";s:1:\"0\";}s:6:\"weight\";a:1:{s:9:\"x-default\";s:1:\"0\";}s:6:\"status\";a:1:{s:9:\"x-default\";s:1:\"1\";}s:7:\"created\";a:1:{s:9:\"x-default\";s:10:\"1774442931\";}s:7:\"changed\";a:1:{s:9:\"x-default\";s:10:\"1774519648\";}s:16:\"default_langcode\";a:1:{s:9:\"x-default\";s:1:\"1\";}s:10:\"field_quiz\";a:1:{s:9:\"x-default\";N;}s:21:\"field_pptx_attachment\";a:1:{s:9:\"x-default\";a:3:{s:9:\"target_id\";N;s:7:\"display\";N;s:11:\"description\";N;}}s:14:\"field_comments\";a:1:{s:9:\"x-default\";a:1:{i:0;a:6:{s:6:\"status\";s:1:\"2\";s:3:\"cid\";s:1:\"0\";s:22:\"last_comment_timestamp\";s:10:\"1774442931\";s:17:\"last_comment_name\";N;s:16:\"last_comment_uid\";s:1:\"0\";s:13:\"comment_count\";s:1:\"0\";}}}s:15:\"field_h5p_embed\";a:1:{s:9:\"x-default\";N;}}s:9:\"\0*\0fields\";a:0:{}s:19:\"\0*\0fieldDefinitions\";N;s:12:\"\0*\0languages\";N;s:14:\"\0*\0langcodeKey\";s:8:\"langcode\";s:21:\"\0*\0defaultLangcodeKey\";s:16:\"default_langcode\";s:17:\"\0*\0activeLangcode\";s:9:\"x-default\";s:28:\"\0*\0enforceDefaultTranslation\";N;s:18:\"\0*\0defaultLangcode\";s:2:\"en\";s:15:\"\0*\0translations\";a:1:{s:9:\"x-default\";a:1:{s:6:\"status\";i:1;}}s:24:\"\0*\0translationInitialize\";b:0;s:14:\"\0*\0newRevision\";b:0;s:20:\"\0*\0isDefaultRevision\";b:1;s:13:\"\0*\0entityKeys\";a:4:{s:6:\"bundle\";s