('values:lms_lesson:394','O:31:\"Drupal\\lms_lesson\\Entity\\Lesson\":30:{s:15:\"\0*\0entityTypeId\";s:10:\"lms_lesson\";s:15:\"\0*\0enforceIsNew\";N;s:12:\"\0*\0typedData\";N;s:17:\"\0*\0originalEntity\";N;s:16:\"\0*\0cacheContexts\";a:0:{}s:12:\"\0*\0cacheTags\";a:0:{}s:14:\"\0*\0cacheMaxAge\";i:-1;s:14:\"\0*\0_serviceIds\";a:0:{}s:18:\"\0*\0_entityStorages\";a:0:{}s:9:\"\0*\0values\";a:23:{s:2:\"id\";a:1:{s:9:\"x-default\";s:3:\"394\";}s:4:\"uuid\";a:1:{s:9:\"x-default\";s:36:\"cc864e37-df67-4a11-8aa7-db8afb5b63f4\";}s:8:\"langcode\";a:1:{s:9:\"x-default\";s:2:\"en\";}s:4:\"name\";a:1:{s:9:\"x-default\";s:40:\"Sentiment Analysis for Customer Feedback\";}s:13:\"field_content\";a:1:{s:9:\"x-default\";a:2:{s:5:\"value\";s:1574:\"<h2>Understanding Sentiment Analysis</h2><p>Sentiment analysis, also known as opinion mining, is a technique used to determine the emotional tone behind a series of words. This is an essential tool for identifying customer sentiments from various sources such as reviews, feedback forms, and social media.</p><h3>The Importance in Business</h3><p>Businesses leverage sentiment analysis to better understand customer opinions, improve products, and enhance customer service. It helps identify areas needing improvement and recognizes successful strategies.</p><h3>How Sentiment Analysis Works</h3><p>Sentiment analysis uses natural language processing (NLP) to classify textual data into positive, negative, or neutral categories. Advanced models also capture subtleties like sarcasm and context.</p><ul><li><strong>Data Collection:</strong> Gathering data from reviews, feedback, and social media.</li><li><strong>Data Processing:</strong> Using NLP to break down text into understandable elements.</li><li><strong>Classification:</strong> Applying algorithms to categorize sentiments.</li></ul><h3>Implementing Sentiment Analysis</h3><p>Implementing sentiment analysis involves selecting the right tools and technologies. Many businesses use pre-built models, while others customize solutions for specific needs.</p><h3>Case Studies</h3><p>Many companies have successfully implemented sentiment analysis to gain insights into customer satisfaction and improve their services. These case studies demonstrate the practical applications and benefits of sentiment analysis.</p>\";s:6:\"format\";s:9:\"full_html\";}}s:10:\"field_type\";a:1:{s:9:\"x-default\";s:4:\"text\";}s:15:\"field_video_url\";a:1:{s:9:\"x-default\";s:93:\"https://www.youtube.com/results?search_query=Sentiment+Analysis+in+Business+Customer+Feedback\";}s:16:\"field_video_file\";a:1:{s:9:\"x-default\";a:3:{s:9:\"target_id\";N;s:7:\"display\";N;s:11:\"description\";N;}}s:21:\"field_zoom_meeting_id\";a:1:{s:9:\"x-default\";N;}s:19:\"field_zoom_schedule\";a:1:{s:9:\"x-default\";N;}s:19:\"field_scorm_package\";a:1:{s:9:\"x-default\";a:3:{s:9:\"target_id\";N;s:7:\"display\";N;s:11:\"description\";N;}}s:14:\"field_duration\";a:1:{s:9:\"x-default\";s:1:\"0\";}s:18:\"field_free_preview\";a:1:{s:9:\"x-default\";s:1:\"0\";}s:15:\"field_drip_days\";a:1:{s:9:\"x-default\";s:1:\"0\";}s:6:\"weight\";a:1:{s:9:\"x-default\";s:1:\"0\";}s:6:\"status\";a:1:{s:9:\"x-default\";s:1:\"1\";}s:7:\"created\";a:1:{s:9:\"x-default\";s:10:\"1774442931\";}s:7:\"changed\";a:1:{s:9:\"x-default\";s:10:\"1774519648\";}s:16:\"default_langcode\";a:1:{s:9:\"x-default\";s:1:\"1\";}s:10:\"field_quiz\";a:1:{s:9:\"x-default\";N;}s:21:\"field_pptx_attachment\";a:1:{s:9:\"x-default\";a:3:{s:9:\"target_id\";N;s:7:\"display\";N;s:11:\"description\";N;}}s:14:\"field_comments\";a:1:{s:9:\"x-default\";a:1:{i:0;a:6:{s:6:\"status\";s:1:\"2\";s:3:\"cid\";s:1:\"0\";s:22:\"last_comment_timestamp\";s:10:\"1774442931\";s:17:\"last_comment_name\";N;s:16:\"last_comment_uid\";s:1:\"0\";s:13:\"comment_count\";s:1:\"0\";}}}s:15:\"field_h5p_embed\";a:1:{s:9:\"x-default\";N;}}s:9:\"\0*\0fields\";a:0:{}s:19:\"\0*\0fieldDefinitions\";N;s:12:\"\0*\0languages\";N;s:14:\"\0*\0langcodeKey\";s:8:\"langcode\";s:21:\"\0*\0defaultLangco