('values:lms_lesson:412','O:31:\"Drupal\\lms_lesson\\Entity\\Lesson\":30:{s:15:\"\0*\0entityTypeId\";s:10:\"lms_lesson\";s:15:\"\0*\0enforceIsNew\";N;s:12:\"\0*\0typedData\";N;s:17:\"\0*\0originalEntity\";N;s:16:\"\0*\0cacheContexts\";a:0:{}s:12:\"\0*\0cacheTags\";a:0:{}s:14:\"\0*\0cacheMaxAge\";i:-1;s:14:\"\0*\0_serviceIds\";a:0:{}s:18:\"\0*\0_entityStorages\";a:0:{}s:9:\"\0*\0values\";a:23:{s:2:\"id\";a:1:{s:9:\"x-default\";s:3:\"412\";}s:4:\"uuid\";a:1:{s:9:\"x-default\";s:36:\"8956b232-8fef-4269-87c5-5d5ceb35bc88\";}s:8:\"langcode\";a:1:{s:9:\"x-default\";s:2:\"en\";}s:4:\"name\";a:1:{s:9:\"x-default\";s:55:\"AI-powered Search and Intelligent Information Retrieval\";}s:13:\"field_content\";a:1:{s:9:\"x-default\";a:2:{s:5:\"value\";s:1510:\"<h2>Introduction to AI-powered Search</h2><p>AI-powered search technologies have revolutionized the way businesses access and retrieve information. By leveraging machine learning algorithms, these systems provide more accurate and relevant search results.</p><h3>How AI Enhances Search Capabilities</h3><p>Traditional keyword-based search methods often fall short in understanding context and intent. AI technologies, such as natural language processing (NLP) and deep learning, enable search systems to interpret user queries more effectively.</p><ul><li>Improved context recognition</li><li>Enhanced relevance of results</li><li>Ability to understand complex queries</li></ul><h3>Applications of Intelligent Information Retrieval</h3><p>Organizations use AI-driven search for various applications, including content discovery, fraud detection, and customer support.</p><ol><li>Content Management: AI helps in organizing and retrieving vast amounts of data efficiently.</li><li>Customer Support: AI-powered search can quickly find solutions from knowledge bases.</li><li>Fraud Detection: Analyzing patterns in large datasets to identify anomalies.</li></ol><h3>Challenges and Future Prospects</h3><p>While AI-powered search offers significant advantages, challenges such as data privacy, algorithmic bias, and the need for vast training datasets remain.</p><p>Future advancements will likely focus on improving personalisation and integrating with other AI technologies for seamless information retrieval.</p>\";s:6:\"format\";s:9:\"full_html\";}}s:10:\"field_type\";a:1:{s:9:\"x-default\";s:4:\"text\";}s:15:\"field_video_url\";a:1:{s:9:\"x-default\";s:197:\"https://www.youtube.com/results?search_query=AI-powered+search%2C+intelligent+information+retrieval%2C+AI+in+business+search%2C+advanced+search+technologies%2C+natural+language+processing+in+search\";}s:16:\"field_video_file\";a:1:{s:9:\"x-default\";a:3:{s:9:\"target_id\";N;s:7:\"display\";N;s:11:\"description\";N;}}s:21:\"field_zoom_meeting_id\";a:1:{s:9:\"x-default\";N;}s:19:\"field_zoom_schedule\";a:1:{s:9:\"x-default\";N;}s:19:\"field_scorm_package\";a:1:{s:9:\"x-default\";a:3:{s:9:\"target_id\";N;s:7:\"display\";N;s:11:\"description\";N;}}s:14:\"field_duration\";a:1:{s:9:\"x-default\";s:1:\"0\";}s:18:\"field_free_preview\";a:1:{s:9:\"x-default\";s:1:\"0\";}s:15:\"field_drip_days\";a:1:{s:9:\"x-default\";s:1:\"0\";}s:6:\"weight\";a:1:{s:9:\"x-default\";s:1:\"0\";}s:6:\"status\";a:1:{s:9:\"x-default\";s:1:\"1\";}s:7:\"created\";a:1:{s:9:\"x-default\";s:10:\"1774442931\";}s:7:\"changed\";a:1:{s:9:\"x-default\";s:10:\"1774519648\";}s:16:\"default_langcode\";a:1:{s:9:\"x-default\";s:1:\"1\";}s:10:\"field_quiz\";a:1:{s:9:\"x-default\";N;}s:21:\"field_pptx_attachment\";a:1:{s:9:\"x-default\";a:3:{s:9:\"target_id\";N;s:7:\"display\";N;s:11:\"description\";N;}}s:14:\"field_comments\";a:1:{s:9:\"x-default\";a:1:{i:0;a:6:{s:6:\"status\";s:1:\"2\";s:3:\"cid\";s:1:\"0\";s:22:\"last_comment_timestamp\";s:10:\"1774442931\";s:17:\"last_comment_name\";N;s:16:\"last_comment_uid\";s:1:\"0\";s:13:\"comment_count\";s:1:\"0\";}}}s:15:\"field_h5p_embed\";a:1:{s:9:\"x-default\";N;}}s:9:\"\0*\0fields\";a:0:{}s:19:\"\0*\0fieldDefinitions\";N;s:12:\"\0*\0languages\";N;s:14:\"\0*\0