('values:lms_lesson:416','O:31:\"Drupal\\lms_lesson\\Entity\\Lesson\":30:{s:15:\"\0*\0entityTypeId\";s:10:\"lms_lesson\";s:15:\"\0*\0enforceIsNew\";N;s:12:\"\0*\0typedData\";N;s:17:\"\0*\0originalEntity\";N;s:16:\"\0*\0cacheContexts\";a:0:{}s:12:\"\0*\0cacheTags\";a:0:{}s:14:\"\0*\0cacheMaxAge\";i:-1;s:14:\"\0*\0_serviceIds\";a:0:{}s:18:\"\0*\0_entityStorages\";a:0:{}s:9:\"\0*\0values\";a:23:{s:2:\"id\";a:1:{s:9:\"x-default\";s:3:\"416\";}s:4:\"uuid\";a:1:{s:9:\"x-default\";s:36:\"b3d33c7c-587f-4975-80bc-25c808ae5785\";}s:8:\"langcode\";a:1:{s:9:\"x-default\";s:2:\"en\";}s:4:\"name\";a:1:{s:9:\"x-default\";s:48:\"Knowledge Graph Applications for Enterprise Data\";}s:13:\"field_content\";a:1:{s:9:\"x-default\";a:2:{s:5:\"value\";s:1521:\"<h2>Introduction to Knowledge Graphs</h2><p>Knowledge graphs are powerful tools that connect data in a meaningful way, making it easier to extract valuable insights. They represent information in a graph format where nodes indicate entities and edges indicate relationships.</p><h3>Benefits of Knowledge Graphs</h3><p>Using knowledge graphs in enterprises can enhance data integration, improve search and discovery, and enable better decision-making.</p><ul><li>Improved data connectivity and integration.</li><li>Enhanced insight generation through relationship mapping.</li><li>Facilitated discovery and retrieval of enterprise information.</li></ul><h3>Applications in Enterprise Data</h3><p>Knowledge graphs can be leveraged for various use cases in an enterprise setting:</p><ol><li><strong>Data Integration:</strong> Seamlessly integrate disparate data sources.</li><li><strong>Search Optimization:</strong> Enhance search engines with semantic understanding.</li><li><strong>Recommendation Systems:</strong> Provide personalized recommendations by understanding user preferences.</li></ol><h3>Building and Managing Knowledge Graphs</h3><p>Creating a knowledge graph involves data collection, entity extraction, and relationship mapping. Managing these graphs requires regular updates and validation to ensure data accuracy and relevance.</p><p>Enterprise adoption of knowledge graphs can lead to significant improvements in data handling and business operations, allowing for more informed strategic decisions.</p>\";s:6:\"format\";s:9:\"full_html\";}}s:10:\"field_type\";a:1:{s:9:\"x-default\";s:4:\"text\";}s:15:\"field_video_url\";a:1:{s:9:\"x-default\";s:151:\"https://www.youtube.com/results?search_query=enterprise+knowledge+graph+applications%2C+knowledge+graph+for+business%2C+knowledge+graph+data+management\";}s:16:\"field_video_file\";a:1:{s:9:\"x-default\";a:3:{s:9:\"target_id\";N;s:7:\"display\";N;s:11:\"description\";N;}}s:21:\"field_zoom_meeting_id\";a:1:{s:9:\"x-default\";N;}s:19:\"field_zoom_schedule\";a:1:{s:9:\"x-default\";N;}s:19:\"field_scorm_package\";a:1:{s:9:\"x-default\";a:3:{s:9:\"target_id\";N;s:7:\"display\";N;s:11:\"description\";N;}}s:14:\"field_duration\";a:1:{s:9:\"x-default\";s:1:\"0\";}s:18:\"field_free_preview\";a:1:{s:9:\"x-default\";s:1:\"0\";}s:15:\"field_drip_days\";a:1:{s:9:\"x-default\";s:1:\"0\";}s:6:\"weight\";a:1:{s:9:\"x-default\";s:1:\"0\";}s:6:\"status\";a:1:{s:9:\"x-default\";s:1:\"1\";}s:7:\"created\";a:1:{s:9:\"x-default\";s:10:\"1774442931\";}s:7:\"changed\";a:1:{s:9:\"x-default\";s:10:\"1774519648\";}s:16:\"default_langcode\";a:1:{s:9:\"x-default\";s:1:\"1\";}s:10:\"field_quiz\";a:1:{s:9:\"x-default\";N;}s:21:\"field_pptx_attachment\";a:1:{s:9:\"x-default\";a:3:{s:9:\"target_id\";N;s:7:\"display\";N;s:11:\"description\";N;}}s:14:\"field_comments\";a:1:{s:9:\"x-default\";a:1:{i:0;a:6:{s:6:\"status\";s:1:\"2\";s:3:\"cid\";s:1:\"0\";s:22:\"last_comment_timestamp\";s:10:\"1774442931\";s:17:\"last_comment_name\";N;s:16:\"last_comment_uid\";s:1:\"0\";s:13:\"comment_count\";s:1:\"0\";}}}s:15:\"field_h5p_embed\";a:1:{s:9:\"x-default\";N;}}s:9:\"\0*\0fields\";a:0:{}s:19:\"\0*\0fieldDefinitions\";N;s:12:\"\0*\0languages\";N;s:14:\"\0*\0langcodeKey\";s:8:\"langcode\";s:21:\"\0*\