('values:lms_lesson:420','O:31:\"Drupal\\lms_lesson\\Entity\\Lesson\":30:{s:15:\"\0*\0entityTypeId\";s:10:\"lms_lesson\";s:15:\"\0*\0enforceIsNew\";N;s:12:\"\0*\0typedData\";N;s:17:\"\0*\0originalEntity\";N;s:16:\"\0*\0cacheContexts\";a:0:{}s:12:\"\0*\0cacheTags\";a:0:{}s:14:\"\0*\0cacheMaxAge\";i:-1;s:14:\"\0*\0_serviceIds\";a:0:{}s:18:\"\0*\0_entityStorages\";a:0:{}s:9:\"\0*\0values\";a:23:{s:2:\"id\";a:1:{s:9:\"x-default\";s:3:\"420\";}s:4:\"uuid\";a:1:{s:9:\"x-default\";s:36:\"bd01bf94-934d-433b-89b6-4adec21bc7f6\";}s:8:\"langcode\";a:1:{s:9:\"x-default\";s:2:\"en\";}s:4:\"name\";a:1:{s:9:\"x-default\";s:45:\"Personalized Learning and Development with AI\";}s:13:\"field_content\";a:1:{s:9:\"x-default\";a:2:{s:5:\"value\";s:999:\"<h2>Introduction to Personalized Learning with AI</h2><p>Artificial Intelligence is transforming the way we approach learning and development by personalizing the experience for each individual.</p><h3>Benefits of AI in Learning</h3><p>AI allows for customization that caters to different learning styles and paces, ensuring that each learner can maximize their potential.</p><ul><li>Adaptive learning paths</li><li>Real-time feedback</li><li>Automated assessments</li></ul><h3>AI Tools and Technologies</h3><p>Several AI-driven tools are available that enhance personalized learning experiences, from chatbots to intelligent tutoring systems.</p><h4>Role of AI in Career Development</h4><p>AI also plays a critical role in career development by analyzing skills gaps and recommending training programs to improve workforce capabilities.</p><p>By leveraging AI, organizations can foster a culture of continuous learning, ensuring that employees remain competitive in an ever-evolving job market.</p>\";s:6:\"format\";s:9:\"full_html\";}}s:10:\"field_type\";a:1:{s:9:\"x-default\";s:4:\"text\";}s:15:\"field_video_url\";a:1:{s:9:\"x-default\";s:120:\"https://www.youtube.com/results?search_query=AI+personalized+learning%2C+AI+in+education%2C+adaptive+learni