('values:lms_lesson:426','O:31:\"Drupal\\lms_lesson\\Entity\\Lesson\":30:{s:15:\"\0*\0entityTypeId\";s:10:\"lms_lesson\";s:15:\"\0*\0enforceIsNew\";N;s:12:\"\0*\0typedData\";N;s:17:\"\0*\0originalEntity\";N;s:16:\"\0*\0cacheContexts\";a:0:{}s:12:\"\0*\0cacheTags\";a:0:{}s:14:\"\0*\0cacheMaxAge\";i:-1;s:14:\"\0*\0_serviceIds\";a:0:{}s:18:\"\0*\0_entityStorages\";a:0:{}s:9:\"\0*\0values\";a:23:{s:2:\"id\";a:1:{s:9:\"x-default\";s:3:\"426\";}s:4:\"uuid\";a:1:{s:9:\"x-default\";s:36:\"08f42c08-3e43-46ec-8e26-0f8555cfc135\";}s:8:\"langcode\";a:1:{s:9:\"x-default\";s:2:\"en\";}s:4:\"name\";a:1:{s:9:\"x-default\";s:41:\"AI in Data Visualization and Dashboarding\";}s:13:\"field_content\";a:1:{s:9:\"x-default\";a:2:{s:5:\"value\";s:1053:\"<h2>Introduction to AI in Data Visualization</h2><p>Data visualization is a critical component in modern business analytics. With the integration of AI, visualization tools have become more intuitive and insightful.</p><h3>The Role of AI</h3><p>AI enhances data visualization by automating data discovery and enabling more sophisticated interpretations. It transforms raw data into actionable insights through dynamic dashboards.</p><h4>Benefits of AI-Powered Dashboards</h4><ul><li>Enhanced data storytelling capabilities</li><li>Real-time data updates and insights</li><li>Automated anomaly detection</li><li>Personalized user experiences</li></ul><h3>Implementing AI in Dashboards</h3><p>Integrating AI into dashboards requires understanding the data landscape and selecting the right tools. Businesses should focus on solutions that scale with their needs.</p><h4>Future Trends</h4><p>As AI technology advances, expect more interactive and predictive features in data visualization tools, making them indispensable for strategic decision-making.</p>\";s:6:\"format\";s:9:\"full_html\";}}s:10:\"field_type\";a:1:{s:9:\"x-default\";s:4:\"text\";}s:15:\"field_video_url\";a:1:{s:9:\"x-default\";s:88:\"https://www.youtube.com/results?search_query=AI+data+visu