('values:lms_lesson:442','O:31:\"Drupal\\lms_lesson\\Entity\\Lesson\":30:{s:15:\"\0*\0entityTypeId\";s:10:\"lms_lesson\";s:15:\"\0*\0enforceIsNew\";N;s:12:\"\0*\0typedData\";N;s:17:\"\0*\0originalEntity\";N;s:16:\"\0*\0cacheContexts\";a:0:{}s:12:\"\0*\0cacheTags\";a:0:{}s:14:\"\0*\0cacheMaxAge\";i:-1;s:14:\"\0*\0_serviceIds\";a:0:{}s:18:\"\0*\0_entityStorages\";a:0:{}s:9:\"\0*\0values\";a:23:{s:2:\"id\";a:1:{s:9:\"x-default\";s:3:\"442\";}s:4:\"uuid\";a:1:{s:9:\"x-default\";s:36:\"9b12f9d8-1770-4bbf-91ad-3ad626920cfc\";}s:8:\"langcode\";a:1:{s:9:\"x-default\";s:2:\"en\";}s:4:\"name\";a:1:{s:9:\"x-default\";s:34:\"Understanding Different Data Types\";}s:13:\"field_content\";a:1:{s:9:\"x-default\";a:2:{s:5:\"value\";s:1358:\"<h2>Understanding Different Data Types</h2><p>Data is the cornerstone of any AI application. To leverage its full potential, it\'s crucial to understand the different types of data available.</p><p><strong>1. Structured Data:</strong> This type of data is highly organized and easily searchable in databases. Examples include spreadsheets and SQL databases.</p><p><strong>2. Unstructured Data:</strong> Unstructured data lacks a predefined format. Common examples include emails, social media posts, and videos.</p><p><strong>3. Semi-structured Data:</strong> This data type doesn\'t conform strictly to a structure but contains tags or markers to separate elements. XML and JSON files are typical.</p><p>Understanding these data types helps in deciding the appropriate AI models and techniques for processing and analyzing data.</p><h3>Applications in AI</h3><p>The choice of data type impacts the AI model\'s design and effectiveness. Structured data works well with traditional machine learning algorithms, while unstructured data often requires advanced techniques like deep learning.</p><ul><li>Structured data is ideal for predictive analytics and reporting.</li><li>Unstructured data analysis leads to insights in sentiment analysis and image recognition.</li></ul><p>Comprehending these distinctions can guide the development of robust AI solutions.</p>\";s:6:\"format\";s:9:\"full_html\";}}s:10:\"field_type\";a:1:{s:9:\"x-default\";s:4:\"text\";}s:15:\"field_video_url\";a:1:{s:9:\"x-default\";s:141:\"https://www.youtube.com/results?search_query=Understanding+data+types+in+AI%2C+structured+vs+unstructured+data+examples%2C+AI+data+processing\";}s:16:\"field_video_file\";a:1:{s:9:\"x-default\";a:3:{s:9:\"target_id\";N;s:7:\"display\";N;s:11:\"description\";N;}}s:21:\"field_zoom_meeting_id\";a:1:{s:9:\"x-default\";N;}s:19:\"field_zoom_schedule\";a:1:{s:9:\"x-default\";N;}s:19:\"field_scorm_package\";a:1:{s:9:\"x-default\";a:3:{s:9:\"target_id\";N;s:7:\"display\";N;s:11:\"description\";N;}}s:14:\"field_duration\";a:1:{s:9:\"x-default\";s:1:\"0\";}s:18:\"field_free_preview\";a:1:{s:9:\"x-default\";s:1:\"0\";}s:15:\"field_drip_days\";a:1:{s:9:\"x-default\";s:1:\"0\";}s:6:\"weight\";a:1:{s:9:\"x-default\";s:1:\"0\";}s:6:\"status\";a:1:{s:9:\"x-default\";s:1:\"1\";}s:7:\"created\";a:1:{s:9:\"x-default\";s:10:\"1774442931\";}s:7:\"changed\";a:1:{s:9:\"x-default\";s:10:\"1774519648\";}s:16:\"default_langcode\";a:1:{s:9:\"x-default\";s:1:\"1\";}s:10:\"field_quiz\";a:1:{s:9:\"x-default\";N;}s:21:\"field_pptx_attachment\";a:1:{s:9:\"x-default\";a:3:{s:9:\"target_id\";N;s:7:\"display\";N;s:11:\"description\";N;}}s:14:\"field_comments\";a:1:{s:9:\"x-default\";a:1:{i:0;a:6:{s:6:\"status\";s:1:\"2\";s:3:\"cid\";s:1:\"0\";s:22:\"last_comment_timestamp\";s:10:\"1774442931\";s:17:\"last_comment_name\";N;s:16:\"last_comment_uid\";s:1:\"0\";s:13:\"comment_count\";s:1:\"0\";}}}s:15:\"field_h5p_embed\";a:1:{s:9:\"x-default\";N;}}s:9:\"\0*\0fields\";a:0:{}s:19:\"\0*\0fieldDefinitions\";N;s:12:\"\0*\0languages\";N;s:14:\"\0*\0langcodeKey\";s:8:\"langcode\";s:21:\"\0*\0defaultLangcodeKey\";s:16:\"default_langcode\";s:17:\"\0*\0activeLangcode\";s:9:\"x-default\";s:28:\"\0*\0enforceDefaultTranslation\";N;s:18:\"\0*\0defaultLangcode\";s:2:\"en\";s:15:\"\0*\0translations\";a:1:{s:9:\"x-default\";a:1:{s:6:\"status\";i:1;}}s:24:\"\0*\0translationInitialize\";b:0;s:14:\"\0*\0newRevision\";b:0;s:20:\"\0*\0isDefaultRevision\";b:1;s:13:\"\0*\0entityKeys\";a:4:{s:6:\"bundle\";s:10:\"lms_lesson\";s:2:\"id\";s:3:\"442\";s:4:\"uuid\";s:36:\"9b12f9d8-1770-4bbf-91ad-3ad626920cfc\";s:9:\"published\";s:1:\"1\";}s:25:\"\0*\0translatableEntityKeys\";a:3:{s:5:\"label\";a:1:{s:9:\"x-default\";s:34:\"Understanding Different Data Types\";}s:8:\"langcode\";a:1:{s:9:\"x-default\";s:2:\"en\";}s:16:\"default_langcode\";a:1:{s:9:\"x-default\";s:1:\"1\";}}s:12:\"\0*\0validated\";b:0;s:21:\"\0*\0validationRequired\";b:0;s:19:\"\0*\0loadedRevisionId\";N;s:33:\"\0*\0revisionTranslationAffectedKey\";s:29:\"revision_translation_affected\";s:37:\"\0*\0enforceRevisionTranslationAffected\";a:0:{}s:12:\"\0*\0isSyncing\";b:0;}',-1,1774587141.942,1,'entity_field_info','0'),
('values:lms_lesson:443','O:31:\"Drupal\\lms_lesson\\Entity\\Lesson\":30:{s:15:\"\0*\0entityTypeId\";s:10:\"lms_lesson\";s:15:\"\0*\0enforceIsNew\";N;s:12:\"\0*\0typedData\";N;s:17:\"\0*\0originalEntity\";N;s:16:\"\0*\0cacheContexts\";a:0:{}s:12:\"\0*\0cacheTags\";a:0:{}s:14:\"\0*\0cacheMaxAge\";i:-1;s:14:\"\0*\0_serviceIds\";a:0:{}s:18:\"\0*\0_entityStorages\";a:0:{}s:9:\"\0*\0values\";a:23:{s:2:\"id\";a:1:{s:9:\"x-default\";s:3:\"443\";}s:4:\"uuid\";a:1:{s:9:\"x-default\";s:36:\"a90cb1d2-5b18-4d39-9d37-925a5008f3b9\";}s:8:\"langcode\";a:1:{s:9:\"x-default\";s:2:\"en\";}s:4:\"name\";a:1:{s:9:\"x-default\";s:35:\"Identifying Key Data Sources for AI\";}s:13:\"field_content\";a:1:{s:9:\"x-default\";a:2:{s:5:\"value\";s:1294:\"<h2>Introduction</h2><p>In the realm of AI, identifying key data sources is crucial for building effective models. This lesson explores the various types of data sources essential for AI applications.</p><h3>Types of Data Sources</h3><p>Data for AI can come from a variety of sources. Understanding the nature and origin of these sources is vital for successful AI implementation.</p><ul><li><strong>Internal Data:</strong> Includes data generated within the organization, such as sales records and customer feedback.</li><li><strong>External Data:</strong> Comprises data from outside the organization, like social media feeds and market reports.</li></ul><h3>Key Considerations</h3><p>When identifying data sources, consider data quality, relevance, and accessibility. High-quality data leads to better AI outcomes.</p><p>Data relevance ensures that the information collected aligns with the objectives of the AI project.</p><h4>Data Accessibility</h4><p>Accessible data means it is readily available and can be integrated into the AI systems without significant barriers.</p><h3>Conclusion</h3><p>Identifying the right data sources is the foundation of successful AI projects. It involves evaluating the data’s origin, relevance, and quality to ensure it can drive insightful analyses.</p>\";s:6:\"format\";s:9:\"full_html\";}}s:10:\"field_type\";a:1:{s:9:\"x-default\";s:4:\"text\";}s:15:\"field_video_url\";a:1:{s:9:\"x-default\";s:117:\"https://www.youtube.com/results?search_query=key+data+sources+for+AI%2C+identifying+data+for+AI%2C+AI+data+collection\";}s:16:\"field_video_file\";a:1:{s:9:\"x-default\";a:3:{s:9:\"target_id\";N;s:7:\"display\";N;s:11:\"description\";N;}}s:21:\"field_zoom_meeting_id\";a:1:{s:9:\"x-default\";N;}s:19:\"field_zoom_schedule\";a:1:{s:9:\"x-default\";N;}s:19:\"field_scorm_package\";a:1:{s:9:\"x-default\";a:3:{s:9:\"target_id\";N;s:7:\"display\";N;s:11:\"description\";N;}}s:14:\"field_duration\";a:1:{s:9:\"x-default\";s:1:\"0\";}s:18:\"field_free_preview\";a:1:{s:9:\"x-default\";s:1:\"0\";}s:15:\"field_drip_days\";a:1:{s:9:\"x-default\";s:1:\"0\";}s:6:\"weight\";a:1:{s:9:\"x-default\";s:1:\"0\";}s:6:\"status\";a:1:{s:9:\"x-default\";s:1:\"1\";}s:7:\"created\";a:1:{s:9:\"x-default\";s:10:\"1774442931\";}s:7:\"changed\";a:1:{s:9:\"x-default\";s:10:\"1774519648\";}s:16:\"default_langcode\";a:1:{s:9:\"x-default\";s:1:\"1\";}s:10:\"field_quiz\";a:1:{s:9:\"x-default\";N;}s:21:\"field_pptx_attachment\";a:1:{s:9:\"x-default\";a:3:{s:9:\"target_id\";N;s:7:\"display\";N;s:11:\"description\";N;}}s:14:\"field_comments\";a:1:{s:9:\"x-default\";a:1:{i:0;a:6:{s:6:\"status\";s:1:\"2\";s:3:\"cid\";s:1:\"0\";s:22:\"last_comment_timestamp\";s:10:\"1774442931\";s:17:\"last_comment_name\";N;s:16:\"last_comment_uid\";s:1:\"0\";s:13:\"comment_count\";s:1:\"0\";}}}s:15:\"field_h5p_embed\";a:1:{s:9:\"x-default\";N;}}s:9:\"\0*\0fields\";a:0:{}s:19:\"\0*\0fieldDefinitions\";N;s:12:\"\0*\0languages\";N;s:14:\"\0*\0langcodeKey\";s:8:\"langcode\";s:21:\"\0*\0defaultLangcodeKey\";s:16:\"default_langcode\";s:17:\"\0*\0activeLangcode\";s:9:\"x-default\";s:28:\"\0*\0enforceDefaultTranslation\";N;s:18:\"\0*\0defaultLangcode\";s:2:\"en\";s:15:\"\0*\0translations\";a:1:{s:9:\"x-default\";a:1:{s:6:\"status\";i:1;}}s:24:\"\0*\0translatio