('values:lms_lesson:448','O:31:\"Drupal\\lms_lesson\\Entity\\Lesson\":30:{s:15:\"\0*\0entityTypeId\";s:10:\"lms_lesson\";s:15:\"\0*\0enforceIsNew\";N;s:12:\"\0*\0typedData\";N;s:17:\"\0*\0originalEntity\";N;s:16:\"\0*\0cacheContexts\";a:0:{}s:12:\"\0*\0cacheTags\";a:0:{}s:14:\"\0*\0cacheMaxAge\";i:-1;s:14:\"\0*\0_serviceIds\";a:0:{}s:18:\"\0*\0_entityStorages\";a:0:{}s:9:\"\0*\0values\";a:23:{s:2:\"id\";a:1:{s:9:\"x-default\";s:3:\"448\";}s:4:\"uuid\";a:1:{s:9:\"x-default\";s:36:\"8185c7cb-9637-4c5a-b904-82f82ab83cbc\";}s:8:\"langcode\";a:1:{s:9:\"x-default\";s:2:\"en\";}s:4:\"name\";a:1:{s:9:\"x-default\";s:40:\"Data Security and Privacy in AI Contexts\";}s:13:\"field_content\";a:1:{s:9:\"x-default\";a:2:{s:5:\"value\";s:1562:\"<h2>Introduction to Data Security and Privacy</h2><p>Data security and privacy are critical considerations in the development and deployment of AI applications. Ensuring that sensitive information is protected from unauthorized access is paramount.</p><h3>Understanding the Importance</h3><p>AI systems often handle vast amounts of personal and sensitive data. Protecting this data is not only a legal requirement but also crucial for maintaining user trust.</p><ul><li>Data breaches can have severe consequences for both individuals and organizations.</li><li>Proper security measures enhance the integrity and reliability of AI systems.</li></ul><h3>Key Strategies for Data Protection</h3><p>Organizations must implement robust strategies to safeguard data. These strategies include encryption, access control, and regular security audits.</p><ol><li>Encryption ensures that data is unreadable without the correct decryption key.</li><li>Access control restricts data access to authorized users only.</li><li>Security audits help identify and mitigate vulnerabilities in data systems.</li></ol><p>Adopting these practices can significantly reduce the risk of data breaches and enhance overall security.</p><h3>Privacy and AI: A Delicate Balance</h3><p>While AI can provide valuable insights, it is essential to respect user privacy. Transparent data policies and user consent are key components of ethical AI deployment.</p><p>Organizations should prioritize the anonymization of data and minimize data collection to only what is necessary for AI purposes.</p>\";s:6:\"format\";s:9:\"full_html\";}}s:10:\"field_type\";a:1:{s:9:\"x-default\";s:4:\"text\";}s:15:\"field_video_url\";a:1:{s:9:\"x-default\";s:123:\"https://www.youtube.com/results?search_query=Data+Security+AI%2C+Privacy+AI%2C+Data+Protection+AI%2C+AI+Security+Strategies\";}s:16:\"field_video_file\";a:1:{s:9:\"x-default\";a:3:{s:9:\"target_id\";N;s:7:\"display\";N;s:11:\"description\";N;}}s:21:\"field_zoom_meeting_id\";a:1:{s:9:\"x-default\";N;}s:19:\"field_zoom_schedule\";a:1:{s:9:\"x-default\";N;}s:19:\"field_scorm_package\";a:1:{s:9:\"x-default\";a:3:{s:9:\"target_id\";N;s:7:\"display\";N;s:11:\"description\";N;}}s:14:\"field_duration\";a:1:{s:9:\"x-default\";s:1:\"0\";}s:18:\"field_free_preview\";a:1:{s:9:\"x-default\";s:1:\"0\";}s:15:\"field_drip_days\";a:1:{s:9:\"x-default\";s:1:\"0\";}s:6:\"weight\";a:1:{s:9:\"x-default\";s:1:\"0\";}s:6:\"status\";a:1:{s:9:\"x-default\";s:1:\"1\";}s:7:\"created\";a:1:{s:9:\"x-default\";s:10:\"1774442931\";}s:7:\"changed\";a:1:{s:9:\"x-default\";s:10:\"1774519648\";}s:16:\"default_langcode\";a:1:{s:9:\"x-default\";s:1:\"1\";}s:10:\"field_quiz\";a:1:{s:9:\"x-default\";N;}s:21:\"field_pptx_attachment\";a:1:{s:9:\"x-default\";a:3:{s:9:\"target_id\";N;s:7:\"display\";N;s:11:\"description\";N;}}s:14:\"field_comments\";a:1:{s:9:\"x-default\";a:1:{i:0;a:6:{s:6:\"status\";s:1:\"2\";s:3:\"cid\";s:1:\"0\";s:22:\"last_comment_timestamp\";s:10:\"1774442931\";s:17:\"last_comment_name\";N;s:16:\"last_comment_uid\";s:1:\"0\";s:13:\"comment_count\";s:1:\"0\";}}}s:15:\"field_h5p_embed\";a:1:{s:9:\"x-default\";N;}}s:9:\"\0*\0fields\";a:0:{}s:19:\"\0*\0fieldDefinitions\";N;s:12:\"\0*\0languages\";N;s:14:\"\0*\0langcodeKey\";s:8:\"langcode\";s:21:\