('values:lms_lesson:450','O:31:\"Drupal\\lms_lesson\\Entity\\Lesson\":30:{s:15:\"\0*\0entityTypeId\";s:10:\"lms_lesson\";s:15:\"\0*\0enforceIsNew\";N;s:12:\"\0*\0typedData\";N;s:17:\"\0*\0originalEntity\";N;s:16:\"\0*\0cacheContexts\";a:0:{}s:12:\"\0*\0cacheTags\";a:0:{}s:14:\"\0*\0cacheMaxAge\";i:-1;s:14:\"\0*\0_serviceIds\";a:0:{}s:18:\"\0*\0_entityStorages\";a:0:{}s:9:\"\0*\0values\";a:23:{s:2:\"id\";a:1:{s:9:\"x-default\";s:3:\"450\";}s:4:\"uuid\";a:1:{s:9:\"x-default\";s:36:\"ed4eb337-cbdc-4b44-83a3-cd0da2403d03\";}s:8:\"langcode\";a:1:{s:9:\"x-default\";s:2:\"en\";}s:4:\"name\";a:1:{s:9:\"x-default\";s:37:\"Basic Concepts of Feature Engineering\";}s:13:\"field_content\";a:1:{s:9:\"x-default\";a:2:{s:5:\"value\";s:1387:\"<h1>Introduction to Feature Engineering</h1><p>Feature engineering is the process of transforming raw data into meaningful features that can be used to improve the performance of machine learning models. It is a crucial step in the data preparation phase and can significantly impact the success of AI applications.</p><h2>Why Feature Engineering Matters</h2><p>Effective feature engineering can enhance the predictive power of your models by making the input data more relevant and informative. By selecting, creating, or modifying features, you can provide algorithms with the best possible inputs for learning.</p><h3>Common Techniques in Feature Engineering</h3><ul><li><strong>Normalization:</strong> Adjusting the scale of features to ensure consistency and improve model performance.</li><li><strong>Encoding Categorical Variables:</strong> Converting categorical data into numerical format for model compatibility.</li><li><strong>Feature Extraction:</strong> Deriving new features from existing data to capture essential information.</li><li><strong>Dimensionality Reduction:</strong> Reducing the number of features to eliminate noise and enhance processing efficiency.</li></ul><h2>Practical Applications</h2><p>Feature engineering is applied across various domains, including finance, healthcare, and marketing, to optimize model outcomes and provide actionable insights.</p>\";s:6:\"format\";s:9:\"full_html\";}}s:10:\"field_type\";a:1:{s:9:\"x-default\";s:4:\"text\";}s:15:\"field_video_url\";a:1:{s:9:\"x-default\";s:136:\"https://www.youtube.com/results?search_query=Feature+Engineering+Tutorial%2C+Data+Transformation+AI%2C+Machine+Learning+Feature+Creation\";}s:16:\"field_video_file\";a:1:{s:9:\"x-default\";a:3:{s:9:\"target_id\";N;s:7:\"display\";N;s:11:\"description\";N;}}s:21:\"field_zoom_meeting_id\";a:1:{s:9:\"x-default\";N;}s:19:\"field_zoom_schedule\";a:1:{s:9:\"x-default\";N;}s:19:\"field_scorm_package\";a:1:{s:9:\"x-default\";a:3:{s:9:\"target_id\";N;s:7:\"display\";N;s:11:\"description\";N;}}s:14:\"field_duration\";a:1:{s:9:\"x-default\";s:1:\"0\";}s:18:\"field_free_preview\";a:1:{s:9:\"x-default\";s:1:\"0\";}s:15:\"field_drip_days\";a:1:{s:9:\"x-default\";s:1:\"0\";}s:6:\"weight\";a:1:{s:9:\"x-default\";s:1:\"0\";}s:6:\"status\";a:1:{s:9:\"x-default\";s:1:\"1\";}s:7:\"created\";a:1:{s:9:\"x-default\";s:10:\"1774442931\";}s:7:\"changed\";a:1:{s:9:\"x-default\";s:10:\"1774519648\";}s:16:\"default_langcode\";a:1:{s:9:\"x-default\";s:1:\"1\";}s:10:\"field_quiz\";a:1:{s:9:\"x-default\";N;}s:21:\"field_pptx_attachment\";a:1:{s:9:\"x-default\";a:3:{s:9:\"target_id\";N;s:7:\"display\";N;s:11:\"description\";N;}}s:14:\"field_comments\";a:1:{s:9:\"x-default\";a:1:{i:0;a:6:{s:6:\"status\";s:1:\"2\";s:3:\"cid\";s:1:\"0\";s:22:\"last_comment_timestamp\";s:10:\"1774442931\";s:17:\"last_comment_name\";N;s:16:\"last_comment_uid\";s:1:\"0\";s:13:\"comment_count\";s:1:\"0\";}}}s:15:\"field_h5p_embed\";a:1:{s:9:\"x-default\";N;}}s:9:\"\0*\0fields\";a:0:{}s:19:\"\0*\0fieldDefinitions\";N;s:12:\"\0*\0languages\";N;s:14:\"\0*\0langcodeKey\";s:8:\"langcode\";s:21:\"\0*\0defaultLangcodeKey\";s:16:\"default_langcode\";s:17:\"\0*\0activeLangcode\";s:9:\"x-default\";s:28:\"\0*\0enforceDefaultTranslation\";N;s:18:\"\0*\0defaultLang