('values:lms_lesson:464','O:31:\"Drupal\\lms_lesson\\Entity\\Lesson\":30:{s:15:\"\0*\0entityTypeId\";s:10:\"lms_lesson\";s:15:\"\0*\0enforceIsNew\";N;s:12:\"\0*\0typedData\";N;s:17:\"\0*\0originalEntity\";N;s:16:\"\0*\0cacheContexts\";a:0:{}s:12:\"\0*\0cacheTags\";a:0:{}s:14:\"\0*\0cacheMaxAge\";i:-1;s:14:\"\0*\0_serviceIds\";a:0:{}s:18:\"\0*\0_entityStorages\";a:0:{}s:9:\"\0*\0values\";a:23:{s:2:\"id\";a:1:{s:9:\"x-default\";s:3:\"464\";}s:4:\"uuid\";a:1:{s:9:\"x-default\";s:36:\"d7359089-0651-4584-b57a-0591dd22f603\";}s:8:\"langcode\";a:1:{s:9:\"x-default\";s:2:\"en\";}s:4:\"name\";a:1:{s:9:\"x-default\";s:44:\"Data Democratization: Making Data Accessible\";}s:13:\"field_content\";a:1:{s:9:\"x-default\";a:2:{s:5:\"value\";s:919:\"<h1>Data Democratization: Making Data Accessible</h1><p>Data democratization is the process of making data accessible to non-specialist users within an organization. It empowers employees at all levels to use data in decision-making processes.</p><p>There are several key strategies to achieve data democratization:</p><ul><li><strong>Implementing User-Friendly Tools:</strong> Providing intuitive tools that allow employees to access and analyze data independently.</li><li><strong>Establishing Data Literacy Programs:</strong> Educating staff on data interpretation and usage to enhance data-driven decision-making.</li><li><strong>Ensuring Data Security:</strong> Maintaining robust data governance policies to protect sensitive information while allowing access.</li></ul><p>Ultimately, data democratization fosters a culture where data is a shared asset, leading to more informed and agile business operations.</p>\";s:6:\"format\";s:9:\"full_html\";}}s:10:\"field_type\";a:1:{s:9:\"x-default\";s:4:\"text\";}s:15:\"field_video_url\";a:1:{s:9:\"x-default\";s:127:\"https://www.youtube.com/results?search_query=Data+Democratization%2C+Data+Accessibility%2C+Data+Literacy%2C+Data-Driven+Culture\";}s:16:\"field_video_file\";a:1:{s:9:\"x-default\";a:3:{s:9