cratization: Making Data Accessible\";}s:8:\"langcode\";a:1:{s:9:\"x-default\";s:2:\"en\";}s:16:\"default_langcode\";a:1:{s:9:\"x-default\";s:1:\"1\";}}s:12:\"\0*\0validated\";b:0;s:21:\"\0*\0validationRequired\";b:0;s:19:\"\0*\0loadedRevisionId\";N;s:33:\"\0*\0revisionTranslationAffectedKey\";s:29:\"revision_translation_affected\";s:37:\"\0*\0enforceRevisionTranslationAffected\";a:0:{}s:12:\"\0*\0isSyncing\";b:0;}',-1,1774587141.917,1,'entity_field_info','0'),
('values:lms_lesson:465','O:31:\"Drupal\\lms_lesson\\Entity\\Lesson\":30:{s:15:\"\0*\0entityTypeId\";s:10:\"lms_lesson\";s:15:\"\0*\0enforceIsNew\";N;s:12:\"\0*\0typedData\";N;s:17:\"\0*\0originalEntity\";N;s:16:\"\0*\0cacheContexts\";a:0:{}s:12:\"\0*\0cacheTags\";a:0:{}s:14:\"\0*\0cacheMaxAge\";i:-1;s:14:\"\0*\0_serviceIds\";a:0:{}s:18:\"\0*\0_entityStorages\";a:0:{}s:9:\"\0*\0values\";a:23:{s:2:\"id\";a:1:{s:9:\"x-default\";s:3:\"465\";}s:4:\"uuid\";a:1:{s:9:\"x-default\";s:36:\"0adb2c78-142a-44f2-bb80-64cec62318e6\";}s:8:\"langcode\";a:1:{s:9:\"x-default\";s:2:\"en\";}s:4:\"name\";a:1:{s:9:\"x-default\";s:46:\"The Role of Data Stewards in Your Organization\";}s:13:\"field_content\";a:1:{s:9:\"x-default\";a:2:{s:5:\"value\";s:975:\"<h1>The Role of Data Stewards in Your Organization</h1><p>Data stewards play a crucial role in managing and safeguarding an organization\'s data assets. Their responsibilities include ensuring data quality, accessibility, and security.</p><p><strong>Key Responsibilities of Data Stewards:</strong></p><ul><li>Establishing data governance policies.</li><li>Monitoring data quality metrics.</li><li>Facilitating data access for stakeholders.</li></ul><p>By effectively managing these aspects, data stewards enable organizations to leverage data for strategic decision-making.</p><h2>Importance of Data Stewards</h2><p>In today\'s digital era, data is a critical asset. Data stewards ensure that this asset is well-organized and of high quality, which is essential for gaining insights and driving business growth.</p><p><em>Data stewards also play a pivotal role in compliance with data protection regulations, ensuring that data handling practices meet legal standards.</em></p>\";s:6:\"format\";s:9:\"full_html\";}}s:10:\"field_type\";a:1:{s:9:\"x-default\";s:4:\"text\";}s:15:\"field_video_url\";a:1:{s:9:\"x-default\";s:83:\"https://www.youtube.com/results?search_query=data+stewardship+role+in+organizations\";}s:16:\"field_video_file\";a:1:{s:9:\"x-def