('values:lms_lesson:481','O:31:\"Drupal\\lms_lesson\\Entity\\Lesson\":30:{s:15:\"\0*\0entityTypeId\";s:10:\"lms_lesson\";s:15:\"\0*\0enforceIsNew\";N;s:12:\"\0*\0typedData\";N;s:17:\"\0*\0originalEntity\";N;s:16:\"\0*\0cacheContexts\";a:0:{}s:12:\"\0*\0cacheTags\";a:0:{}s:14:\"\0*\0cacheMaxAge\";i:-1;s:14:\"\0*\0_serviceIds\";a:0:{}s:18:\"\0*\0_entityStorages\";a:0:{}s:9:\"\0*\0values\";a:23:{s:2:\"id\";a:1:{s:9:\"x-default\";s:3:\"481\";}s:4:\"uuid\";a:1:{s:9:\"x-default\";s:36:\"2a97a5d3-b261-4421-8a2d-5ddfd4f33440\";}s:8:\"langcode\";a:1:{s:9:\"x-default\";s:2:\"en\";}s:4:\"name\";a:1:{s:9:\"x-default\";s:41:\"Understanding Serverless AI Architectures\";}s:13:\"field_content\";a:1:{s:9:\"x-default\";a:2:{s:5:\"value\";s:1030:\"<h2>Introduction to Serverless AI</h2><p>Serverless architectures allow developers to build and run applications without managing the underlying infrastructure. This approach is particularly useful for AI applications as it enables scalability, reduces costs, and improves agility.</p><h3>Benefits of Serverless AI</h3><ul><li><strong>Cost Efficiency:</strong> Pay only for the compute time you consume.</li><li><strong>Scalability:</strong> Automatically scale to accommodate load.</li><li><strong>Focus on Code:</strong> Eliminate server management tasks.</li></ul><h3>Key Components</h3><p>In a serverless architecture, functions are the core components. These functions are triggered by events, allowing for a highly responsive system.</p><h3>Use Cases</h3><p>Serverless AI can be applied in various scenarios such as data processing, real-time analytics, and automated workflows.</p><h3>Challenges</h3><p>Despite its advantages, serverless architecture poses challenges like cold start latency and limited execution time.</p>\";s:6:\"format\";s:9:\"full_html\";}}s:10:\"field_type\";a:1:{s:9:\"x-default\";s:4:\"text\";}s:15:\"field_video_url\";a:1:{s:9:\"x-default\";s:137:\"https://www.youtube.com/results?search_query=serverless+AI+architecture+tutoria