('values:lms_lesson:487','O:31:\"Drupal\\lms_lesson\\Entity\\Lesson\":30:{s:15:\"\0*\0entityTypeId\";s:10:\"lms_lesson\";s:15:\"\0*\0enforceIsNew\";N;s:12:\"\0*\0typedData\";N;s:17:\"\0*\0originalEntity\";N;s:16:\"\0*\0cacheContexts\";a:0:{}s:12:\"\0*\0cacheTags\";a:0:{}s:14:\"\0*\0cacheMaxAge\";i:-1;s:14:\"\0*\0_serviceIds\";a:0:{}s:18:\"\0*\0_entityStorages\";a:0:{}s:9:\"\0*\0values\";a:23:{s:2:\"id\";a:1:{s:9:\"x-default\";s:3:\"487\";}s:4:\"uuid\";a:1:{s:9:\"x-default\";s:36:\"be054ee2-d068-4381-9d6f-1ff45b7cd6b6\";}s:8:\"langcode\";a:1:{s:9:\"x-default\";s:2:\"en\";}s:4:\"name\";a:1:{s:9:\"x-default\";s:35:\"Deployment Strategies for AI Models\";}s:13:\"field_content\";a:1:{s:9:\"x-default\";a:2:{s:5:\"value\";s:1271:\"<h2>Introduction to Deployment Strategies</h2><p>Deploying AI models effectively is crucial for leveraging their full potential. This lesson explores various strategies for deploying AI models in business environments.</p><h3>Understanding Deployment Options</h3><p>Different deployment options include cloud-based, on-premise, and hybrid models. Each has its own benefits and limitations.</p><ul><li><strong>Cloud-based:</strong> Offers scalability and flexibility.</li><li><strong>On-premise:</strong> Provides control and security.</li><li><strong>Hybrid:</strong> Combines the benefits of both approaches.</li></ul><h3>Key Considerations in Deployment</h3><p>Considerations such as cost, scalability, integration, and compliance play a vital role in choosing the right deployment strategy.</p><p>Ensuring seamless integration with existing systems is essential for successful deployment.</p><h3>Monitoring and Optimization</h3><p>Regular monitoring post-deployment ensures the AI model continues to meet performance expectations. Optimization may be necessary as data and business needs evolve.</p><h3>Continuous Improvement</h3><p>Adopting a cycle of continuous improvement helps in refining AI models and strategies to keep pace with technological advancements.</p>\";s:6:\"format\";s:9:\"full_html\";}}s:10:\"field_type\";a:1:{s:9:\"x-default\";s:4:\"text\";}s:15:\"field_video_url\";a:1:{s:9:\"x-default\";s:121:\"https://www.youtube.com/results?search_query=AI+model+deployment+strategies%2C+cloud+AI+deployment%2C+on-premise+AI+model\";}s:16:\"field_video_file\";a:1:{s:9:\"x-default\";a:3:{s:9:\"target_id\";N;s:7:\"display\";N;s:11:\"description\";N;}}s:21:\"field_zoom_meeting_id\";a:1:{s:9:\"x-default\";N;}s:19:\"field_zoom_schedule\";a:1:{s:9:\"x-default\";N;}s:19:\"field_scorm_package\";a:1:{s:9:\"x-default\";a:3:{s:9:\"target_id\";N;s:7:\"display\";N;s:11:\"description\";N;}}s:14:\"field_duration\";a:1:{s:9:\"x-default\";s:1:\"0\";}s:18:\"field_free_preview\";a:1:{s:9:\"x-default\";s:1:\"0\";}s:15:\"field_drip_days\";a:1:{s:9:\"x-default\";s:1:\"0\";}s:6:\"weight\";a:1:{s:9:\"x-default\";s:1:\"0\";}s:6:\"status\";a:1:{s:9:\"x-default\";s:1:\"1\";}s:7:\"created\";a:1:{s:9:\"x-default\";s:10:\"1774442931\";}s:7:\"changed\";a:1:{s:9:\"x-default\";s:10:\"1774519648\";}s:16:\"default_langcode\";a:1:{s:9:\"x-default\";s:1:\"1\";}s:10:\"field_quiz\";a:1:{s:9:\"x-default\";N;}s:21:\"field_pptx_attachment\";a:1:{s:9:\"x-default\";a:3:{s:9:\"target_id\";N;s:7:\"display\";N;s:11:\"description\";N;}}s:14:\"field_comments\";a:1:{s:9:\"x-default\";a:1:{i:0;a:6:{s:6:\"status\";s:1:\"2\";s:3:\"cid\";s:1:\"0\";s:22:\"last_comment_timestamp\";s:10:\"1774442931\";s:17:\"last_comment_name\";N;s:16:\"last_comment_uid\";s:1:\"0\";s:13:\"comment_count\";s:1:\"0\";}}}s:15:\"field_h5p_embed\";a:1:{s:9:\"x-default\";N;}}s:9:\"\0*\0fields\";a:0:{}s:19:\"\0*\0fieldDefinitions\";N;s:12:\"\0*\0languages\";N;s:14:\"\0*\0langcodeKey\";s:8:\"langcode\";s:21:\"\0*\0defaultLangcodeKey\";s:16:\"default_langcode\";s:17:\"\0*\0activeLangcode\";s:9:\"x-default\";s:28:\"\0*\0enforceDefaultTranslation\";N;s:18:\"\0*\0defaultLangcode\";s:2:\"en\";s:15:\"\0*\0translations\";a:1:{s:9:\"x-default\";a:1:{s:6:\"status\";i:1;}}s:24:\"\0*\0translationInitialize\";b:0;s:14:\"\0*\0newRevision\";b:0;s:20:\"\0*\0isDefaultRevision\";b:1;s:13:\"\0*\0entityKeys\";a:4:{s:6:\"bundle\";s:10:\"lms_lesson\";s:2:\"id\";s:3:\"487\";s:4:\"uuid\";s:36:\"be054ee2-d068-4381-9d6f-1ff45b7cd6b6\";s:9:\"published\";s:1:\"1\";}s:25:\"\0*\0translatableEntityKeys\";a:3:{s:5:\"label\";a:1:{s:9:\"x-default\";s:35:\"Deployment Strategies for AI Models\";}s:8:\"langcode\";a:1:{s:9:\"x-default\";s:2:\"en\";}s:16:\"default_langcode\";a:1:{s:9:\"x-default\";s:1:\"1\";}}s:12:\"\0*\0validated\";b:0;s:21:\"\0*\0validationRequired\";b:0;s:19:\"\0*\0loadedRevisionId\";N;s:33:\"\0*\0revisionTranslationAffectedKey\";s:29:\"revision_translation_affected\";s:37:\"\0*\0enforceRevisionTranslationAffected\";a:0:{}s:12:\"\0*\0isSyncing\";b:0;}',-1,1774587141.897,1,'entity_field_info','0'),
('values:lms_lesson:488','O:31:\"Drupal\\lms_lesson\\Entity\\Lesson\":30:{s:15:\"\0*\0entityTypeId\";s:10:\"lms_lesson\";s:15:\"\0*\0enforceIsNew\";N;s:12:\"\0*\0typedData\";N;s:17:\"\0*\0originalEntity\";N;s:16:\"\0*\0cacheContexts\";a:0:{}s:12:\"\0*\0cacheTags\";a:0:{}s:14:\"\0*\0cacheMaxAge\";i:-1;s:14:\"\0*\0_serviceIds\";a:0:{}s:18:\"\0*\0_entityStorages\";a:0:{}s:9:\"\0*\0values\";a:23:{s:2:\"id\";a:1:{s:9:\"x-default\";s:3:\"488\";}s:4:\"uuid\";a:1:{s:9:\"x-default\";s:36:\"6847f8db-ce53-4759-b0b8-a41aa6fc645e\";}s:8:\"langcode\";a:1:{s:9:\"x-default\";s:2:\"en\";}s:4:\"name\";a:1:{s:9:\"x-default\";s:42:\"Post-Deployment Monitoring and Maintenance\";}s:13:\"field_content\";a:1:{s:9:\"x-default\";a:2:{s:5:\"value\";s:1688:\"<h1>Post-Deployment Monitoring and Maintenance</h1><p>Once an AI model is deployed, continuous monitoring and maintenance are crucial to ensure its performance and reliability. This involves tracking model outputs, identifying anomalies, and addressing potential issues promptly.</p><h2>Key Aspects of Monitoring</h2><p>Effective monitoring includes tracking model accuracy, latency, and resource utilization. These metrics help in understanding how well the model is performing and when it might need updates or retraining.</p><ul><li><strong>Accuracy:</strong> Regularly assess predictive accuracy to ensure the model remains effective.</li><li><strong>Latency:</strong> Monitor response times to maintain user satisfaction.</li><li><strong>Resource Utilization:</strong> Keep track of computational resources to manage costs effectively.</li></ul><h2>Maintenance Activities</h2><p>Maintenance involves updating the model with new data, refining algorithms, and addressing any technical issues that could arise during operation.</p><p>Here are some typical maintenance tasks:</p><ol><li>Data Refresh: Integrate new data regularly to keep the model relevant.</li><li>Performance Tuning: Adjust model parameters to optimize performance.</li><li>Issue Resolution: Quickly address software bugs and integration problems.</li></ol><h2>Continuous Improvement</h2><p>Feedback loops are essential for continuous improvement. Collecting user feedback and performance data helps in refining the model for better accuracy and efficiency over time.</p><p>By implementing these strategies, organizations can ensure their AI solutions deliver sustained value and adapt to changing business needs.</p>\";s:6:\"format\";s:9:\"full_html\";}}s:10:\"field_type\";a:1:{s:9:\"x-default\";s:4:\"text\";}s:15:\"field_video_url\";a:1:{s:9:\"x-default\";s:113:\"https://www.youtube.com/results?search_query=AI+model+monitoring+and+maintenance%2C+post-deployment+AI+strategies\";}s:16:\"field_video_file\";a:1:{s:9:\"x-default\";a:3:{s:9:\"target_id\";N;s:7:\"display\";N;s:11:\"description\";N;}}s:21:\"field_zoom_meeting_id\";a:1:{s:9:\"x-default\";N;}s:19:\"field_zoom_schedule\";a:1:{s:9:\"x-default\";N;}s:19:\"field_scorm_package\";a:1:{s:9:\"x-default\";a:3:{s:9:\"target_id\";N;s:7:\"display\";N;s:11:\"description\";N;}}s:14:\"field_duration\";a:1:{s:9:\"x-default\";s:1:\"0\";}s:18:\"field_free_preview\";a:1:{s:9:\"x-default\";s:1:\"0\";}s:15:\"field_drip_days\";a:1:{s:9:\"x-default\";s:1:\"0\";}s:6:\"weight\";a:1:{s:9:\"x-default\";s:1:\"0\";}s:6:\"status\";a:1:{s:9:\"x-default\";s:1:\"1\";}s:7:\"created\";a:1:{s:9:\"x-default\";s:10:\"1774442931\";}s:7:\"changed\";a:1:{s:9:\"x-default\";s:10:\"1774519648\";}s:16:\"default_langcode\";a:1:{s:9:\"x-default\";s:1:\"1\";}s:10:\"field_quiz\";a:1:{s:9:\"x-default\";N;}s:21:\"field_pptx_attachment\";a:1:{s:9:\"x-default\";a:3:{s:9:\"target_id\";N;s:7:\"display\";N;s:11:\"description\";N;}}s:14:\"field_comments\";a:1:{s:9:\"x-default\";a:1:{i:0;a:6:{s:6:\"status\";s:1:\"2\";s:3:\"cid\";s:1:\"0\";s:22:\"last_comment_timestamp\";s:10:\"1774442931\";s:17:\"last_comment_name\";N;s:16:\"last_comment_uid\";s:1:\"0\";s:13:\"comment_count\";s:1:\"0\";}}}s:15:\"field_h5p_embed\";a:1:{s:9:\"x-default\";N;}}s:9:\"\0*\0field