('values:lms_lesson:489','O:31:\"Drupal\\lms_lesson\\Entity\\Lesson\":30:{s:15:\"\0*\0entityTypeId\";s:10:\"lms_lesson\";s:15:\"\0*\0enforceIsNew\";N;s:12:\"\0*\0typedData\";N;s:17:\"\0*\0originalEntity\";N;s:16:\"\0*\0cacheContexts\";a:0:{}s:12:\"\0*\0cacheTags\";a:0:{}s:14:\"\0*\0cacheMaxAge\";i:-1;s:14:\"\0*\0_serviceIds\";a:0:{}s:18:\"\0*\0_entityStorages\";a:0:{}s:9:\"\0*\0values\";a:23:{s:2:\"id\";a:1:{s:9:\"x-default\";s:3:\"489\";}s:4:\"uuid\";a:1:{s:9:\"x-default\";s:36:\"d2342179-25ea-416e-9e0a-b302b357a894\";}s:8:\"langcode\";a:1:{s:9:\"x-default\";s:2:\"en\";}s:4:\"name\";a:1:{s:9:\"x-default\";s:37:\"Iteration and Refinement of AI Models\";}s:13:\"field_content\";a:1:{s:9:\"x-default\";a:2:{s:5:\"value\";s:917:\"<h2>Understanding Iteration in AI</h2><p>Iterative development is a key component in refining AI models. It involves repeatedly revisiting and adjusting the model based on performance metrics and new data inputs.</p><h3>Importance of Iteration</h3><p>Through iteration, AI models can improve accuracy and efficiency. This process helps in adapting to changing data environments and business needs, ensuring the model remains relevant and effective.</p><h3>Refinement Techniques</h3><ul><li>Parameter Tuning: Adjusting the hyperparameters to optimize model performance.</li><li>Feature Engineering: Identifying and engineering new features to enhance model predictions.</li><li>Model Retraining: Using new data to retrain the model and improve its predictions.</li></ul><p>Iteration and refinement are ongoing processes that contribute to the evolution of AI models, making them more robust and reliable over time.</p>\";s:6:\"format\";s:9:\"full_html\";}}s:10:\"field_type\";a:1:{s:9:\"x-default\";s:4:\"text\";}s:15:\"field_video_url\";a:1:{s:9:\"x-default\";s:130:\"https://www.youtube.com/results?search_query=AI+model+iteration+and+refinement%2C+parameter+tuning+in+AI%2C+feature+engineering+AI\";}s:16:\"field_video_file\";a:1:{s:9:\"x-default\";a:3:{s:9:\"tar