('values:lms_lesson:494','O:31:\"Drupal\\lms_lesson\\Entity\\Lesson\":30:{s:15:\"\0*\0entityTypeId\";s:10:\"lms_lesson\";s:15:\"\0*\0enforceIsNew\";N;s:12:\"\0*\0typedData\";N;s:17:\"\0*\0originalEntity\";N;s:16:\"\0*\0cacheContexts\";a:0:{}s:12:\"\0*\0cacheTags\";a:0:{}s:14:\"\0*\0cacheMaxAge\";i:-1;s:14:\"\0*\0_serviceIds\";a:0:{}s:18:\"\0*\0_entityStorages\";a:0:{}s:9:\"\0*\0values\";a:23:{s:2:\"id\";a:1:{s:9:\"x-default\";s:3:\"494\";}s:4:\"uuid\";a:1:{s:9:\"x-default\";s:36:\"baddfb4f-74ca-4914-927d-c3fa3b1ed790\";}s:8:\"langcode\";a:1:{s:9:\"x-default\";s:2:\"en\";}s:4:\"name\";a:1:{s:9:\"x-default\";s:57:\"Continuous Integration/Continuous Delivery (CI/CD) for ML\";}s:13:\"field_content\";a:1:{s:9:\"x-default\";a:2:{s:5:\"value\";s:1579:\"<h2>Understanding CI/CD in ML</h2><p>Continuous Integration and Continuous Delivery (CI/CD) are crucial practices in modern software development, designed to make the deployment of updates and new features seamless and reliable. In the context of Machine Learning (ML), CI/CD helps streamline the integration of ML models into production environments.</p><h3>Key Benefits of CI/CD for ML</h3><ul><li><strong>Automation:</strong> Automates the testing and deployment processes, reducing manual intervention.</li><li><strong>Consistency:</strong> Ensures consistent deployment of ML models, minimizing errors and discrepancies.</li><li><strong>Rapid Iteration:</strong> Facilitates rapid iteration and improvement of models based on real-world feedback.</li></ul><h3>Implementing CI/CD for ML</h3><p>Setting up CI/CD for ML involves several key steps, such as:</p><ol><li>Version Control: Use of systems like Git for managing code and model versioning.</li><li>Automated Testing: Implementing tests to validate model performance and integration.</li><li>Continuous Integration: Ensuring that all changes are automatically built and tested.</li><li>Continuous Delivery: Automating the deployment process to production environments.</li></ol><p>CI/CD pipelines in ML may also involve tools such as Jenkins, GitHub Actions, or GitLab CI/CD to automate workflows.</p><h3>Challenges</h3><p>While CI/CD can greatly enhance ML operations, there are challenges such as handling data dependencies, ensuring model performance consistency, and integrating with existing IT infrastructure.</p>\";s:6:\"format\";s:9:\"full_html\";}}s:10:\"field_type\";a:1:{s:9:\"x-default\";s:4:\"text\";}s:15:\"field_video_url\";a:1:{s:9:\"x-default\";s:121:\"https://www.youtube.com/results?search_query=CI%2FCD+for+Machine+Learning%2C+ML+pipelines%2C+Continuous+Integration+in+ML\";}s:16:\"field_video_file\";a:1:{s:9:\"x-default\";a:3:{s:9:\"target_id\";N;s:7:\"display\";N;s:11:\"description\";N;}}s:21:\"field_zoom_meeting_id\";a:1:{s:9:\"x-default\";N;}s:19:\"field_zoom_schedule\";a:1:{s:9:\"x-default\";N;}s:19:\"field_scorm_package\";a:1:{s:9:\"x-default\";a:3:{s:9:\"target_id\";N;s:7:\"display\";N;s:11:\"description\";N;}}s:14:\"field_duration\";a:1:{s:9:\"x-default\";s:1:\"0\";}s:18:\"field_free_preview\";a:1:{s:9:\"x-default\";s:1:\"0\";}s:15:\"field_drip_days\";a:1:{s:9:\"x-default\";s:1:\"0\";}s:6:\"weight\";a:1:{s:9:\"x-default\";s:1:\"0\";}s:6:\"status\";a:1:{s:9:\"x-default\";s:1:\"1\";}s:7:\"created\";a:1:{s:9:\"x-default\";s:10:\"1774442931\";}s:7:\"changed\";a:1:{s:9:\"x-default\";s:10:\"1774519648\";}s:16:\"default_langcode\";a:1:{s:9:\"x-default\";s:1:\"1\";}s:10:\"field_quiz\";a:1:{s:9:\"x-default\";N;}s:21:\"field_pptx_attachment\";a:1:{s:9:\"x-default\";a:3:{s:9:\"target_id\";N;s:7:\"display\";N;s:11:\"description\";N;}}s:14:\"field_comments\";a:1:{s:9:\"x-default\";a:1:{i:0;a:6:{s:6:\"status\";s:1:\"2\";s:3:\"cid\";s:1:\"0\";s:22:\"last_comment_timestamp\";s:10:\"1774442931\";s:17:\"last_comment_name\";N;s:16:\"last_comment_uid\";s:1:\"0\";s:13:\"comment_count\";s:1:\"0\";}}}s:15:\"field_h5p_embed\";a:1:{s:9:\"x-default\";N;}}s:9:\"\0*\0fields\";a:0:{}s:19:\"\0*\0fieldDefinitions\";N;s:12:\"\0*\0languages\";N;s:14:\"\0*\0langc