('values:lms_lesson:509','O:31:\"Drupal\\lms_lesson\\Entity\\Lesson\":30:{s:15:\"\0*\0entityTypeId\";s:10:\"lms_lesson\";s:15:\"\0*\0enforceIsNew\";N;s:12:\"\0*\0typedData\";N;s:17:\"\0*\0originalEntity\";N;s:16:\"\0*\0cacheContexts\";a:0:{}s:12:\"\0*\0cacheTags\";a:0:{}s:14:\"\0*\0cacheMaxAge\";i:-1;s:14:\"\0*\0_serviceIds\";a:0:{}s:18:\"\0*\0_entityStorages\";a:0:{}s:9:\"\0*\0values\";a:23:{s:2:\"id\";a:1:{s:9:\"x-default\";s:3:\"509\";}s:4:\"uuid\";a:1:{s:9:\"x-default\";s:36:\"6e010d51-4e3e-4348-b8df-28e60466e1cf\";}s:8:\"langcode\";a:1:{s:9:\"x-default\";s:2:\"en\";}s:4:\"name\";a:1:{s:9:\"x-default\";s:53:\"Developing AI Dashboards and Reports for Stakeholders\";}s:13:\"field_content\";a:1:{s:9:\"x-default\";a:2:{s:5:\"value\";s:1513:\"<h1>Developing AI Dashboards and Reports for Stakeholders</h1><p>Creating effective AI dashboards and reports is crucial for communicating insights to stakeholders. These tools help in visualizing data and making informed decisions.</p><h2>Understanding Stakeholder Needs</h2><p>Before developing dashboards, it\'s essential to understand the specific needs and expectations of your stakeholders. Engage with them to gather insights on what metrics and data visualizations are most valuable.</p><h2>Selecting the Right Tools</h2><p>Choose tools that can integrate seamlessly with your existing data infrastructure. Popular tools include Tableau, Power BI, and Google Data Studio, each offering unique features for data visualization.</p><h2>Design Principles</h2><ul><li>Keep the design simple and focused.</li><li>Use clear and concise labels for data points.</li><li>Incorporate interactive elements for deeper insights.</li></ul><h2>Data Visualization Techniques</h2><p>Apply appropriate visualization techniques to highlight trends and patterns. Use bar charts, line graphs, and pie charts to represent data effectively.</p><h2>Ensuring Data Accuracy</h2><p>Regularly update dashboards to reflect the most current data and ensure accuracy. Implement automated data refresh processes to maintain data integrity.</p><h2>Feedback and Iteration</h2><p>Gather feedback from stakeholders to continuously improve the dashboards. Iterative design will help in refining the reports to better meet stakeholder needs.</p>\";s:6:\"format\";s:9:\"full_html\";}}s:10:\"field_type\";a:1:{s:9:\"x-default\";s:4:\"text\";}s:15:\"field_video_url\";a:1:{s:9:\"x-default\";s:98:\"https://www.youtube.com/results?search_query=AI+dashboards+reports+stakeholders+data+visualization\";}s:16:\"field_video_file\";a:1:{s:9:\"x-default\";a:3:{s:9:\"target_id\";N;s:7:\"display\";N;s:11:\"description\";N;}}s:21:\"field_zoom_meeting_id\";a:1:{s:9:\"x-default\";N;}s:19:\"field_zoom_schedule\";a:1:{s:9:\"x-default\";N;}s:19:\"field_scorm_package\";a:1:{s:9:\"x-default\";a:3:{s:9:\"target_id\";N;s:7:\"display\";N;s:11:\"description\";N;}}s:14:\"field_duration\";a:1:{s:9:\"x-default\";s:1:\"0\";}s:18:\"field_free_preview\";a:1:{s:9:\"x-default\";s:1:\"0\";}s:15:\"field_drip_days\";a:1:{s:9:\"x-default\";s:1:\"0\";}s:6:\"weight\";a:1:{s:9:\"x-default\";s:1:\"0\";}s:6:\"status\";a:1:{s:9:\"x-default\";s:1:\"1\";}s:7:\"created\";a:1:{s:9:\"x-default\";s:10:\"1774442931\";}s:7:\"changed\";a:1:{s:9:\"x-default\";s:10:\"1774520661\";}s:16:\"default_langcode\";a:1:{s:9:\"x-default\";s:1:\"1\";}s:10:\"field_quiz\";a:1:{s:9:\"x-default\";N;}s:21:\"field_pptx_attachment\";a:1:{s:9:\"x-default\";a:3:{s:9:\"target_id\";N;s:7:\"display\";N;s:11:\"description\";N;}}s:14:\"field_comments\";a:1:{s:9:\"x-default\";a:1:{i:0;a:6:{s:6:\"status\";s:1:\"2\";s:3:\"cid\";s:1:\"0\";s:22:\"last_comment_timestamp\";s:10:\"1774442931\";s:17:\"last_comment_name\";N;s:16:\"last_comment_uid\";s:1:\"0\";s:13:\"comment_count\";s:1:\"0\";}}}s:15:\"field_h5p_embed\";a:1:{s:9:\"x-default\";N;}}s:9:\"\0*\0fields\";a:0:{}s:19:\"\0*\0fieldDefinitions\";N;s:12:\"\0*\0languages\";N;s:14:\"\0*\0langcodeKey\";s:8:\"langcode\";s:21:\"\0*\0defaultLangcodeKey\";s:16:\"default_langcode\";s:17:\"\