('values:lms_lesson:512','O:31:\"Drupal\\lms_lesson\\Entity\\Lesson\":30:{s:15:\"\0*\0entityTypeId\";s:10:\"lms_lesson\";s:15:\"\0*\0enforceIsNew\";N;s:12:\"\0*\0typedData\";N;s:17:\"\0*\0originalEntity\";N;s:16:\"\0*\0cacheContexts\";a:0:{}s:12:\"\0*\0cacheTags\";a:0:{}s:14:\"\0*\0cacheMaxAge\";i:-1;s:14:\"\0*\0_serviceIds\";a:0:{}s:18:\"\0*\0_entityStorages\";a:0:{}s:9:\"\0*\0values\";a:23:{s:2:\"id\";a:1:{s:9:\"x-default\";s:3:\"512\";}s:4:\"uuid\";a:1:{s:9:\"x-default\";s:36:\"29919ed1-adb7-4dc1-a8d0-922d70343951\";}s:8:\"langcode\";a:1:{s:9:\"x-default\";s:2:\"en\";}s:4:\"name\";a:1:{s:9:\"x-default\";s:35:\"Identifying Key Roles in an AI Team\";}s:13:\"field_content\";a:1:{s:9:\"x-default\";a:2:{s:5:\"value\";s:1446:\"<h2>Introduction to AI Team Roles</h2><p>Building a successful AI team involves assembling a diverse group of professionals with complementary skills. Each role within the team plays a crucial part in ensuring the success of AI projects.</p><h3>1. Data Scientists</h3><p>Data scientists are the backbone of any AI team. They analyze large datasets to derive actionable insights and develop predictive models.</p><h3>2. Machine Learning Engineers</h3><p>These engineers focus on designing and implementing machine learning algorithms and ensuring their scalability and efficiency.</p><h3>3. AI Researchers</h3><p>AI researchers push the boundaries of what is possible with AI, exploring new techniques and methodologies to advance the field.</p><h3>4. Data Engineers</h3><p>Data engineers are responsible for building and maintaining the infrastructure required to store and process large amounts of data.</p><h3>5. Project Managers</h3><p>Project managers coordinate the efforts of the AI team, ensuring that projects are delivered on time and within budget.</p><h3>6. Business Analysts</h3><p>Business analysts bridge the gap between technical teams and business units, ensuring that AI solutions align with business goals.</p><h3>Conclusion</h3><p>Identifying and recruiting the right mix of talent is essential for the success of AI initiatives within an organization. Each role contributes uniquely to the overall functioning of the team.</p>\";s:6:\"format\";s:9:\"full_html\";}}s:10:\"field_type\";a:1:{s:9:\"x-default\";s:4:\"text\";}s:15:\"field_video_url\";a:1:{s:9:\"x-default\";s:157:\"https://www.youtube.com/results?search_query=AI+team+roles%2C+data+scientist+responsibilities%2C+machine+learning+engineer+tasks%2C+AI+project+team+structure\";}s:16:\"field_video_file\";a:1:{s:9:\"x-default\";a:3:{s:9:\"target_id\";N;s:7:\"display\";N;s:11:\"description\";N;}}s:21:\"field_zoom_meeting_id\";a:1:{s:9:\"x-default\";N;}s:19:\"field_zoom_schedule\";a:1:{s:9:\"x-default\";N;}s:19:\"field_scorm_package\";a:1:{s:9:\"x-default\";a:3:{s:9:\"target_id\";N;s:7:\"display\";N;s:11:\"description\";N;}}s:14:\"field_duration\";a:1:{s:9:\"x-default\";s:1:\"0\";}s:18:\"field_free_preview\";a:1:{s:9:\"x-default\";s:1:\"0\";}s:15:\"field_drip_days\";a:1:{s:9:\"x-default\";s:1:\"0\";}s:6:\"weight\";a:1:{s:9:\"x-default\";s:1:\"0\";}s:6:\"status\";a:1:{s:9:\"x-default\";s:1:\"1\";}s:7:\"created\";a:1:{s:9:\"x-default\";s:10:\"1774442931\";}s:7:\"changed\";a:1:{s:9:\"x-default\";s:10:\"1774519648\";}s:16:\"default_langcode\";a:1:{s:9:\"x-default\";s:1:\"1\";}s:10:\"field_quiz\";a:1:{s:9:\"x-default\";N;}s:21:\"field_pptx_attachment\";a:1:{s:9:\"x-default\";a:3:{s:9:\"target_id\";N;s:7:\"display\";N;s:11:\"description\";N;}}s:14:\"field_comments\";a:1:{s:9:\"x-default\";a:1:{i:0;a:6:{s:6:\"status\";s:1:\"2\";s:3:\"cid\";s:1:\"0\";s:22:\"last_comment_timestamp\";s:10:\"1774442931\";s:17:\"last_comment_name\";N;s:16:\"last_comment_uid\";s:1:\"0\";s:13:\"comment_count\";s:1:\"0\";}}}s:15:\"field_h5p_embed\";a:1:{s:9:\"x-default\";N;}}s:9:\"\0*\0fields\";a:0:{}s:19:\"\0*\0fieldDefinitions\";N;s:12:\"\0*\0languages\";N;s:14:\"\0*\0langcodeKey\";s:8:\"langcode\";s:21:\"\0*\0defaultLangcodeKey\";s:16:\"default_langcode\";s:17:\"\0*\0activeLangcode\";s:9:\