('values:lms_lesson:523','O:31:\"Drupal\\lms_lesson\\Entity\\Lesson\":30:{s:15:\"\0*\0entityTypeId\";s:10:\"lms_lesson\";s:15:\"\0*\0enforceIsNew\";N;s:12:\"\0*\0typedData\";N;s:17:\"\0*\0originalEntity\";N;s:16:\"\0*\0cacheContexts\";a:0:{}s:12:\"\0*\0cacheTags\";a:0:{}s:14:\"\0*\0cacheMaxAge\";i:-1;s:14:\"\0*\0_serviceIds\";a:0:{}s:18:\"\0*\0_entityStorages\";a:0:{}s:9:\"\0*\0values\";a:23:{s:2:\"id\";a:1:{s:9:\"x-default\";s:3:\"523\";}s:4:\"uuid\";a:1:{s:9:\"x-default\";s:36:\"a916e776-5e13-4d73-9bea-b0e0d17e6ad5\";}s:8:\"langcode\";a:1:{s:9:\"x-default\";s:2:\"en\";}s:4:\"name\";a:1:{s:9:\"x-default\";s:41:\"Data Governance Specifics for AI Projects\";}s:13:\"field_content\";a:1:{s:9:\"x-default\";a:2:{s:5:\"value\";s:1816:\"<h2>Introduction to Data Governance in AI</h2><p>Data governance is a critical component in the successful implementation of AI projects. It ensures that data is handled in a manner that is compliant with regulations and organizational policies.</p><h3>Key Elements of Data Governance</h3><p>Effective data governance involves several key elements, including data stewardship, data quality management, and data privacy and security.</p><ul><li><strong>Data Stewardship:</strong> Assigning roles and responsibilities for managing data assets.</li><li><strong>Data Quality Management:</strong> Ensuring data is accurate, consistent, and reliable.</li><li><strong>Data Privacy and Security:</strong> Protecting data from unauthorized access and breaches.</li></ul><h3>Implementing Data Governance in AI Projects</h3><p>Implementing data governance requires a structured approach. This involves defining data management policies, establishing governance frameworks, and continuously monitoring data usage.</p><ol><li>Define clear data management policies that align with business goals.</li><li>Establish frameworks to ensure compliance with data-related regulations.</li><li>Continuously monitor and audit data usage to maintain data integrity.</li></ol><h3>Challenges in Data Governance</h3><p>Organizations often face challenges such as data silos, lack of standardized processes, and evolving regulatory landscapes.</p><p>Tackling these challenges requires adopting best practices and leveraging advanced tools and technologies to streamline data governance efforts.</p><h3>Conclusion</h3><p>Effective data governance is essential for the success of AI projects. By establishing robust governance frameworks, organizations can ensure that their AI initiatives are compliant, efficient, and deliver maximum value.</p>\";s:6:\"format\";s:9:\"full_html\";}}s:10:\"field_type\";a:1:{s:9:\"x-default\";s:4:\"text\";}s:15:\"field_video_url\";a:1:{s:9:\"x-default\";s:127:\"https://www.youtube.com/results?search_query=AI+data+governance%2C+data+management+in+AI%2C+AI+compliance%2C+data+privacy+in+AI\";}s:16:\"field_video_file\";a:1:{s:9:\"x-default\";a:3:{s:9:\"target_id\";N;s:7:\"display\";N;s:11:\"description\";N;}}s:21:\"field_zoom_meeting_id\";a:1:{s:9:\"x-default\";N;}s:19:\"field_zoom_schedule\";a:1:{s:9:\"x-default\";N;}s:19:\"field_scorm_package\";a:1:{s:9:\"x-default\";a:3:{s:9:\"target_id\";N;s:7:\"display\";N;s:11:\"description\";N;}}s:14:\"field_duration\";a:1:{s:9:\"x-default\";s:1:\"0\";}s:18:\"field_free_preview\";a:1:{s:9:\"x-default\";s:1:\"0\";}s:15:\"field_drip_days\";a:1:{s:9:\"x-default\";s:1:\"0\";}s:6:\"weight\";a:1:{s:9:\"x-default\";s:1:\"0\";}s:6:\"status\";a:1:{s:9:\"x-default\";s:1:\"1\";}s:7:\"created\";a:1:{s:9:\"x-default\";s:10:\"1774442931\";}s:7:\"changed\";a:1:{s:9:\"x-default\";s:10:\"1774519648\";}s:16:\"default_langcode\";a:1:{s:9:\"x-default\";s:1:\"1\";}s:10:\"field_quiz\";a:1:{s:9:\"x-default\";N;}s:21:\"field_pptx_attachment\";a:1:{s:9:\"x-default\";a:3:{s:9:\"target_id\";N;s:7:\"display\";N;s:11:\"description\";N;}}s:14:\"field_comments\";a:1:{s:9:\"x-default\";a:1:{i:0;a:6:{s:6:\"status\";s:1:\"2\";s:3:\"cid\";s:1:\"0\";s:22:\"last_comment_timestamp\";s:10:\"1774442931\";s:17:\"last_comment_name\";N