('values:lms_lesson:524','O:31:\"Drupal\\lms_lesson\\Entity\\Lesson\":30:{s:15:\"\0*\0entityTypeId\";s:10:\"lms_lesson\";s:15:\"\0*\0enforceIsNew\";N;s:12:\"\0*\0typedData\";N;s:17:\"\0*\0originalEntity\";N;s:16:\"\0*\0cacheContexts\";a:0:{}s:12:\"\0*\0cacheTags\";a:0:{}s:14:\"\0*\0cacheMaxAge\";i:-1;s:14:\"\0*\0_serviceIds\";a:0:{}s:18:\"\0*\0_entityStorages\";a:0:{}s:9:\"\0*\0values\";a:23:{s:2:\"id\";a:1:{s:9:\"x-default\";s:3:\"524\";}s:4:\"uuid\";a:1:{s:9:\"x-default\";s:36:\"91c85b2e-0cdd-4e4e-ab17-fcea6694d3ec\";}s:8:\"langcode\";a:1:{s:9:\"x-default\";s:2:\"en\";}s:4:\"name\";a:1:{s:9:\"x-default\";s:41:\"Model Governance and Lifecycle Management\";}s:13:\"field_content\";a:1:{s:9:\"x-default\";a:2:{s:5:\"value\";s:2061:\"<h2>Introduction to Model Governance</h2><p>Model governance is crucial for ensuring that AI models are reliable, ethical, and aligned with business objectives. It involves establishing guidelines and protocols to manage the entire lifecycle of AI models effectively.</p><h3>Why Model Governance Matters</h3><p>Effective model governance ensures compliance with regulations and reduces risks associated with AI deployments. It helps maintain transparency and accountability in AI operations.</p><ul><li>Ensures compliance with legal and ethical standards.</li><li>Facilitates continuous monitoring and improvement.</li><li>Provides a framework for risk management.</li></ul><h3>AI Model Lifecycle Management</h3><p>The lifecycle of an AI model includes stages such as development, testing, deployment, monitoring, and decommissioning. Each stage requires specific governance processes to ensure model robustness and ethical use.</p><p><strong>Development:</strong> Involves data collection, model building, and validation.</p><p><strong>Testing:</strong> Ensures the model meets performance benchmarks and ethical guidelines.</p><p><strong>Deployment:</strong> Involves integrating the model into business processes.</p><p><strong>Monitoring:</strong> Continuous observation to ensure model performance and detect biases.</p><p><strong>Decommissioning:</strong> Safely retiring models that are obsolete or outperformed by newer versions.</p><h3>Best Practices for Model Governance</h3><ol><li>Establish clear governance policies and frameworks.</li><li>Implement robust monitoring and auditing systems.</li><li>Ensure stakeholder involvement throughout the model lifecycle.</li><li>Regularly update governance frameworks to adapt to new challenges and technologies.</li></ol><h3>Conclusion</h3><p>Model governance and lifecycle management are integral to the successful and sustainable deployment of AI solutions. By implementing robust governance frameworks, organizations can ensure their AI models are ethical, compliant, and aligned with business goals.</p>\";s:6:\"format\";s:9:\"full_html\";}}s:10:\"field_type\";a:1:{s:9:\"x-default\";s:4:\"text\";}s:15:\"field_video_url\";a:1:{s:9:\"x-default\";s:85:\"https://www.youtube.com/results?search_query=AI+model+governance+lifecycle+management\";}s:16:\"field_video_file\";a:1:{s:9:\"x-default\";a:3:{s:9:\"target_id\";N;s:7:\"display\";N;s:11:\"description\";N;}}s:21:\"field_zoom_meeting_id\";a:1:{s:9:\"x-default\";N;}s:19:\"field_zoom_schedule\";a:1:{s:9:\"x-default\";N;}s:19:\"field_scorm_package\";a:1:{s:9:\"x-default\";a:3:{s:9:\"target_id\";N;s:7:\"display\";N;s:11:\"description\";N;}}s:14:\"field_duration\";a:1:{s:9:\"x-default\";s:1:\"0\";}s:18:\"field_free_preview\";a:1:{s:9:\"x-default\";s:1:\"0\";}s:15:\"field_drip_days\";a:1:{s:9:\"x-default\";s:1:\"0\";}s:6:\"weight\";a:1:{s:9:\"x-default\";s:1:\"0\";}s:6:\"status\";a:1:{s:9:\"x-default\";s:1:\"1\";}s:7:\"created\";a:1:{s:9:\"x-default\";s:10:\"1774442931\";}s:7:\"changed\";a:1:{s:9:\"x-default\";s:10:\"1774519648\";}s:16:\"default_langcode\";a:1:{s:9:\"x-default\";s:1:\"1\";}s:10:\"field_quiz\";a:1:{s:9:\"x-default\";N;}s:21:\"field_pptx_attachment\";a:1:{s:9:\"x-default\";a:3:{s:9:\"target_id\";N;s:7:\"display\";N;s:11:\"desc