('values:lms_lesson:535','O:31:\"Drupal\\lms_lesson\\Entity\\Lesson\":30:{s:15:\"\0*\0entityTypeId\";s:10:\"lms_lesson\";s:15:\"\0*\0enforceIsNew\";N;s:12:\"\0*\0typedData\";N;s:17:\"\0*\0originalEntity\";N;s:16:\"\0*\0cacheContexts\";a:0:{}s:12:\"\0*\0cacheTags\";a:0:{}s:14:\"\0*\0cacheMaxAge\";i:-1;s:14:\"\0*\0_serviceIds\";a:0:{}s:18:\"\0*\0_entityStorages\";a:0:{}s:9:\"\0*\0values\";a:23:{s:2:\"id\";a:1:{s:9:\"x-default\";s:3:\"535\";}s:4:\"uuid\";a:1:{s:9:\"x-default\";s:36:\"1fbe3b3d-90f5-45f1-8684-7514b11da930\";}s:8:\"langcode\";a:1:{s:9:\"x-default\";s:2:\"en\";}s:4:\"name\";a:1:{s:9:\"x-default\";s:34:\"Image and Video Generation with AI\";}s:13:\"field_content\";a:1:{s:9:\"x-default\";a:2:{s:5:\"value\";s:1207:\"<h2>Introduction to Image and Video Generation</h2><p>Generative AI technologies have revolutionized the way we create and interact with visual content. By leveraging advanced algorithms, AI can produce realistic images and videos that mimic human creativity.</p><h3>How AI Generates Images</h3><p>AI models like GANs (Generative Adversarial Networks) are used to create images from scratch. These models consist of two networks: a generator and a discriminator, working together to refine and produce high-quality visuals.</p><h3>Video Generation with AI</h3><p>AI can also be used to generate videos, creating animations and short clips. By analyzing sequences of frames, AI models can predict and generate subsequent frames, resulting in fluid motion and dynamic content.</p><h3>Applications in Business</h3><ul><li>Marketing and Advertising: AI-generated visuals enhance campaigns.</li><li>Entertainment: Creating new content for films and games.</li><li>Design: Assisting in the creation of prototypes and concepts.</li></ul><h3>Challenges and Considerations</h3><p>While AI has immense potential, ethical considerations must be addressed, particularly concerning authenticity and copyright issues.</p>\";s:6:\"format\";s:9:\"full_html\";}}s:10:\"field_type\";a: