('values:lms_lesson:536','O:31:\"Drupal\\lms_lesson\\Entity\\Lesson\":30:{s:15:\"\0*\0entityTypeId\";s:10:\"lms_lesson\";s:15:\"\0*\0enforceIsNew\";N;s:12:\"\0*\0typedData\";N;s:17:\"\0*\0originalEntity\";N;s:16:\"\0*\0cacheContexts\";a:0:{}s:12:\"\0*\0cacheTags\";a:0:{}s:14:\"\0*\0cacheMaxAge\";i:-1;s:14:\"\0*\0_serviceIds\";a:0:{}s:18:\"\0*\0_entityStorages\";a:0:{}s:9:\"\0*\0values\";a:23:{s:2:\"id\";a:1:{s:9:\"x-default\";s:3:\"536\";}s:4:\"uuid\";a:1:{s:9:\"x-default\";s:36:\"84aadf11-3d8f-4f26-91c8-ad2201e5caf1\";}s:8:\"langcode\";a:1:{s:9:\"x-default\";s:2:\"en\";}s:4:\"name\";a:1:{s:9:\"x-default\";s:43:\"Code Generation and AI-assisted Development\";}s:13:\"field_content\";a:1:{s:9:\"x-default\";a:2:{s:5:\"value\";s:1036:\"<h1>Code Generation and AI-assisted Development</h1><p>In the realm of software engineering, AI has emerged as a revolutionary tool in automating code generation and assisting developers. This lesson explores the various ways AI can augment the software development process.</p><h2>The Role of AI in Code Generation</h2><p>AI can generate boilerplate code, identify bugs, and suggest improvements, allowing developers to focus on the creative aspects of software development.</p><h2>Tools and Technologies</h2><p>There are several AI-powered tools like GitHub Copilot and OpenAI Codex that offer real-time code suggestions and auto-completion features.</p><h2>Benefits of AI-assisted Development</h2><ul><li>Increased efficiency and speed in coding.</li><li>Reduction in human error.</li><li>Enhanced collaboration between team members.</li></ul><h2>Challenges and Considerations</h2><p>While AI can significantly aid development, there are challenges like understanding AI limitations and ensuring ethical use of AI-generated code.</p>\";s:6:\"format\";s:9:\"full_html\";}}s:10:\"field_type\";a:1:{s:9:\"x-default\";s:4:\"text\";}s:15:\"field_video_url\";a:1:{s:9:\"x-default\";s:96:\"https://www.youtube.com/results?search_query=AI+code+generation%2C+AI-as