('values:lms_lesson:544','O:31:\"Drupal\\lms_lesson\\Entity\\Lesson\":30:{s:15:\"\0*\0entityTypeId\";s:10:\"lms_lesson\";s:15:\"\0*\0enforceIsNew\";N;s:12:\"\0*\0typedData\";N;s:17:\"\0*\0originalEntity\";N;s:16:\"\0*\0cacheContexts\";a:0:{}s:12:\"\0*\0cacheTags\";a:0:{}s:14:\"\0*\0cacheMaxAge\";i:-1;s:14:\"\0*\0_serviceIds\";a:0:{}s:18:\"\0*\0_entityStorages\";a:0:{}s:9:\"\0*\0values\";a:23:{s:2:\"id\";a:1:{s:9:\"x-default\";s:3:\"544\";}s:4:\"uuid\";a:1:{s:9:\"x-default\";s:36:\"6fb596f7-e9df-4643-ac28-7c757d1ed9b7\";}s:8:\"langcode\";a:1:{s:9:\"x-default\";s:2:\"en\";}s:4:\"name\";a:1:{s:9:\"x-default\";s:27:\"Edge AI and IoT Integration\";}s:13:\"field_content\";a:1:{s:9:\"x-default\";a:2:{s:5:\"value\";s:1766:\"<h1>Edge AI and IoT Integration</h1><p>Edge AI refers to the deployment of artificial intelligence algorithms on edge devices, such as sensors and IoT devices, rather than centralized cloud servers. This approach offers several advantages, including reduced latency, enhanced privacy, and improved efficiency.</p><p>By integrating AI with the Internet of Things (IoT), businesses can create smarter systems that process data locally. This integration allows for real-time decision-making and significantly reduces the bandwidth required to transmit data to the cloud.</p><ul><li><strong>Reduced Latency:</strong> Edge AI processes data closer to the source, minimizing the time taken to derive insights.</li><li><strong>Enhanced Privacy:</strong> By processing data locally, sensitive information is less likely to be exposed to security breaches.</li><li><strong>Scalability:</strong> Edge AI enables the deployment of AI solutions at scale without the need for massive cloud infrastructure.</li></ul><p>Industries like manufacturing, healthcare, and smart cities are increasingly leveraging Edge AI to optimize operations and enhance user experiences. For instance, in manufacturing, predictive maintenance powered by Edge AI can prevent equipment failures by analyzing data in real-time.</p><h2>Challenges and Considerations</h2><p>While Edge AI offers numerous benefits, it also presents challenges such as device compatibility, energy consumption, and the need for continuous updates to AI models. Businesses must carefully evaluate these factors when implementing Edge AI solutions.</p><p>In conclusion, Edge AI and IoT integration is transforming industries by providing smart, efficient, and real-time solutions that drive innovation and business growth.</p>\";s:6:\"format\";s:9:\"full_html\";}}s:10:\"field_type\";a:1:{s:9:\"x-default\";s:4:\"text\";}s:15:\"field_video_url\";a:1:{s:9:\"x-default\";s:109:\"https://www.youtube.com/results?search_query=Edge+AI+IoT+integration%2C+real-time+AI+IoT%2C+Edge+computing+AI\";}s:16:\"field_video_file\";a:1:{s:9:\"x-default\";a:3:{s:9:\"target_id\";N;s:7:\"display\";N;s:11:\"description\";N;}}s:21:\"field_zoom_meeting_id\";a:1:{s:9:\"x-default\";N;}s:19:\"field_zoom_schedule\";a:1:{s:9:\"x-default\";N;}s:19:\"field_scorm_package\";a:1:{s:9:\"x-default\";a:3:{s:9:\"target_id\";N;s:7:\"display\";N;s:11:\"description\";N;}}s:14:\"field_duration\";a:1:{s:9:\"x-default\";s:1:\"0\";}s:18:\"field_free_preview\";a:1:{s:9:\"x-default\";s:1:\"0\";}s:15:\"field_drip_days\";a:1:{s:9:\"x-default\";s:1:\"0\";}s:6:\"weight\";a:1:{s:9:\"x-default\";s:1:\"0\";}s:6:\"status\";a:1:{s:9:\"x-default\";s:1:\"1\";}s:7:\"created\";a:1:{s:9:\"x-default\";s:10:\"1774442931\";}s:7:\"changed\";a:1:{s:9:\"x-default\";s:10:\"1774519648\";}s:16:\"default_langcode\";a:1:{s:9:\"x-default\";s:1:\"1\";}s:10:\"field_quiz\";a:1:{s:9:\"x-default\";N;}s:21:\"field_pptx_attachment\";a:1:{s:9:\"x-default\";a:3:{s:9:\"target_id\";N;s:7:\"display\";N;s:11:\"description\";N;}}s:14:\"field_comments\";a:1:{s:9:\"x-default\";a:1:{i:0;a:6:{s:6:\"status\";s:1:\"2\";s:3:\"cid\";s:1:\"0\";s:22:\"last_comment_timestamp\";s:10:\"1774442931\";s:17:\"last_comment_name\";N;s:16:\"last_comment_uid\";s:1:\"0\";s:13:\"comment_count\";s:1:\"0\";}}}s:15:\"fi