('values:lms_lesson:559','O:31:\"Drupal\\lms_lesson\\Entity\\Lesson\":30:{s:15:\"\0*\0entityTypeId\";s:10:\"lms_lesson\";s:15:\"\0*\0enforceIsNew\";N;s:12:\"\0*\0typedData\";N;s:17:\"\0*\0originalEntity\";N;s:16:\"\0*\0cacheContexts\";a:0:{}s:12:\"\0*\0cacheTags\";a:0:{}s:14:\"\0*\0cacheMaxAge\";i:-1;s:14:\"\0*\0_serviceIds\";a:0:{}s:18:\"\0*\0_entityStorages\";a:0:{}s:9:\"\0*\0values\";a:23:{s:2:\"id\";a:1:{s:9:\"x-default\";s:3:\"559\";}s:4:\"uuid\";a:1:{s:9:\"x-default\";s:36:\"ccd7b772-8465-477a-8df5-82b2ce269d90\";}s:8:\"langcode\";a:1:{s:9:\"x-default\";s:2:\"en\";}s:4:\"name\";a:1:{s:9:\"x-default\";s:33:\"Automated Decision Making with AI\";}s:13:\"field_content\";a:1:{s:9:\"x-default\";a:2:{s:5:\"value\";s:1545:\"<h2>Introduction to Automated Decision Making</h2><p>Automated decision making with AI involves using artificial intelligence technologies to make decisions without human intervention. These systems can analyze data, learn from it, and make informed decisions at a scale and speed that humans cannot match.</p><h2>Benefits of Automated Decision Making</h2><p>Implementing AI in decision-making processes can lead to increased efficiency, reduced human error, and cost savings. It can also enhance the ability to process large volumes of data quickly.</p><h2>Challenges in Automated Decision Making</h2><p>Despite its advantages, automated decision making presents challenges such as ethical concerns, transparency, and accountability. Ensuring that AI systems are fair and unbiased is critical.</p><h3>Applications Across Industries</h3><p>AI-driven decisions are used in various sectors, including finance, healthcare, and supply chain management. In finance, AI can automate trading decisions; in healthcare, it can assist in diagnostic processes.</p><h2>Developing AI Decision Systems</h2><ul><li>Define the decision-making process and identify areas for automation.</li><li>Collect and preprocess data for training AI models.</li><li>Develop, test, and deploy AI algorithms.</li><li>Monitor and evaluate AI decisions for accuracy and bias.</li></ul><h2>Conclusion</h2><p>The future of automated decision making with AI is promising but requires careful consideration of ethical and operational implications to ensure beneficial outcomes.</p>\";s:6:\"format\";s:9:\"full_html\";}}s:10:\"field_type\";a:1:{s:9:\"x-default\";s:4:\"text\";}s:15:\"field_video_url\";a:1:{s:9:\"x-default\";s:135:\"https://www.youtube.com/results?search_query=Automated+decision+making+with+AI%2C+AI+in+business+decision+making%2C+AI+decision+systems\";}s:16:\"field_video_file\";a:1:{s:9:\"x-default\";a:3:{s:9:\"target_id\";N;s:7:\"display\";N;s:11:\"description\";N;}}s:21:\"field_zoom_meeting_id\";a:1:{s:9:\"x-default\";N;}s:19:\"field_zoom_schedule\";a:1:{s:9:\"x-default\";N;}s:19:\"field_scorm_package\";a:1:{s:9:\"x-default\";a:3:{s:9:\"target_id\";N;s:7:\"display\";N;s:11:\"description\";N;}}s:14:\"field_duration\";a:1:{s:9:\"x-default\";s:1:\"0\";}s:18:\"field_free_preview\";a:1:{s:9:\"x-default\";s:1:\"0\";}s:15:\"field_drip_days\";a:1:{s:9:\"x-default\";s:1:\"0\";}s:6:\"weight\";a:1:{s:9:\"x-default\";s:1:\"0\";}s:6:\"status\";a:1:{s:9:\"x-default\";s:1:\"1\";}s:7:\"created\";a:1:{s:9:\"x-default\";s:10:\"1774442931\";}s:7:\"changed\";a:1:{s:9:\"x-default\";s:10:\"1774519648\";}s:16:\"default_langcode\";a:1:{s:9:\"x-default\";s:1:\"1\";}s:10:\"field_quiz\";a:1:{s:9:\"x-default\";N;}s:21:\"field_pptx_attachment\";a:1:{s:9:\"x-default\";a:3:{s:9:\"target_id\";N;s:7:\"display\";N;s:11:\"description\";N;}}s:14:\"field_comments\";a:1:{s:9:\"x-default\";a:1:{i:0;a:6:{s:6:\"status\";s:1:\"2\";s:3:\"cid\";s:1:\"0\";s:22:\"last_comment_timestamp\";s:10:\"1774442931\";s:17:\"last_comment_name\";N;s:16:\"last_comment_uid\";s:1:\"0\";s:13:\"comment_count\";s:1:\"0\";}}}s:15:\"field_h5p_embed\";a:1:{s:9:\"x-default\";N;}}s:9:\"\0*\0fields\";a:0:{}s:19:\"\0*\0fieldDefinitions\";N;s:12:\"\0*\0languages\";N;s:14:\"\0*\0langcodeKey\";s:8:\"langcode\";s:21:\"\0*\0defaul