('values:lms_lesson:560','O:31:\"Drupal\\lms_lesson\\Entity\\Lesson\":30:{s:15:\"\0*\0entityTypeId\";s:10:\"lms_lesson\";s:15:\"\0*\0enforceIsNew\";N;s:12:\"\0*\0typedData\";N;s:17:\"\0*\0originalEntity\";N;s:16:\"\0*\0cacheContexts\";a:0:{}s:12:\"\0*\0cacheTags\";a:0:{}s:14:\"\0*\0cacheMaxAge\";i:-1;s:14:\"\0*\0_serviceIds\";a:0:{}s:18:\"\0*\0_entityStorages\";a:0:{}s:9:\"\0*\0values\";a:23:{s:2:\"id\";a:1:{s:9:\"x-default\";s:3:\"560\";}s:4:\"uuid\";a:1:{s:9:\"x-default\";s:36:\"dbdf326e-a522-486a-aac4-ad927113228c\";}s:8:\"langcode\";a:1:{s:9:\"x-default\";s:2:\"en\";}s:4:\"name\";a:1:{s:9:\"x-default\";s:53:\"Building Intelligent Automation Centers of Excellence\";}s:13:\"field_content\";a:1:{s:9:\"x-default\";a:2:{s:5:\"value\";s:1727:\"<h2>Introduction to Automation Centers of Excellence</h2><p>Establishing an Automation Center of Excellence (CoE) is crucial for organizations seeking to harness the full potential of intelligent automation. It serves as a strategic function that drives the adoption and implementation of automation technologies across the business.</p><h3>Key Components of a CoE</h3><p>A successful CoE comprises several components, including leadership support, skilled personnel, and a robust governance framework. These elements work together to ensure the CoE operates efficiently and aligns with organizational goals.</p><p>Additionally, the CoE should focus on developing best practices, standardizing processes, and fostering a culture of continuous improvement. This approach helps in maximizing the benefits of automation initiatives.</p><h3>Steps to Establish a CoE</h3><ol><li><strong>Define Objectives:</strong> Clearly outline the goals and objectives of the CoE to ensure alignment with the broader organizational strategy.</li><li><strong>Assemble a Team:</strong> Gather a team of experts from various departments to bring diverse perspectives and expertise.</li><li><strong>Develop a Framework:</strong> Create a structured framework that outlines the processes, tools, and technologies to be used within the CoE.</li><li><strong>Measure Success:</strong> Implement metrics to evaluate the performance and impact of the CoE on business operations.</li></ol><h2>Conclusion</h2><p>By establishing an intelligent automation CoE, businesses can streamline operations, enhance efficiency, and drive innovation. It acts as a centralized hub for automation efforts, ensuring consistency and scalability across the organization.</p>\";s:6:\"format\";s:9:\"full_html\";}}s:10:\"field_type\";a:1:{s:9:\"x-default\";s:4:\"text\";}s:15:\"field_video_url\";a:1:{s:9:\"x-default\";s:139:\"https://www.youtube.com/results?search_query=intelligent+automation+centers+of+excellence%2C+building+automation+CoE%2C+automation+strategy\";}s:16:\"field_video_file\";a:1:{s:9:\"x-default\";a:3:{s:9:\"target_id\";N;s:7:\"display\";N;s:11:\"description\";N;}}s:21:\"field_zoom_meeting_id\";a:1:{s:9:\"x-default\";N;}s:19:\"field_zoom_schedule\";a:1:{s:9:\"x-default\";N;}s:19:\"field_scorm_package\";a:1:{s:9:\"x-default\";a:3:{s:9:\"target_id\";N;s:7:\"display\";N;s:11:\"description\";N;}}s:14:\"field_duration\";a:1:{s:9:\"x-default\";s:1:\"0\";}s:18:\"field_free_preview\";a:1:{s:9:\"x-default\";s:1:\"0\";}s:15:\"field_drip_days\";a:1:{s:9:\"x-default\";s:1:\"0\";}s:6:\"weight\";a:1:{s:9:\"x-default\";s:1:\"0\";}s:6:\"status\";a:1:{s:9:\"x-default\";s:1:\"1\";}s:7:\"created\";a:1:{s:9:\"x-default\";s:10:\"1774442931\";}s:7:\"changed\";a:1:{s:9:\"x-default\";s:10:\"1774519648\";}s:16:\"default_langcode\";a:1:{s:9:\"x-default\";s:1:\"1\";}s:10:\"field_quiz\";a:1:{s:9:\"x-default\";N;}s:21:\"field_pptx_attachment\";a:1:{s:9:\"x-default\";a:3:{s:9:\"target_id\";N;s:7:\"display\";N;s:11:\"description\";N;}}s:14:\"field_comments\";a:1:{s:9:\"x-default\";a:1:{i:0;a:6:{s:6:\"status\";s:1:\"2\";s:3:\"cid\";s:1:\"0\";s:22:\"last_comment_timestamp\";s:10:\"1774442931\";s:17:\"last_comment_name\";N;s:16:\"last_comment_uid\";s:1:\"0\";s:13:\"comment_count\";s:1:\