INSERT INTO `lms_article_field_data` VALUES
(5,'en','Unlock Your Coding Superpowers: Introducing AI for Developers 101','<h2>Unlock Your Coding Superpowers: Introducing AI for Developers 101</h2><p>The world of software development is evolving at an unprecedented pace. To stay ahead, developers must constantly seek new tools and techniques that amplify their productivity and creativity. What if you could significantly reduce repetitive tasks, generate code snippets with ease, and even debug more efficiently? The answer lies in the intelligent assistance of AI.</p><h2>Mastering Your AI Co-Pilots</h2><p>EverLMS is thrilled to announce our latest game-changing course: <strong>AI for Developers 101: GitHub Copilot & Cursor</strong>. This isn\'t just another introductory course; it\'s your definitive guide to mastering the two most powerful AI assistants available to developers today. Prepare to revolutionize your workflow and potentially <strong>double your coding speed!</strong></p><h3>Why GitHub Copilot and Cursor are Essential</h3><p>GitHub Copilot, powered by OpenAI, acts as your pair programmer, suggesting lines of code and entire functions in real-time. Cursor, an AI-native code editor, integrates generative AI for AI-powered chat, code generation, and debugging. Together, these tools represent a paradigm shift in how we write, refactor, and understand code. They empower you to:</p><ul><li><strong>Accelerate Development:</strong> Generate boilerplate, implement algorithms, and complete functions faster.</li><li><strong>Improve Code Quality:</strong> Benefit from AI-suggested best practices and error detection.</li><li><strong>Focus on Innovation:</strong> Spend less time on mundane tasks and more on solving complex problems.</li></ul><h2>What You\'ll Learn</h2><p>Our expert-led course dives deep into practical, hands-on applications. You\'ll learn to:</p><ul><li>Set up and configure GitHub Copilot for various IDEs.</li><li>Master effective prompting techniques for code generation and refactoring.</li><li>Leverage Cursor\'s AI chat for debugging, explanation, and code modification.</li><li>Integrate AI assistants seamlessly into your existing development workflow.</li></ul><h2>Who Should Enroll?</h2><p>This course is perfect for any developer—junior or senior—looking to embrace the future of coding. If you\'re ready to break free from repetitive coding, enhance your problem-solving capabilities, and dramatically boost your efficiency, then this course is for you.</p><h3>Enroll Today and Transform Your Coding Journey!</h3><p>Don\'t get left behind. The future of coding is here, and it\'s intelligent. Enroll in <strong>AI for Developers 101: GitHub Copilot & Cursor</strong> today and start building smarter, faster, and with more confidence. Your next breakthrough project awaits!</p>','full_html',2,NULL,NULL,'AI for Developers 101: Master Copilot & Cursor','Unlock peak coding productivity with AI for Developers 101. Master GitHub Copilot & Cursor to double your speed, enhance code quality, and innovate faster. ...',1,1774427241,1774427241,1),
(6,'en','Unlock AI\'s Full Coding Potential: Master Prompt Engineering!','<h2>Unlock AI\'s Full Coding Potential: Master Prompt Engineering!</h2><p>In today\'s fast-paced development world, Artificial Intelligence has become an indispensable co-pilot. From generating boilerplate code to debugging complex algorithms, AI tools are revolutionizing how we build. But how often do you find yourself refining prompts, trying to coax the exact piece of code you need?</p><p>The truth is, harnessing AI\'s true power isn\'t just about using it; it\'s about <em>communicating</em> with it effectively. This is where <strong>Prompt Engineering</strong> comes in—the crucial skill that transforms your interaction with AI from guesswork into precision.</p><h2>Introducing: Prompt Engineering Exclusively for Developers</h2><p>We are thrilled to announce our brand-new course, <strong>Prompt Engineering Exclusively for Developers</strong>, designed to empower you to speak AI\'s language fluently. This isn\'t just about asking questions; it\'s about the art and science of crafting prompts that elicit the precise source code you envision.</p><p>Imagine a world where your AI assistant delivers perfectly tailored functions, robust classes, or even entire application architectures on your first try. This course will show you how.</p><h3>What You\'ll Master:</h3><ul><li><strong>Precision Prompt Crafting:</strong> Learn the techniques to structure your prompts for clarity and specificity, eliminating ambiguity.</li><li><strong>Contextual Awareness:</strong> Understand how to provide the right context to guide AI towards your desired output.</li><li><strong>Iterative Refinement:</strong> Develop strategies for refining prompts to debug AI\'s responses and achieve optimal code.</li><li><strong>Code Generation Mastery:</strong> Get hands-on experience in generating exact source code snippets, complete functions, and even complex architectural patterns.</li><li><strong>Efficiency & Productivity:</strong> Drastically reduce the time spent on trial-and-error, boosting your development workflow.</li></ul><p>This course is built for every developer who wants to move beyond basic AI interactions and truly leverage large language models as powerful coding partners. Stop settling for \"good enough\" code and start demanding \"exact code.\"</p><p>Ready to transform your AI coding experience? Enroll in <strong>Prompt Engineering Exclusively for Developers</strong> today and unlock a new era of productivity and precision in your development journey!</p>','full_html',3,NULL,NULL,'Master Prompt Engineering for Developers','Unlock AI\'s full potential for coding. Learn prompt engineering to get exact source code, boost efficiency, and master AI communication. Enroll now!',1,1774427241,1774427241,1),
(7,'en','Revolutionize Your Code: Introducing Advanced AI-Powered Unit Testing!','<h2>Revolutionize Your Testing: Embrace AI-Powered Automation!</h2>\n<p>Are you a developer constantly striving for robust, bug-free code, yet find yourself bogged down by the time-consuming demands of unit testing? Do you dream of maintaining high test coverage without the manual grind? At EverLMS, we hear you!</p>\n<p>We\'re thrilled to unveil our latest course designed to transform your development workflow: <strong>Advanced Automated Unit Testing with AI</strong>. This isn\'t just another testing course; it\'s your gateway to a future where your test suite works smarter, not harder.</p>\n<h2>What Makes This Course a Game-Changer?</h2>\n<ul>\n    <li><strong>Guaranteed Coverage:</strong> Learn strategies and tools to ensure your test coverage <em>never drops below 80%</em>. Say goodbye to the anxiety of untested code!</li>\n    <li><strong>AI-Powered Test Generation:</strong> Discover how cutting-edge Artificial Intelligence can automatically write comprehensive unit test cases for your PHP and JavaScript applications. Imagine the hours saved and the peace of mind gained.</li>\n    <li><strong>Boost Efficiency:</strong> Free up valuable developer time, allowing your team to focus on innovation and feature development, rather than repetitive test writing.</li>\n    <li><strong>Enhance Reliability:</strong> Build more stable and reliable applications with a robust, AI-generated test foundation. Catch bugs earlier and deliver higher quality products.</li>\n    <li><strong>Future-Proof Your Skills:</strong> Master the tools and techniques that are shaping the future of software development and testing.</li>\n</ul>\n<p>This course is meticulously crafted for developers, QA engineers, and team leads who are ready to embrace the next generation of testing. We\'ll dive deep into practical applications, real-world scenarios, and hands-on exercises, ensuring you gain actionable skills you can implement immediately.</p>\n<p>Stop chasing coverage and start leading with confidence. Enroll in <strong>Advanced Automated Unit Testing with AI</strong> today and empower yourself with the ultimate testing superpower. Your codebase — and your sanity — will thank you!</p>\n<p>Ready to elevate your testing game? Visit the course page to learn more and secure your spot!</p>','full_html',4,NULL,NULL,'AI-Powered Unit Testing for PHP & JS | EverLMS','Unlock advanced AI-driven unit testing for PHP & JavaScript. Maintain 80%+ coverage automatically, boost efficiency, and build robust applications with EverLMS.',1,1774427241,1774427241,1),
(8,'en','Unleash Clean Code: Refactor Effortlessly with Claude 3.5 Sonnet!','<h2>Tired of Tangled Code? Meet Your AI Refactoring Partner!</h2><p>Every developer has been there: staring at a screen full of \"spaghetti code,\" wondering how to untangle the mess without introducing a dozen new bugs. The thought of refactoring often brings a sigh, imagining endless hours of painstaking manual work. But what if there was a smarter, faster, and truly effortless way to transform your codebase into a pristine, maintainable masterpiece?</p><p>At EverLMS, we\'re thrilled to announce a game-changing new course designed to revolutionize your approach to code quality: <strong>Effortless Code Refactoring with Claude 3.5 Sonnet</strong>.</p><h2>Unlock the Power of AI-Driven Clean Code</h2><p>This isn\'t just another course on best practices; it\'s a deep dive into leveraging the cutting-edge capabilities of Claude 3.5 Sonnet to perform sophisticated code refactoring with surprising ease. Imagine taking a complex, tightly coupled module and, with just a few well-crafted prompt commands, watching it evolve into clean, modular, and SOLID-compliant code right before your eyes.</p><p>Our expert instructors will guide you through practical, real-world scenarios, demonstrating how to:</p><ul>    <li>Identify code smells and anti-patterns quickly.</li>    <li>Craft precise prompts that direct Claude 3.5 Sonnet to refactor specific sections of your code.</li>    <li>Apply SOLID principles (Single Responsibility, Open/Closed, Liskov Substitution, Interface Segregation, Dependency Inversion) to legacy and new codebases.</li>    <li>Automate the process of breaking down monolithic functions into smaller, more manageable units.</li>    <li>Enhance code readability, maintainability, and scalability, significantly reducing technical debt.</li></ul><h2>Why Claude 3.5 Sonnet?</h2><p>Claude 3.5 Sonnet stands out for its advanced reasoning capabilities and its ability to understand complex code structures and developer intent. This course harnesses that power, turning it into your personal pair-programming assistant for refactoring. You\'ll learn to prompt it effectively to not just rewrite code, but to <em>understand</em> and <em>improve</em> its underlying architecture.</p><h2>Transform Your Development Workflow</h2><p>Whether you\'re a seasoned developer battling legacy systems or a newer coder eager to build robust, future-proof applications, this course will equip you with invaluable skills. Stop dreading refactoring and start embracing it as an efficient, even enjoyable, part of your development cycle. Spend less time untangling and more time innovating!</p><p>Ready to turn \'spaghetti\' code into elegant, maintainable solutions with the power of AI? Enroll in <strong>Effortless Code Refactoring with Claude 3.5 Sonnet</strong> today and elevate your coding game!</p>','full_html',5,NULL,NULL,'Effortless Code Refactoring with Claude 3.5 Sonnet','Transform \'spaghetti\' code into clean, SOLID-compliant software effortlessly. Learn AI-powered refactoring with Claude 3.5 Sonnet and prompt commands. Boost...',1,1774427241,1774427241,1),
(9,'en','Unlock the Future of Design: AI-Assisted System Architecture Course Launch!','<h2>Transform Your System Design with AI!</h2><p>The world of technology is constantly evolving, and with it, the demands on system architects are growing more complex. Designing robust, scalable, and efficient systems requires not just technical prowess, but also foresight, creativity, and the ability to navigate intricate decisions. What if you could supercharge this process, making it more intuitive, faster, and even more innovative?</p><p>EverLMS is thrilled to announce our groundbreaking new course: <strong>System Architecture Design Assisted by AI</strong>. This isn\'t just another course; it\'s your gateway to mastering the next frontier in system design, leveraging the incredible power of Artificial Intelligence.</p><h2>Why AI in System Architecture?</h2><p>Traditional system design can be a laborious process, from initial brainstorming to sketching complex diagrams and making critical architectural choices. AI is set to revolutionize these challenges:</p><ul><li><strong>Intelligent Brainstorming:</strong> Overcome creative blocks and explore innovative solutions with AI-driven ideation that expands your design horizons.</li><li><strong>Automated Diagramming:</strong> Say goodbye to tedious manual drawing. Learn how AI can help you generate comprehensive architectural diagrams quickly and accurately, translating complex ideas into clear visuals.</li><li><strong>Smarter Decision-Making:</strong> Leverage AI to analyze potential design choices, evaluate trade-offs, and gain insights that lead to more informed and resilient system architectures.</li></ul><h2>What You\'ll Learn:</h2><p>In this comprehensive course, you will dive deep into practical applications, mastering tools and techniques to:</p><ul><li>Utilize AI prompts to generate initial design concepts and requirements.</li><li>Employ AI-powered diagramming tools to visualize system components and interactions.</li><li>Analyze architectural patterns and anti-patterns with AI assistance.</li><li>Make data-driven decisions on scalability, security, and performance using AI insights.</li><li>Develop a future-proof skillset that positions you at the forefront of technological innovation.</li></ul><h2>Who Should Enroll?</h2><p>Whether you\'re an aspiring system architect, a seasoned developer looking to upgrade your skills, or a tech leader aiming to integrate cutting-edge tools into your workflow, this course is designed for you. It\'s an essential step towards becoming a more efficient, innovative, and indispensable system designer.</p><h2>Join the AI Revolution in Design!</h2><p>Don\'t just keep up with the future—design it! Enroll in <strong>System Architecture Design Assisted by AI</strong> today and transform the way you build systems. The future of design is here, and it\'s powered by AI. Are you ready to lead the charge?</p><p><em>Enroll now and shape the future of technology with EverLMS!</em></p>','full_html',1,NULL,NULL,'Master AI-Powered System Architecture Design','Explore EverLMS\'s new course: System Architecture Design Assisted by AI. Learn to use AI for brainstorming, drawing diagrams, and making major system design...',1,1774427241,1774427241,1);
