INSERT INTO `lms_faq_field_data` VALUES
(1,'en','What prior knowledge is required for this course?','You should have a basic understanding of programming concepts and at least one programming language (like JavaScript, Python, or Java). No prior AI experience is needed.','full_html','course',21,NULL,0,1),
(2,'en','Do I need paid subscriptions for Copilot or Cursor?','The course covers both free and paid tiers. While you can follow along with free versions or trials, having the paid versions will allow you to fully utilize all the features demonstrated.','full_html','course',21,NULL,1,1),
(3,'en','Will this course teach me how to build AI models?','No, this course focuses on using AI tools (Copilot, Cursor) to assist in your everyday software development, not on training or building the AI models themselves.','full_html','course',21,NULL,2,1),
(4,'en','Which AI models are covered in this course?','We primarily focus on GPT-4, Claude 3.5 Sonnet, and Gemini Pro, with specific techniques tailored to get the best code outputs from each.','full_html','course',22,NULL,0,1),
(5,'en','Are the prompts language-specific?','No, the principles of prompt engineering taught here are language-agnostic. However, we do provide specific examples in popular languages like Python, JS, and C++.','full_html','course',22,NULL,1,1),
(6,'en','How is this different from a general prompt engineering course?','This course is strictly tailored for developers. We focus on prompts for code generation, debugging, refactoring, and understanding complex architectures, rather than creative writing or marketing.','full_html','course',22,NULL,2,1),
(7,'en','What testing frameworks are used in the examples?','We use Jest for JavaScript/TypeScript examples and PyTest for Python. The AI strategies, however, can be applied to any testing framework (JUnit, PHPUnit, etc.).','full_html','course',23,NULL,0,1),
(8,'en','Can AI really write reliable tests?','AI is excellent at generating boilerplate and edge cases, but human review is crucial. This course teaches you how to guide the AI to generate high-quality, reliable tests and how to review them effectively.','full_html','course',23,NULL,1,1),
(9,'en','Does this cover integration or end-to-end testing?','The primary focus is on unit testing, as AI currently performs best at that scope. We do touch briefly on generating setup/teardown code for integration tests.','full_html','course',23,NULL,2,1),
(10,'en','Why focus specifically on Claude 3.5 Sonnet?','Claude 3.5 Sonnet has shown exceptional capabilities in understanding large contexts and performing complex code refactoring across multiple files with high accuracy.','full_html','course',24,NULL,0,1),
(11,'en','Will I learn about design patterns?','Yes, a significant part of the course involves instructing Claude to refactor legacy code into specific, modern design patterns (like Strategy, Observer, or Factory).','full_html','course',24,NULL,1,1),
(12,'en','How do I ensure the refactored code doesn\'t break?','We strongly emphasize a test-driven approach. You will learn how to use AI to generate tests *before* refactoring, ensuring the new code maintains the original behavior.','full_html','course',24,NULL,2,1),
(13,'en','Is this a beginner course?','No, this is an advanced course. You should have a solid understanding of backend development, databases, and general software engineering principles.','full_html','course',25,NULL,0,1),
(14,'en','Can AI draw architecture diagrams?','Yes! We teach you how to use AI to generate Mermaid.js code, PlantUML, and interact with tools like Eraser.io to quickly visualize complex architectures.','full_html','course',25,NULL,1,1),
(15,'en','Does the course cover cloud platforms (AWS, GCP, Azure)?','Yes, we discuss how to use AI to evaluate different cloud services and design cloud-native, scalable architectures, remaining platform-neutral.','full_html','course',25,NULL,2,1),
(16,'en','Who is this course designed for?','<p>It is tailored for business leaders, executives, and managers who want to understand AI without needing a programming background.</p>','full_html','course',26,NULL,0,1),
(17,'en','Do I need to know how to write code?','<p>Absolutely not. The focus is on strategic application rather than technical implementation.</p>','full_html','course',26,NULL,1,1),
(18,'en','What is the core takeaway of this course?','<p>You will gain a comprehensive overview of AI history, core concepts, and its massive impact on modern business strategy.</p>','full_html','course',26,NULL,2,1),
(19,'en','Will I receive a certificate of completion?','<p>Yes, you will receive an official EverLMS certificate upon finishing the program.</p>','full_html','course',26,NULL,3,1),
(20,'en','How can I apply this practically?','<p>You will be able to identify and evaluate initial AI integration opportunities within your own enterprise.</p>','full_html','course',26,NULL,4,1),
(21,'en','Which AI technologies are covered?','<p>We focus on Machine Learning, Deep Learning, and Natural Language Processing (NLP) from a business perspective.</p>','full_html','course',27,NULL,0,1),
(22,'en','How do these technologies impact operations?','<p>They enable extreme automation, precise forecasting, and highly personalized customer service capabilities.</p>','full_html','course',27,NULL,1,1),
(23,'en','Is Generative AI included in the syllabus?','<p>Yes, a significant portion is dedicated to the disruptive power of Generative AI tools.</p>','full_html','course',27,NULL,2,1),
(24,'en','How do I choose the right tech for my company?','<p>We provide comprehensive evaluation frameworks to assess cost, ROI, and technical alignment.</p>','full_html','course',27,NULL,3,1),
(25,'en','Are there any software prerequisites?','<p>No special software is required. The curriculum focuses on business theory and strategic execution.</p>','full_html','course',27,NULL,4,1),
(26,'en','Why is Ethical AI so important?','<p>Unregulated AI causes massive bias, security risks, and legal liabilities. Ethical management protects brand reputation.</p>','full_html','course',28,NULL,0,1),
(27,'en','How does this course address AI bias?','<p>We cover methods to identify bias in training datasets and principles for designing transparent AI systems.</p>','full_html','course',28,NULL,1,1),
(28,'en','What legal frameworks are explored?','<p>We provide overviews of GDPR and other emerging global data protection standards relevant to AI.</p>','full_html','course',28,NULL,2,1),
(29,'en','Does AI completely replace human roles?','<p>We focus heavily on human-centric AI design, emphasizing augmentation over absolute replacement.</p>','full_html','course',28,NULL,3,1),
(30,'en','Can I build an internal company policy?','<p>Yes, the course includes templates and guidelines for drafting your own internal AI code of conduct.</p>','full_html','course',28,NULL,4,1),
(31,'en','Where do I begin with an AI strategy?','<p>Always start with business goals. We guide you through an audit of your current digital maturity.</p>','full_html','course',29,NULL,0,1),
(32,'en','What are the fundamental AI strategies?','<p>Strategies range from simple internal automation to developing entirely new proprietary AI products.</p>','full_html','course',29,NULL,1,1),
(33,'en','How is project ROI calculated?','<p>We provide financial modeling tools specifically tuned for measuring returns on intelligent software investments.</p>','full_html','course',29,NULL,2,1),
(34,'en','Are real-world case studies provided?','<p>Yes, we dissect the successful AI transformation journeys of both large enterprises and agile SMEs.</p>','full_html','course',29,NULL,3,1),
(35,'en','How do I pitch AI investments to the board?','<p>The capstone project guides you in creating a risk-managed Pitch Deck to secure stakeholder buy-in.</p>','full_html','course',29,NULL,4,1),
(36,'en','Does this cover AI digital marketing?','<p>Yes, the syllabus explores modern, AI-powered marketing automation platforms and campaign management.</p>','full_html','course',30,NULL,0,1),
(37,'en','How can AI improve customer experience?','<p>Through hyper-personalization at scale and intelligent 24/7 conversational agents (chatbots).</p>','full_html','course',30,NULL,1,1),
(38,'en','Is this applicable to small businesses?','<p>Absolutely. The tools discussed include highly affordable SaaS solutions perfectly suited for small teams.</p>','full_html','course',30,NULL,2,1),
(39,'en','Is AI-driven SEO part of the curriculum?','<p>Yes, an entire module is dedicated to automated content generation and AI-enhanced search optimization.</p>','full_html','course',30,NULL,3,1),
(40,'en','What are the prerequisites for this course?','<p>A basic understanding of your companys current marketing and customer service workflows is sufficient.</p>','full_html','course',30,NULL,4,1),
(41,'en','How does AI help operations?','<p>It drastically reduces human error, cuts processing time by up to 70%, and enables smart routing.</p>','full_html','course',31,NULL,0,1),
(42,'en','What is the difference between RPA and AI?','<p>RPA automates rigid rules, while AI provides cognitive understanding. We teach how to merge both.</p>','full_html','course',31,NULL,1,1),
(43,'en','Is this useful for manufacturing?','<p>Highly useful. We cover AI applications in supply chain management, inventory forecasting, and predictive maintenance.</p>','full_html','course',31,NULL,2,1),
(44,'en','Are automation systems expensive to deploy?','<p>Not necessarily. We outline integration tiers, starting from low-cost APIs to enterprise-grade solutions.</p>','full_html','course',31,NULL,3,1),
(45,'en','How long does this course take?','<p>The standard pace requires about 4-6 hours to complete, yielding immediately actionable insights.</p>','full_html','course',31,NULL,4,1),
(46,'en','What is AI Knowledge Management?','<p>It relies on AI to index, organize, and rapidly retrieve internal company documents and intranet data.</p>','full_html','course',32,NULL,0,1),
(47,'en','Does this cover team collaboration tools?','<p>Yes, we analyze AI features within platforms like Slack, Microsoft Teams, and Notion.</p>','full_html','course',32,NULL,1,1),
(48,'en','How secure is internal data with AI?','<p>We extensively cover Private AI Models and data-sharing constraints to guarantee confidentiality.</p>','full_html','course',32,NULL,2,1),
(49,'en','Can I build an internal AI Wiki afterwards?','<p>You will be equipped with the architectural knowledge to select vendors and build your own corporate knowledge base.</p>','full_html','course',32,NULL,3,1),
(50,'en','Will this knowledge become outdated?','<p>No. Knowledge management philosophy is permanent; only the underlying software tools evolve.</p>','full_html','course',32,NULL,4,1),
(51,'en','Is SQL knowledge required?','<p>Not at all. The focus is on using natural language AI tools to process data without writing code.</p>','full_html','course',33,NULL,0,1),
(52,'en','How does BI differ from AI Analytics?','<p>Traditional BI reports on the past. AI Analytics emphasizes Predictive Analytics—forecasting what comes next.</p>','full_html','course',33,NULL,1,1),
(53,'en','Are PowerBI or Tableau covered?','<p>We provide an overview of both, focusing deeply on their recently integrated AI copilot features.</p>','full_html','course',33,NULL,2,1),
(54,'en','Can I analyze my own sales data?','<p>Yes, internal sales data analysis is a primary use case threaded throughout the curriculum.</p>','full_html','course',33,NULL,3,1),
(55,'en','Do I need my own data to practice?','<p>No, we provide rich dummy datasets (thousands of rows) for risk-free, hands-on learning.</p>','full_html','course',33,NULL,4,1),
(56,'en','Is this for IT pros or Management?','<p>The curriculum is tailored to give executives and decision-makers a high-level view of cyber risk.</p>','full_html','course',34,NULL,0,1),
(57,'en','How does AI prevent cyber attacks?','<p>Through real-time anomaly detection and automated behavioral pattern analysis of potential hackers.</p>','full_html','course',34,NULL,1,1),
(58,'en','What types of security are covered?','<p>We explore Cloud Security, Network Defense, and Endpoint Protection strategies within an AI context.</p>','full_html','course',34,NULL,2,1),
(59,'en','Do hackers use AI too?','<p>Yes. An entire chapter is designated to understanding AI-Driven Attacks so you can prepare defenses.</p>','full_html','course',34,NULL,3,1),
(60,'en','Does this align with ISO security standards?','<p>It implicitly applies the risk-management philosophy central to international standards like ISO 27001.</p>','full_html','course',34,NULL,4,1),
(61,'en','What is meant by Data Fundamentals?','<p>It refers to the foundational data architecture required to train Large Language Models (LLMs). Bad data equals useless AI.</p>','full_html','course',35,NULL,0,1),
(62,'en','Does this involve complex math?','<p>No, the course is purely focused on architectural systems thinking and data governance protocols.</p>','full_html','course',35,NULL,1,1),
(63,'en','Data Lake vs. Data Warehouse?','<p>We break down the pros and cons of both, helping you decide which fits your AI model roadmap.</p>','full_html','course',35,NULL,2,1),
(64,'en','Is purchasing third-party data covered?','<p>Yes, evaluating and vetting external data vendors is a critical skill taught in the course.</p>','full_html','course',35,NULL,3,1),
(65,'en','Are visual learning aids provided?','<p>Absolutely. We utilize highly intuitive data architecture diagrams to simplify complex backend concepts.</p>','full_html','course',35,NULL,4,1),
(66,'en','How long does data prep take in AI projects?','<p>It typically consumes 70-80% of project time. This course teaches you how to optimize that phase.</p>','full_html','course',36,NULL,0,1),
(67,'en','Is Data Cleaning covered?','<p>Data Cleaning is fundamentally the core of this course, including handling missing values and noise reduction.</p>','full_html','course',36,NULL,1,1),
(68,'en','Is the curriculum theoretical or practical?','<p>It\'s a balanced 50/50 approach, providing theoretical methodology alongside actionable data classification templates.</p>','full_html','course',36,NULL,2,1),
(69,'en','Will we work with image or text data?','<p>The primary focus is on Tabular and Text data, which drive most traditional enterprise transformations.</p>','full_html','course',36,NULL,3,1),
(70,'en','Are there automated AI cleaning tools?','<p>Yes, we will explore specialized cloud-based engines that automate data sanitization workflows.</p>','full_html','course',36,NULL,4,1),
(71,'en','Where does Data Culture begin?','<p>It must start at the absolute top executive level. We teach strategies to cascade this culture downward.</p>','full_html','course',37,NULL,0,1),
(72,'en','How do we handle employee resistance?','<p>We utilize Change Management exercises to shift teams away from emotion-based reporting to data-backed decisions.</p>','full_html','course',37,NULL,1,1),
(73,'en','How is a successful data culture measured?','<p>Through increased productivity and the readiness of staff to query hard metrics during standard meetings.</p>','full_html','course',37,NULL,2,1),
(74,'en','How should internal training proceed?','<p>Leadership will be provided with sample training workflows in the practical application module.</p>','full_html','course',37,NULL,3,1),
(75,'en','Why does culture impact AI success?','<p>Because if employees input flawed data, the AI model will forecast entirely incorrect conclusions (Garbage In, Garbage Out).</p>','full_html','course',37,NULL,4,1),
(76,'en','Do I need to learn AWS, Google Cloud, or Azure?','<p>We will provide high-level overviews of all three major platforms and their respective native AI APIs.</p>','full_html','course',38,NULL,0,1),
(77,'en','Is Cloud AI expensive for a micro-business?','<p>No. You will learn the Pay-As-You-Go model, allowing you to tightly control costs down to the penny.</p>','full_html','course',38,NULL,1,1),
(78,'en','Will I learn how to deploy AI models?','<p>You will learn the conceptual deployment roadmap, but DevOps command-line coding is not required.</p>','full_html','course',38,NULL,2,1),
(79,'en','Should I build an On-Premise server instead?','<p>We provide a detailed On-Premise vs. Cloud comparison so you can definitively answer that question.</p>','full_html','course',38,NULL,3,1),
(80,'en','Is data safe on public clouds?','<p>Standardized IAM governance and strict AI project permissions fully mitigate those common security fears.</p>','full_html','course',38,NULL,4,1),
(81,'en','How does this help with the thousands of tools out there?','<p>It provides a \"Radar\" framework to help you swiftly filter out generic wrappers and identify truly robust software.</p>','full_html','course',39,NULL,0,1),
(82,'en','Will this course become outdated as tools change?','<p>The evaluation philosophy is evergreen. We teach you *how* to choose, rather than just *what* to choose right now.</p>','full_html','course',39,NULL,1,1),
(83,'en','Is a software purchasing checklist provided?','<p>Yes, you will receive a comprehensive Vendor Evaluation Form to use during enterprise software procurement.</p>','full_html','course',39,NULL,2,1),
(84,'en','Open-Source AI vs. Paid SaaS?','<p>It depends on your business. A dedicated lesson covers the strategic \"Make vs. Buy\" assessment.</p>','full_html','course',39,NULL,3,1),
(85,'en','How do I ensure a tool doesn\'t steal my data?','<p>We teach you exactly how to skim Terms of Service (TOS) efficiently regarding AI data training clauses.</p>','full_html','course',39,NULL,4,1),
(86,'en','Which industries are featured in the case studies?','<p>A diverse range including Retail, Healthcare, Real Estate, Financial Services, and Heavy Manufacturing.</p>','full_html','course',40,NULL,0,1),
(87,'en','Are there regional specific examples?','<p>Beyond Silicon Valley Big Tech, we include targeted analyses of digital transformation in agile SMEs.</p>','full_html','course',40,NULL,1,1),
(88,'en','What can we learn from failed projects?','<p>We dissect both massive successes and costly failures so you can internalize vital, expensive lessons for free.</p>','full_html','course',40,NULL,2,1),
(89,'en','Are there interactive simulations?','<p>Yes, practical scenario exercises allow you to outline an AI strategy for a fictional enterprise.</p>','full_html','course',40,NULL,3,1),
(90,'en','Are the analysis documents long and difficult?','<p>No, all case studies have been distilled into visually rich, highly scannable infographics and charts.</p>','full_html','course',40,NULL,4,1),
(91,'en','What exactly is Change Management?','<p>It encompasses the psychology and strategic communication required to calm workforce anxiety regarding AI automation.</p>','full_html','course',41,NULL,0,1),
(92,'en','Why do AI projects usually fail?','<p>Over 70% of failures stem from cultural resistance, not technology. This is why this module is mandatory.</p>','full_html','course',41,NULL,1,1),
(93,'en','How do we encourage natural AI adoption?','<p>By developing embedded Change Agents—internal champions who organically support colleagues in using daily AI tools.</p>','full_html','course',41,NULL,2,1),
(94,'en','How should leadership communicate the change?','<p>We provide an internal communication framework designed to align every department under a unified, unthreatening vision.</p>','full_html','course',41,NULL,3,1),
(95,'en','Should AI be deployed company-wide instantly?','<p>Usually no. The concept of the \"Pilot Project\" (isolated trial runs) is heavily emphasized as the optimal approach.</p>','full_html','course',41,NULL,4,1),
(96,'en','What is the difference between Reskilling and Upskilling?','<p>Upskilling improves current abilities. Reskilling teaches entirely new competencies when AI phases out older jobs.</p>','full_html','course',42,NULL,0,1),
(97,'en','Is this course essential for HR professionals?','<p>Yes, this is an indispensable modernization playbook for any Human Resources Director entering the AI era.</p>','full_html','course',42,NULL,1,1),
(98,'en','What if expedited training is too expensive?','<p>We teach methods to leverage AI itself to train your workforce via cost-effective Microlearning.</p>','full_html','course',42,NULL,2,1),
(99,'en','Which skills are prioritized for the next 3 years?','<p>Prompt Engineering, sophisticated Critical Thinking, and Risk Management of automated systems.</p>','full_html','course',42,NULL,3,1),
(100,'en','How is employee competence evaluated post-training?','<p>It is tangibly measured by KPI growth and the measurable reduction of manual, legacy workflows.</p>','full_html','course',42,NULL,4,1),
(101,'en','What is a Center of Excellence (CoE)?','<p>It is a cross-functional strike team comprised of elite internal talent that dictates AI strategy company-wide.</p>','full_html','course',43,NULL,0,1),
(102,'en','Who belongs on the CoE committee?','<p>Ideally, it includes representation from Data Science, Systems Analysis, Legal Counsel, and Executive IT Leadership.</p>','full_html','course',43,NULL,1,1),
(103,'en','Does a micro-business need a CoE?','<p>Yes, you can deploy a \"Lean CoE\" model consisting of just 2-3 core consultants advising the broader team.</p>','full_html','course',43,NULL,2,1),
(104,'en','What are the main KPIs for a CoE?','<p>The volume of profitable AI initiatives launched, sustainable Cloud integration rates, and internal workflow velocity.</p>','full_html','course',43,NULL,3,1),
(105,'en','Is building this team prohibitively expensive?','<p>The course demonstrates how to blend external vendor expertise with internal staff to dramatically lower overhead costs.</p>','full_html','course',43,NULL,4,1),
(106,'en','Why study the Future of AI now?','<p>To engage in Future Proofing—ensuring you aren\'t rendered obsolete by aggressive, forward-thinking competitors.</p>','full_html','course',44,NULL,0,1),
(107,'en','Is AGI (Artificial General Intelligence) discussed?','<p>Yes, the imminent rise of AGI and Agentic Workflows will fundamentally overhaul the concept of corporate operations.</p>','full_html','course',44,NULL,1,1),
(108,'en','Will traditional business models die?','<p>They will not die, but they will aggressively evolve. This course outlines the 5-to-10-year evolutionary cycle.</p>','full_html','course',44,NULL,2,1),
(109,'en','Could there be another \"AI Winter\"?','<p>We objectively evaluate the potential hurdles of resource taxation and tech bubble corrections.</p>','full_html','course',44,NULL,3,1),
(110,'en','What role does Virtual Reality AI play?','<p>It will become the epicenter of next-generation hyper-interactive M2C (Machine-to-Consumer) business experiences.</p>','full_html','course',44,NULL,4,1),
(111,'en','What are the hottest Emerging AI Trends?','<p>Edge AI (localized computation without constant internet) and Large Action Models (LAMs) that autonomously execute tasks.</p>','full_html','course',45,NULL,0,1),
(112,'en','Is Quantum Machine Learning covered?','<p>The course provides an extremely accessible, baseline summary of Quantum computing specifically tailored for administrators.</p>','full_html','course',45,NULL,1,1),
(113,'en','Can startups survive alongside Google/OpenAI?','<p>Absolutely. The massive trend toward hyper-specialized Small Language Models (SLMs) is the golden era for startups.</p>','full_html','course',45,NULL,2,1),
(114,'en','How do I stay updated daily?','<p>The curriculum includes a curated directory of elite newsletters (like HuggingFace and ArXiv) for continuous self-education.</p>','full_html','course',45,NULL,3,1),
(115,'en','Is the intersection of Web3 and AI analyzed?','<p>Yes, a module details how Blockchain ensures the immutability of training data, effectively combatting DeepFake fraud.</p>','full_html','course',45,NULL,4,1),
(116,'en','What defines the \"Next Wave\" of AI?','<p>It is the transition into deep logical reasoning and autonomous, multi-tasking intelligent systems (Agents).</p>','full_html','course',46,NULL,0,1),
(117,'en','How does a company design a long-term roadmap?','<p>By securing Pristine Data, fortifying legal compliance, and transitioning infrastructure to highly agile Hybrid Clouds.</p>','full_html','course',46,NULL,1,1),
(118,'en','How do Smart Contracts impact legal teams?','<p>They form the basis for Agents negotiating contracts autonomously. You will grasp the fundamentals of Smart Legal AI.</p>','full_html','course',46,NULL,2,1),
(119,'en','What about upcoming regulations in the EU/US?','<p>The EU AI Act will establish global gold standards. Your enterprise must understand it now to ensure preemptive compliance.</p>','full_html','course',46,NULL,3,1),
(120,'en','What is the ultimate lesson of this course?','<p>To abandon rigid, reactionary thinking in favor of building open, modular architectures that effortlessly absorb new tech.</p>','full_html','course',46,NULL,4,1),
(121,'en','What entails the Final AI Roadmap?','<p>It is your capstone project: You will architect a comprehensive, strategic AI execution plan for your actual company.</p>','full_html','course',47,NULL,0,1),
(122,'en','How long should this Roadmap document be?','<p>The course provides a condensed, 30-slide strategic template optimized for immediate Board of Directors presentations.</p>','full_html','course',47,NULL,1,1),
(123,'en','Does AI assist in reviewing my project?','<p>Yes, the AI engine integrated within EverLMS will provide direct, real-time feedback on your strategic thought process.</p>','full_html','course',47,NULL,2,1),
(124,'en','Is financial resource planning included?','<p>Yes, a simulated but highly realistic budget model—tracking current market API costs—is provided for accuracy.</p>','full_html','course',47,NULL,3,1),
(125,'en','What title do I earn upon completion?','<p>You will be awarded the \"AI Business Strategist Master\" certificate, proving your capacity to lead elite digital transformations.</p>','full_html','course',47,NULL,4,1);
INSERT INTO `lms_forum_reply` VALUES
(1,'2d3d27eb-8c52-40cf-8d22-06cf90358cb3',2,1,'<p>I highly recommend using Anaconda for managing your Python environments. It resolves DLL issues easily. Just install Anaconda and run <code>conda install tensorflow</code>.</p>','full_html',NULL,1,1774074316,12),
(2,'d4d67489-d263-445a-b49c-b2858cbade94',2,1,'<p>Also make sure your Python version is compatible (try Python 3.9 or 3.10). Sometimes newer versions lack direct wheel support initially.</p>','full_html',NULL,0,1774074316,8),
(3,'88be6a7e-c0db-45e3-a7c7-86029c2a330e',2,2,'<p>Basic calculus (derivatives, chain rule) and linear algebra (matrix multiplication) are highly recommended to truly understand backpropagation. But you can still follow the coding parts without deep math knowledge.</p>','full_html',NULL,0,1774074316,7),
(4,'1b00b1f5-409c-42ec-b63e-372eb851fe5c',2,3,'<p>A sentiment analysis model for movie reviews or Twitter data is a classic first project. You can easily find datasets on Kaggle.</p>','full_html',NULL,0,1774074316,0),
(5,'f89be071-a5d9-43f6-bc25-9cba5a4781d6',2,3,'<p>Try building a simple rule-based chatbot or a resume parser! Both are very practical.</p>','full_html',NULL,0,1774074316,4),
(6,'93281f68-2614-4da0-aca9-9aed0ce358f8',2,4,'<p>OpenCV is great for standard image processing (resizing, filters, contours). But for actual object detection, you definitely want to use pre-trained deep learning models via TorchVision (like YOLO or Faster R-CNN).</p>','full_html',NULL,1,1774074316,11),
(7,'d019b88a-0c2d-442c-b82a-29e9d3334a6e',2,5,'<p>I highly recommend using Anaconda for managing your Python environments. It resolves DLL issues easily. Just install Anaconda and run <code>conda install tensorflow</code>.</p>','full_html',NULL,1,1774100468,4),
(8,'ed7b9112-1914-48a0-9cd8-e14e4062fb51',2,5,'<p>Also make sure your Python version is compatible (try Python 3.9 or 3.10). Sometimes newer versions lack direct wheel support initially.</p>','full_html',NULL,0,1774100468,6),
(9,'44a21593-c42e-4f7f-b1de-896245f57be1',2,6,'<p>Basic calculus (derivatives, chain rule) and linear algebra (matrix multiplication) are highly recommended to truly understand backpropagation. But you can still follow the coding parts without deep math knowledge.</p>','full_html',NULL,0,1774100468,3),
(10,'2e39d20b-9739-46c3-9623-a9bf0a89cd08',2,7,'<p>A sentiment analysis model for movie reviews or Twitter data is a classic first project. You can easily find datasets on Kaggle.</p>','full_html',NULL,0,1774100468,6),
(11,'9a9c1244-65e2-40f9-ad86-1f9f710cbb6d',2,7,'<p>Try building a simple rule-based chatbot or a resume parser! Both are very practical.</p>','full_html',NULL,0,1774100468,9),
(12,'a68d58d4-42f3-4844-9454-6a52043d0af2',2,8,'<p>OpenCV is great for standard image processing (resizing, filters, contours). But for actual object detection, you definitely want to use pre-trained deep learning models via TorchVision (like YOLO or Faster R-CNN).</p>','full_html',NULL,1,1774100468,7),
(13,'0f781e1b-8558-4be8-b05f-91577b252159',3,9,'Discussion topic: How to set up autonomous AI agents so they can read newly pushed code, perform logical reasoning, and automatically generate/update corresponding test cases directly within the CI/CD flow.','basic_html',NULL,1,1774259758,0),
(14,'cabe3a58-6608-4a8c-9bb1-ed8581672425',3,6,'Basic calculus (derivatives, chain rule) and linear algebra (matrix multiplication) are highly recommended to truly understand backpropagation. But you can still follow the coding parts without deep math knowledge.','basic_html',NULL,0,1774260328,0),
(15,'6cd16a80-9b74-44e5-bc8f-91349b333fb3',3,10,'Honestly, trusting AI 100% for production unit tests right now is a recipe for disaster, but completely ignoring it means you\'re leaving a massive amount of time on the table.\r\n\r\nAfter heavily integrating AI into my workflow over the last year, here is the reality of where the tech actually sits:\r\n\r\nWhere AI is absolute magic:\r\n\r\nBoilerplate &amp; Mocking: If you are working with complex web architectures or heavy CMS platforms (like Drupal), setting up the mocks, fake dependencies, and fixtures is soul-crushing work. AI tools are fantastic at generating this scaffolding instantly.\r\n\r\nThe \"Happy Path\": It is incredibly fast at writing the baseline tests for standard CRUD operations and straightforward functions.\r\n\r\nTackling Legacy Code: Pointing an AI agent at a massive, undocumented legacy file and asking it to generate a baseline safety net of tests is a game-changer before a big refactor.\r\n\r\nWhere AI falls flat on its face:\r\n\r\nDomain Logic &amp; \"The Why\": AI doesn\'t understand your business rules. It will often write tests that pass based on what the code currently does, even if what the code does is wrong.\r\n\r\nHallucinating Assertions: I\'ve caught AI tools confidently asserting against methods or properties that don\'t even exist in the codebase, simply because they \"looked right\" contextually.\r\n\r\nEdge Cases: Unless you are a master at prompt engineering, AI rarely thinks of the weird, obscure edge cases that actually break production.x','basic_html',NULL,0,1774261156,0),
(16,'a117f8e6-de17-488e-854d-13e7eea996da',3,10,'simply because they \"looked right\" contextually. Edge Cases: Unless you are a master at prompt engineering, AI rarely thinks of the weird, obscure edge cases that actually break production.xxx','basic_html',NULL,0,1774262559,0),
(21,'b52facf1-8ae7-4912-a638-c1fa531bff1d',8,10,'<blockquote><p><strong>@Lisa Nguyen wrote:</strong><br>simply because they \"looked right\" contextually. Edge Cases: Unless you are a master at prompt engineering, AI rarely thinks of the weird, obscure edge cases that actually break production.xxx</p></blockquote><p>hello&nbsp;</p>','basic_html',NULL,0,1774268840,0),
(22,'ece3edbb-6ce2-4aad-84a9-b69d77db7ee0',8,10,'<img data-entity-uuid=\"1e9fd65d-a41f-4b3b-bbd0-d0d37d5ef1c8\" data-entity-type=\"file\" src=\"/sites/default/files/inline-images/BlackMarble_2016_928m_s_america_m_labeled_0.png\" height=\"368\" width=\"655\">','basic_html',NULL,0,1774268892,0),
(23,'9a3fd0e0-95e4-4fef-8637-270bcb4b6bb4',3,10,'<p>good</p>','basic_html',NULL,0,1774268922,0);
