(1,'dd2a0bb3-344f-471d-b9a0-a16b90815ae5',1,'Need help with Python environment setup for AI','<p>Hi everyone, I am struggling to install TensorFlow on my Windows machine. Keep getting DLL errors. Can someone guide me on the best way to set up the environment for the \'Machine Learning in Python\' course?</p>','full_html',NULL,2,0,0,1774074316,1774074316,49,1774074316,45,1),
(2,'89eac3a6-93c6-40d3-8659-455f81bada7c',1,'What are the prerequisites for Deep Learning Fundamentals?','<p>Do I need strong calculus skills to succeed in the deep learning course? Should I revise my math before starting the chapters on backpropagation?</p>','full_html',NULL,1,0,0,1774074316,1774238970,50,1774074316,114,0),
(3,'991a9f93-6284-4be5-bf9d-2ba96ab5dbba',1,'Share your first NLP project ideas here!','<p>I just finished the NLP basics module. I want to build something fun outside of the course exercises. What are some good beginner projects?</p>','full_html',NULL,2,0,0,1774074316,1774350520,51,1774074316,205,0),
(4,'ba126bd4-b1cf-4937-86d7-7dfd3194e780',1,'Computer Vision: OpenCV vs PyTorch TorchVision?','<p>For an upcoming project detecting objects in a video feed, should I stick strictly to OpenCV or use TorchVision pre-trained models? What\'s the industry standard for this use case?</p>','full_html',NULL,1,0,0,1774074316,1774074316,52,1774074316,89,1),
