(6,'66bf5c83-cdd8-4550-a060-1a09d4353200',1,'What are the prerequisites for Deep Learning Fundamentals?','<p>Do I need strong calculus skills to succeed in the deep learning course? Should I revise my math before starting the chapters on backpropagation?</p>','full_html',NULL,2,0,0,1774100468,1774357260,50,1774260328,126,0),
(7,'15ea3b37-3075-47f6-9e75-446b2dd97ba3',1,'Share your first NLP project ideas here!','<p>I just finished the NLP basics module. I want to build something fun outside of the course exercises. What are some good beginner projects?</p>','full_html',NULL,2,0,0,1774100468,1774263597,51,1774100468,207,0),
(8,'b954b154-e600-4048-a91e-428f2b563456',1,'Computer Vision: OpenCV vs PyTorch TorchVision?','<p>For an upcoming project detecting objects in a video feed, should I stick strictly to OpenCV or use TorchVision pre-trained models? What\'s the industry standard for this use case?</p>','full_html',NULL,1,0,0,1774100468,1774362785,52,1774100468,94,1),
(9,'671a8e80-24ef-453f-89ef-2f2defc2dd02',3,'Integrating AI Agents into CI/CD Processes to Automate Unit Test Writing and Maintenance: Guidelines and Best Practices','Discussion topic: How to set up autonomous AI agents so they can read newly pushed code, perform logical reasoning, and automatically generate/update corresponding test cases directly within the CI/CD flow.','basic_html',23,1,0,0,1774239122,1774362770,50,1774259758,19,1),
(10,'307dd6fb-1761-49db-9193-9249449aadc3',8,'Reality Check: Is anyone actually trusting AI to handle all their Unit Tests in production?','Discussion Points: Discussing the actual quality of AI-generated test cases. Comparing the marketing promises of AI tools against the reality of \"hallucinated\" assertions, false positives, and maintenance headaches in real-world projects.','basic_html',NULL,9,0,0,1774261074,1774587223,NULL,1774268922,84,0);
